<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="1CH" style="id">1NGA - Bible en mashi du Congo</book>
  <para style="toc3">1 Nga</para>
  <para style="toc2">1 Nganîro</para>
  <para style="toc1">ECITABU CIRHANZI C’ENGANÎRO</para>
  <para style="h">1 Enganîro</para>
  <para style="mt1">ECITABU CIRHANZI C’ENGANÎRO</para>
  <para style="imt2">Enshokolezi</para>
  <para style="ip">Ebitabu bibirhi by’enganîro càli citabu ciguma. Bishambâla kulusha emyanzi ya Israheli eshambîrwe omu bitabu bya Samweli n’eby’Abâmi. Cikwone owabiyandikaga agwêrhe omuhigo gwâge gwâge: okumanyîsa obwâmi bwa Nnâmahanga en’igulu, bwâmi bwarhengaga omu bwimâna bw’enyanya bwenêne. Daudi, Ezekiyasi na Yoziyasi, abo bâmi bakulu bacîhanganyire bwenêne okuyinjihya aka-Nyamuzinda. Mwâmi Daudi ye wali ntwâli nkulu muli abo bâmi boshi. Nnâmahanga ashubijira bo naye endagâno ajiraga omu mango ga mîra n’abantu bashinganyanya b’omu Israheli. Ecitabu cirhanzi c’Enganîro cimanyîsa iburha lya Yuda, shakulûza wa Daudi. Na kandi ciderha abana ba Daudi yêne, omulala gwa Bene Levi, abakola omu kà-Nyamuzinda n’omulala gwa bene Yeruzalemu (<char style="xt"><ref loc="1CH 1-9">1 Nga 1—9</ref></char>). Omu myanzi y’Akalamo ka Daudi (<char style="xt"><ref loc="1CH 10-29">1 Nga 10—29</ref></char>), amabî gâge gali mafulike. Obulêbi bwa Natani bwajirikana (<char style="xt"><ref loc="1CH 17">1 Nga 17</ref></char>), n’emikolo y’okuyinjihya oburherekêre bw’omu Kà-Nyamuzinda nayo yayunjula (<char style="xt"><ref loc="1CH 13">1 Nga 13</ref>; <ref loc="1CH 15">15</ref>; <ref loc="1CH 16">16</ref></char>). Amango ga Salomoni, eco citabu ciderha bwenêne kurhi ayûbakaga akà-Nyamuzinda na kurhi Nyamuzinda alagânanaga n’olubaga lwage (<char style="xt"><ref loc="2CH 1-9">2 Nga 1—9</ref></char>). Enyuma ly’okuberulukana kw’amashanja g’idako, ifo obwo, owayandikaga eco citabu acîsêza okumanyîsa emyanzi y’abantu b’eyo munda bone. Abâmi batwîrwa emmanja nk’oku ngasi muguma ashimbire olwiganyo lwa Daudi (<char style="xt"><ref loc="2CH 10-36">2 Nga 10—36</ref></char>). Abâmi babî basherêza byoshi; na buzinda bwa nyuma ecishagala c’e Yeruzalemu calibuzibwa n’abashombanyi. Ebi binwa biri bya kuyigîriza abantu oku luli lw’iragi olubaga, lwayunjulirana n’obwêmêre kuli Nyamuzinda. Ebinwa bibirhi ebyo bitabu bibâmwo bibà binja bwenêne oku bantu ba ngasi mango:</para>
  <para style="ip">1. Kuli kwa bulagîrire bwenêne okurhindibukira ebiyêrekîre burhanzi iroho.</para>
  <para style="ip">2. Nyamuzinda orhegeka igulu lyoshi. Rhurhegesirwe nîrhu rhukukengêre omu malibuko n’omu mbaka zirhu z’ensiku z’ene.</para>
  <para style="iot">EBIRI OMU CITABU CIRHANZI C'ENGANÎRO</para>
  <para style="io1">1. Entondekanye y’emilala: cigabi <char style="ior"><ref loc="1CH 1:1-10:14">1, 1—10, 14</ref></char></para>
  <para style="io1">2. Obwâmi bwa Daudi: Owarhangiraga oburherekêre: cigabi <char style="ior"><ref loc="1CH 11:1-29:30">11, 1—29, 30</ref></char></para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="1CH 1"/>
  <para style="ms1">I. Olukalaba lw’amâburhwa kurhenga Adamu kuhika kuli Daudi</para>
  <para style="s1">Olukalaba lw’amâburhwa oku gashimbìne kurhenga Adamu kuhika Ezau</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CH 1:1"/>Adamu aburha Seti; Seti aburha Enoshi, <verse eid="1CH 1:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CH 1:2"/>Enosi aburha Kenani, Kenani aburha Mahalaleli, Mahalaleli aburha Yeredi, <verse eid="1CH 1:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CH 1:3"/>Yeredi aburha Henoki, Henoki aburha Metushalem, Metushalem aburha Lameki, <verse eid="1CH 1:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CH 1:4"/>Lameki aburha Nûhu. Nûhu aburha Semu, Kamu na Yafeti.<verse eid="1CH 1:4"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Bene-Yafeti</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CH 1:5"/>Alaga bagala ba Yafeti: Gomeri, Magogi, Madayi, Yavani, Tuvani, Tubali, Mesheki na Tirasi. <verse eid="1CH 1:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CH 1:6"/>Bene Gomeri bo: Askenazi, Difati na Togarma. <verse eid="1CH 1:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CH 1:7"/>Bagala ba Yavani, bo: Elisha, Tarsisi, Kiti na Rodanimu.<verse eid="1CH 1:7"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Bene-Kamu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CH 1:8"/>Alaga bagala ba Kamu, bo: Kushi, Misrayimu, Puti na Kanâni; <verse eid="1CH 1:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CH 1:9"/>Bagala ba Kushi, bo: Seba, Havila, Sabta, Ragma na Sabteka, bagala ba Rama, bo: Saba na Dedani. <verse eid="1CH 1:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CH 1:10"/>Kushi naye aburha Nimrodi, owabâga mwâmi-hanga murhanzirhazi wa hano igulu. <verse eid="1CH 1:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CH 1:11"/>Misrayimu ye wali shakulûza w’abantu b’e Ludi, Anemi, Lehabi n’ab’e Nafutu, <verse eid="1CH 1:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CH 1:12"/>w’abantu b’e Patrosi, b’e Kaslu n’e Kafutori, lwo lunda Abafilistini barhengaga. <verse eid="1CH 1:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CH 1:13"/>Kanâni aburha Sidoni, lubere lwâge, na Heti, <verse eid="1CH 1:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CH 1:14"/>na shakulûza w’Abayebusi, w’Abamoriti, Abagirgashi, <verse eid="1CH 1:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CH 1:15"/>Abahiti, Abaarki, Abasini, <verse eid="1CH 1:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CH 1:16"/>Abarvadi, Abasemari n’Abahamati.<verse eid="1CH 1:16"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Bene-Semu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CH 1:17"/>Bagala ba Semu, bo: Elamu, Asûru, Arpaksadi, Ludi na Aramu. Bagala ba Aramu, bo: Utsi, Huli, Geteri na Mesheki. <verse eid="1CH 1:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CH 1:18"/>Arpaksadi aburha Selahi, na Selahi aburha Eberi. <verse eid="1CH 1:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CH 1:19"/>Eberi aburha bâna babirhi; omurhanzi izîno lyâge ye wali Pelegi, kwo kuderha «Lugabanyo», bulya omu mango gâge lyo olubaga lw’en’igulu lwacigabagamwo; omulumuna izîno lyâge ye wali Yoktani. <verse eid="1CH 1:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CH 1:20"/>Yoktani aburha Almodadi, Shelefu na Hasarmaveti, na Yera, <verse eid="1CH 1:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CH 1:21"/>Hadoramu, Uzali, Dikla, <verse eid="1CH 1:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CH 1:22"/>Ebali, Abimayeli, Seba, <verse eid="1CH 1:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CH 1:23"/>Ofiri, Havila, na Yobabu. Abo boshi bo bagala ba Yoktani.<verse eid="1CH 1:23"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Kurhenga Semu kuhika kuli Abrahamu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CH 1:24"/>Semu aburha Arpaksadi, Arpaksadi aburha Selahi, <verse eid="1CH 1:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1CH 1:25"/>Sela aburha Eberi, Eberi aburha Pelegi, Pelegi aburha Reu, <verse eid="1CH 1:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1CH 1:26"/>Reu aburha Serugi, Serugi aburha Nahori, Nahori aburha Tera, <verse eid="1CH 1:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1CH 1:27"/>Tera aburha Abramu, ye wayishirihâbwa izîno lya Abrahamu. <verse eid="1CH 1:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1CH 1:28"/>Bagala ba Abrahamu bo Izaki na Ismaeli. <verse eid="1CH 1:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1CH 1:29"/>Alaga olukalaba lw’amâburhwa gâbo:</para>
  <para style="s1" vid="1CH 1:29">Bene-lsmaeli</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1CH 1:29">Olubere lwa Ismaeli ye wali Nebayoti, ahirakwo Kedari, Abdeli, Mibusamu, <verse eid="1CH 1:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1CH 1:30"/>Mishma, Duma, Masa, Hadadi, Tema, <verse eid="1CH 1:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1CH 1:31"/>Yeturi, Nafishi na Kedma. Bo bagala ba Ismaeli abo. <verse eid="1CH 1:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="1CH 1:32"/>Ketura, mukazi wa kabirhi wa Abrahamu, anaciburha Zimurani, Yokshani, Medani, Madiyani, Yishbaki na Shuwahi. Bagala ba Yokshani, bo: Saba na Dedani. <verse eid="1CH 1:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="1CH 1:33"/>Bagala ba Madiyani, bo: Efa, Eferi, Hanoki, Abida na Elda. Abo boshi lyo iburha lya Ketura.<verse eid="1CH 1:33"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Izaki na Ezau</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="1CH 1:34"/>Abrahamu anaciburha Izaki. Bagala ba Izaki, bo Ezau na Ismaheli. <verse eid="1CH 1:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="1CH 1:35"/>Bagala ba Ezau, bo: Elifazi, Reweli, Yeushi, Yalamu na Kora. <verse eid="1CH 1:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="1CH 1:36"/>Bagala ba Elifazi, bo: Temani, Omari, Sefi, Gatamu, Kenazi, Timna na Amaleki. <verse eid="1CH 1:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="1CH 1:37"/>Bene Reweli, bo: Nahati, Zera, Shama na Miza. <verse eid="1CH 1:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="1CH 1:38"/>Bagala ba Seyiri, bo: Lotani, Shobali, Sibeoni (ye wali îshe wa Ana na shakulu wa Dishoni), Eseri na Dishani. <verse eid="1CH 1:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="1CH 1:39"/>Bagala ba Lotani, bo: Hori na Homami (Lotani agwêrhe mwâli wâbo ye Timna). <verse eid="1CH 1:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="1CH 1:40"/>Bagala ba Shobali, bo: Aliyani, Manahati, Ebali, Shefi na Onamu. Bagala ba Sibeoni bo: Aya na Ana. <verse eid="1CH 1:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="1CH 1:41"/>Mugala wa Ana ye Dishoni; bagala ba Dishoni, bo Hamurani, Eshebani, Yitrani na Kerani. <verse eid="1CH 1:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="1CH 1:42"/>Bagala ba Eseri, bo: Bilahani, Zaavani, Yaakani. Bagala ba Dishoni bo: Utsi na Arani.<verse eid="1CH 1:42"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Abâmi n’abarhambo b’obûko bwa Edomu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="1CH 1:43"/>Abà bakulikîre bo bâmi bayîmire omu cihugo ca Edomu embere abâmi barhangire okuyîma omu Israheli: Bela, mugala wa Beori; ecishagala câge càderhagwa Dinhaba. <verse eid="1CH 1:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="1CH 1:44"/>Oyo Bela erhi àyûsifà, Yobabu àyima ahâli hâge: Yobabu mugala wa Zeraha w’e Bosra. <verse eid="1CH 1:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="1CH 1:45"/>Yobabu àfà na Hushamu warhengaga omu cihugo c’Abatemani ayîma omu byâge. <verse eid="1CH 1:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="1CH 1:46"/>Hushamu erhi àyâsifà, Hadadi mugala wa Bedadi ayîma ahâli hâge. Ye wahimaga Abamadiyani omu irungu lya Mowabu. Ecishagala câge càderhagwa Aviti. <verse eid="1CH 1:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="1CH 1:47"/>Hadadi naye afà. Samla w’e Masreka ayîma omu byâge. <verse eid="1CH 1:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="1CH 1:48"/>Samla erhi afà, Shaulu w’e Rohoboti-han-Nahari ayîma omu byâge. <verse eid="1CH 1:48"/><verse number="49" style="v" sid="1CH 1:49"/>Shaulu afà, Baal-Hamani, mugala wa Akbori ayîma ahâli hâge. <verse eid="1CH 1:49"/><verse number="50" style="v" sid="1CH 1:50"/>Baal-Hamani àfà, Hadadi ayîma omu byâge. Ecishagala câge caderhagwa Payi. Mukâge izîno lyâge ye wali Mehetabeyeli, mwâli wa Matredi, mwinjikulu wa Me-Zahabu. <verse eid="1CH 1:50"/><verse number="51" style="v" sid="1CH 1:51"/>Erhi mwâmi Hadedi àyâsifà, ecihugo ca Edomu cakazirhegekwa n’abakulu b’amûko. Alaga amazîno gâbo: Timna, Alva, Yeteti, <verse eid="1CH 1:51"/><verse number="52" style="v" sid="1CH 1:52"/>Oholibama, Ela, Pinoni, <verse eid="1CH 1:52"/><verse number="53" style="v" sid="1CH 1:53"/>Kenazi. Temazi, Temani, Mibsari, <verse eid="1CH 1:53"/><verse number="54" style="v" sid="1CH 1:54"/>Magdiyeli na Iramu. Abo bo bâli barhambo b’amûko g’e Edomu.<verse eid="1CH 1:54"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1CH 1"/>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="1CH 2"/>
  <para style="s1">Abâna ba Yûda mugala wa Yakôbo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CH 2:1"/>Aga go mazîno g’abâna ba Yakôbo, ye naligi Israheli obwo: Rubeni, Simoni, Levi, Yûda, Isakari, Zabuloni, <verse eid="1CH 2:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CH 2:2"/>Dani, Yozefu, Benyamini, Nefutali, Gadi na Aseri. <verse eid="1CH 2:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CH 2:3"/>Yûda àburha bâna basharhu kuli mukâge w’omunya-Kanâni, mwâli wa Shuwa. Bo: Eri, Onani na Shela. Eri yo yali nfula, agayisa Nyakasane bwenêne kwarhuma amuyîrha. <verse eid="1CH 2:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CH 2:4"/>Buzinda bwenêne, Yûda ashubiburha bâna babirhi kuli nwâli-kazi wâge Tamara, bo Peresi na Zera. Kwo kuderha oku abusire bagala barhanu. <verse eid="1CH 2:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CH 2:5"/>Bagala ba Peresi, bo: Hesroni na Hamuli. <verse eid="1CH 2:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CH 2:6"/>Bagala ba Zera, bo: Zimri, Etani, Hemani, Kalkoli na Dara. Boshi bâna barhanu. <verse eid="1CH 2:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CH 2:7"/>Mugala wa Karmi ye Akari, ye walêrhaga obuhanya omu Israheli erhi acîfulikira ecigabi c’eminyago y’oku matabâro càligoshôlirwe Nyamuzinda. <verse eid="1CH 2:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CH 2:8"/>Mugala wa Etani ye Azariya.<verse eid="1CH 2:8"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Ecisiki ca Daudi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CH 2:9"/>Bagala ba Hesroni, bo: Yerameyeli, Ramu, Kelubayi. <verse eid="1CH 2:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CH 2:10"/>Ramu aburha Abinadabu, Aminadabu anaciburha Nashoni, ye murhambo w’omulala gwa Yûda. <verse eid="1CH 2:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CH 2:11"/>Nashoni anaciburha Salma, naye Salma aburha Boozi. <verse eid="1CH 2:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CH 2:12"/>Boozi anaciburha Obedi, naye Obedi aburha Yese. <verse eid="1CH 2:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CH 2:13"/>Yese aburha Eliyabu, lwo lubere lwâge, owa kabirhi Abinadabu, Shimeya wa kasharhu, <verse eid="1CH 2:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CH 2:14"/>Netaneyeli wa kani, <verse eid="1CH 2:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CH 2:15"/>Radayi wa karhanu, owa kali ndarhu Osema, na Daudi wa kali nda. <verse eid="1CH 2:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CH 2:16"/>Bâli bâbo bo Seruya na Abigayili. Abâna ba Seruya: Abisayi, Yowabu na Asaheli, boshi bantu basharhu. <verse eid="1CH 2:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CH 2:17"/>Abigayili anaciburha Amasa, îshe ye wali Yeteri w’e Ismaheli.<verse eid="1CH 2:17"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Kalebu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CH 2:18"/>Kalebu, muguma wa Hesroni, abusire bâna bâni kuli mukâge Azuba: munyere muguma, ye Yeriyoti, na barhabana basharhu, Yesheri, Shobabu na Ardoni. <verse eid="1CH 2:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CH 2:19"/>Erhi Azuba afà, Kalebu arhôla omukazi ye Efrata, amuburhira omugala Huri. <verse eid="1CH 2:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CH 2:20"/>Huri anaciburha Uri, na Uri aburha Besaleli. <verse eid="1CH 2:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CH 2:21"/>Hesroni erhi ajira myâka makumi gali ndarhu abusirwe, ayanka omunyere, mwâli wa Makiri, îshe wa Galadi, amuburhira omugala Segubu. <verse eid="1CH 2:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CH 2:22"/>Segubu naye anaciburha Yairi, ye warhegekaga bishagala makumi abirhi na bisharhu by’ecihugo c’e Gadi. <verse eid="1CH 2:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CH 2:23"/>Ci kwône abâmi b’e Geshuri n’e Aramu banyaga ebishagala bya Yairi, haguma n’ecishagala ca Kenati n’ebindi bishagala by’eburhambi, byoshi haguma mirhundu makumi gali ndarhu. Ababiyûbakagamwo boshi bâli b’oku bûko bwa Makiri, îshe wa Gadi. <verse eid="1CH 2:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CH 2:24"/>Erhi Hesroni àfà, àligwêrhe omukazi ye Abiya, Kalebu ashubiyanka Efrata, amuburhira omugala ye Ashuru, ye Cûbaka w’e Tekowa.<verse eid="1CH 2:24"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yerameli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="1CH 2:25"/>Yerameli, lubere lwa Hesroni, naye aburha abàge bâna: Ramu lwo lubere lwâge, ahirakwo Buna, na Oreni, Osemu, Ahiya. <verse eid="1CH 2:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1CH 2:26"/>Yerameli arhôla omukazi wa kabirhi, izîno lyâge ye Atara, ye wali nnina wa Onamu. <verse eid="1CH 2:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1CH 2:27"/>Bagala ba Ramu lubere lwa Yerameli, bo: Maasi, Yamini na Ekeri; <verse eid="1CH 2:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1CH 2:28"/>Bagala ba Onamu, bo: Shamayi na Yada. Bagala ba Shamayi, bo: Nadabu na Abishuru. <verse eid="1CH 2:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1CH 2:29"/>Mukà Abishuru ye wali Abihayili. Amuburhira Abani na Molidi. <verse eid="1CH 2:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1CH 2:30"/>Bagala ha Nadabu, bo: Seledi na Efrayimu. Seledi afà buzira mwâna. <verse eid="1CH 2:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1CH 2:31"/>Mugala wa Efrayimu ye wali Yisheyi. Mugala Yisheyi ye wali Sheshani. Mugala wa Sheshani ye wali Ahalayi. <verse eid="1CH 2:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="1CH 2:32"/>Bagala ba Yada, mulumuna wa Shamayi, bo: Yeteri na Yônatani. Yeteri afà buzira mwâna. <verse eid="1CH 2:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="1CH 2:33"/>Bagala ba Yônatani, bo: Peleti na Zaza. Abo bo bâli bâna ba Yerameeli. <verse eid="1CH 2:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="1CH 2:34"/>Sheshani arhaburhaga mwâna-rhabana, ci banyere bônene. Agwêrhe mujà muguma warhengaga e Mîsiri, izîno lyâge Yara. <verse eid="1CH 2:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="1CH 2:35"/>Lêro Sheshani anacihà oyo mujà Yara omwâli mpu abè mukâge. Amuburhira Atayi. <verse eid="1CH 2:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="1CH 2:36"/>Atayi anaciburha Natani; Natani aburha Zabadi. <verse eid="1CH 2:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="1CH 2:37"/>Zabadi anaciburha Eflali; Eflali aburha Obedi. <verse eid="1CH 2:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="1CH 2:38"/>Obedi aburha Yehu, Yehu anaciburha Azariya; <verse eid="1CH 2:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="1CH 2:39"/>Azariya aburha Helesi; Helesi anaciburha Eleyasa; <verse eid="1CH 2:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="1CH 2:40"/>Eleyasa aburha Sismayi; Sismayi anaciburha Shalumu; <verse eid="1CH 2:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="1CH 2:41"/>Shalumu aburha Yekamiya; Yekamiya aburha Elishamaʿ.<verse eid="1CH 2:41"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Abandi bagala ba Kalebu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="1CH 2:42"/>Abâna ba Kalebu, mwene wâbo Yerameli: omurhanzi ye Mesha, y’îshe wa Zifu. Naye aburha owâge mwâna ye Maresha, naye ye wali îshe wa Hebroni. <verse eid="1CH 2:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="1CH 2:43"/>Bagala ba Hebroni, bo: Kora, Tapuwa, Rekemi na Shema. <verse eid="1CH 2:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="1CH 2:44"/>Shema aburha Rahamu, naye Rahamu aburha Yorkowamu. Rekemi anaciburha Shamayi, <verse eid="1CH 2:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="1CH 2:45"/>Shamayi aburha Maoni, na Maoni aburha Bet-Suri. <verse eid="1CH 2:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="1CH 2:46"/>Kalebu àgwêrhe mukâge wa kabirhi, ye Efa. amuburhira Harani, Mosa na Gazezi. <verse eid="1CH 2:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="1CH 2:47"/>Bagala ba Yohdayi, bo: Regemu, Yotamu, Geshani, Peleti, Efa na Shaafu. <verse eid="1CH 2:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="1CH 2:48"/>Kalebu ayanka owundi mukazi, ye Maaka, amuburhira Sheberi na Tirhana. <verse eid="1CH 2:48"/><verse number="49" style="v" sid="1CH 2:49"/>Buzinda kandi ashubiburha omugala Shaafu, naye ye îshe wa Madmanaa Sheva, naye Sheva ye îshe wa Makbena na Gibeya. Kandi Kalebu abusire omwânanyere, izîno Iyâge ye Aksa. <verse eid="1CH 2:49"/><verse number="50" style="v" sid="1CH 2:50"/>Abo bo bâna ba Kalebu.</para>
  <para style="s1" vid="1CH 2:50">Huri</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1CH 2:50">Huri, lubere lwa mukâge Efrata, abusire bâna basharhu: Shobali, owarhondêraga Kiriyati-Yearimu, <verse eid="1CH 2:50"/><verse number="51" style="v" sid="1CH 2:51"/>Salma naye arhondêra Betelehemu, na Harefu arhondêra Bet-Gaderi. <verse eid="1CH 2:51"/><verse number="52" style="v" sid="1CH 2:52"/>Shobali warhondêraga Kiriyati-Yearimu abusire abâna: abayûbakaga e Harowe n’ecihimbi c’ab’e Menuhoti. <verse eid="1CH 2:52"/><verse number="53" style="v" sid="1CH 2:53"/>n’amûko g’e Kiriyati-Yearimu, bo baligi Bayitri, Bashuma n’Abamishra bo bayûbasire ebishagala by’e Sora n’eby’e Eshtaoli.<verse eid="1CH 2:53"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="1CH 2:54"/>Abâna ba Salma: bo bantu b’e Betelehemu, b’e Netofa, b’e Atroti- Bet-Yowabu, n’ecihimbi c’ab’e Manahati, ab’e Sora, <verse eid="1CH 2:54"/><verse number="55" style="v" sid="1CH 2:55"/>n’amûko g’abandisi b’e Yabesi, bo baligi Batireya, Bashimeya, Basuka. Abo baligi Bakeniti, nkomôka ya kuli Hamati, shakulûza w’omulala gw’Abarekabu.<verse eid="1CH 2:55"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1CH 2"/>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="1CH 3"/>
  <para style="s1">iburha lya Daudi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CH 3:1"/>Aga go mazîno g’abâna ba Daudi bàburhiragwa e Hebroni. Owa burhanzi, Amnoni, mugala wa Ahinowamu w’e Yizreyeli. Owa kabirhi, Daniyeli, mugala wa Abigayili, w’e Karmeli. <verse eid="1CH 3:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CH 3:2"/>Owa Kasharhu, Absalomu, mugala wa Maaka, mwâli wa Talmayi mwâmi w’e Geshuri. Owa kani, Aniya, mugala wa Hagiti. <verse eid="1CH 3:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CH 3:3"/>Owa karhanu, Shefatiya, mugala wa Abitali. Owa kali ndarhu, Yitrayamu, mugala wa Egla, naye mukà mwâmi. <verse eid="1CH 3:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CH 3:4"/>Aligwêrhe bâna ndarhu baburhiragwa aha Hebroni, ho àyîmaga myâka nda na myêzi ndarhu. Ashubiyîma n’aha Yeruzalemu myâka makumi a sharhu n’isharhu. <verse eid="1CH 3:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CH 3:5"/>N’abà bakulikîre bo bâna bâge baburhiragwa aha Yeruzalemu: Shimeya, Shobabu, Natani, Salomoni: bâna bâni ba Bati-Shuwa, mwâli wa Amiyeli. <verse eid="1CH 3:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CH 3:6"/>Yibehari, Elishamaʿ, Elifêleti, <verse eid="1CH 3:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CH 3:7"/>Noga, Nefegi, Yafiya, <verse eid="1CH 3:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CH 3:8"/>Elishamaʿ, Eliyada, Elifeleti; bâna mwenda. <verse eid="1CH 3:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CH 3:9"/>Abo boshi bo bâna ba Daudi. Abâna b’ebiherula byâge barhaganjirwi. Abusire n’omwânanyere, ye Tamari.<verse eid="1CH 3:9"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Abâmi ba Yûda</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CH 3:10"/>Abâna ba Salomoni nk’oku banakulikiranaga, bo: Rehabamu, Abiya, Asa, Yehoshafati, <verse eid="1CH 3:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CH 3:11"/>Yoramu, Akhaziyahu, Yowash, <verse eid="1CH 3:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CH 3:12"/>Amaziyahu, Azaryahu, Yotamu, <verse eid="1CH 3:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CH 3:13"/>Ahazi, Hizekiyahu, Menashè, <verse eid="1CH 3:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CH 3:14"/>Amoni na Yoshiyahu. <verse eid="1CH 3:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CH 3:15"/>Bagala ba Yoshiyahu: Yohanani lwo lubere, owa kabirhi, Yehoyakimu, owa kasharhu, Sidekiyahu, n’owa kani Shalumu. <verse eid="1CH 3:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CH 3:16"/>Bagala ba Yehoyakimu, bo: Yekoniya na Sidekiyahu.<verse eid="1CH 3:16"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Abâna b’abâmi enyuma ly’olubungo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CH 3:17"/>Bagala ba Yekoniya, olya walulizibagwa e Babiloni, bo: Sheyaltiyeli, <verse eid="1CH 3:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CH 3:18"/>Malkiramu, Pedaya, Shenasari, Yekamiya, Hoshama na Nedabiya. <verse eid="1CH 3:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CH 3:19"/>Bagala ba Pedaya, bo: Zorobabeli na Shimeyi. Zorobabeli aburha bagala babirhi: Meshulamu na Hananiya, na munyere muguma ye Shelomiti. <verse eid="1CH 3:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CH 3:20"/>Buzinda ashubiburha bâna barhanu: Hashuba, Oheli, Berekiya, Hasadiya na Yushabu-Hesedi. <verse eid="1CH 3:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CH 3:21"/>Abâna ba Hananiya, bo: Pelatiya na Yeshaya, haguma na bagala ba Refaya, bagala ba Arnoni, bagala ba Obadiya na bagala ba Shekanya. <verse eid="1CH 3:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CH 3:22"/>Abâna ba Shekaniya: Shemaya, Hatushi, Yigeyali, Bariyahi, Neariya, Shafati boshi bantu ndarhu. <verse eid="1CH 3:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CH 3:23"/>Abâna ba Neyariya: Eliyehoyenayi, Hizikiya, Azrikamu, boshi bantu basharhu. <verse eid="1CH 3:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CH 3:24"/>Abâna ba Eliyehoyenayi, bo: Hoda­viyahu, Eliyasibu, Pelaya, Akubu, Yohanani, Delaya, Anani, boshi bantu nda.<verse eid="1CH 3:24"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1CH 3"/>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="1CH 4"/>
  <para style="s1">Olundi lukalaba lw’amazîno g’abâna ba Yûda</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CH 4:1"/>Abâna ba Yûda: Peresi, Hesroni na Karmi, Huru na Shobali. <verse eid="1CH 4:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CH 4:2"/>Reaya mugala wa Shobali aburha Yahati, naye Yahati anaciburha Ahumayi na Lahadi. Yo milala y’Abasoreya eyo.<verse eid="1CH 4:2"/></para>
  <para style="s1">iburha lya Huri</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CH 4:3"/>Alaga abâna ba Etamu: Yizreyeli, Yîshema na Yidibashi, mwâli wâbo ye wali Hasileponi. <verse eid="1CH 4:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CH 4:4"/>Penuweli ali îshe wa Gedori, na Ezeri, îshe wa Husha. Abo bo bene Huri, lubere lwa Efrata, îshe wa Betelehemu.<verse eid="1CH 4:4"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Iburha lya Hashuri</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CH 4:5"/>Naye Hashuri, îshe wa Tekowa, agwêrhe bakazi babirhi, Hela na Naara. <verse eid="1CH 4:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CH 4:6"/>Naara amuburhira bagala bâni, Ahuzamu, Heferi, Temani na Ahashetari. <verse eid="1CH 4:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CH 4:7"/>Hela amuburhira basharhu, Sereti, Sohari na Etinani. <verse eid="1CH 4:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CH 4:8"/>Kotsi aburha Anubu na Hasobeba, na îshe w’emilala y’Abaharheli, mugala wa Harumu. <verse eid="1CH 4:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CH 4:9"/>Yabetsi alusha bene wâbo. Erhi nnina amuhà izîno lya Yabetsi, aderha, erhi: «Namuburhîre omu malumwa.» <verse eid="1CH 4:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CH 4:10"/>Yabetsi anaciderha ogu musengero, erhi: «Yâgirwa Nyamuzinda w’Israheli, onsûhire nâni obwangà bwâwe, onyûshûlire amashwa gâni, ondambûlirekwo okuboko kw’obulanzi bwâwe onanyegûlekwo obuhanya n’amalumwa!» Nyamuzinda anamushobôza ebyo asengeraga.<verse eid="1CH 4:10"/></para>
  <para style="s1">iburha lya Kalebu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CH 4:11"/>Kelubu, mwene wâbo Shuha, ye waburhaga Mehiri, Mehiri naye aburha Eshetoni, <verse eid="1CH 4:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CH 4:12"/>Eshetoni aburha Bet-Rafa, Paseya na Tehina; Tehina ye îshe w’ecishagala ca Nahashi. Abâna bâbo bagendiyûbaka e Reka. <verse eid="1CH 4:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CH 4:13"/>Bagala ba Kenazi, bo: Otiniyeli na Seraya. Bagala ba Otiniyeli, bo: Hatati na Meonotayi. <verse eid="1CH 4:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CH 4:14"/>Meonotayi anaciburha Ofra. Seraya naye aburha Yowabu, shakulûza w’abakozi bayûbaka omu kabanda k’abakozi. <verse eid="1CH 4:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CH 4:15"/>Kalebu, mwene Yefunè abusire bâna basharhu, Iru, Ela na Naamu, Ela naye aburha Kenazi. <verse eid="1CH 4:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CH 4:16"/>Bagala ba Yehaleleyeli, bo: Zifa, Zita, Tirya, Asareyeli. <verse eid="1CH 4:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CH 4:17"/>Bagala ba Ezra, bo: Yeteri, Meredi, Eferi, Yaloni. <verse eid="1CH 4:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CH 4:18"/>Meredi ayanka mwâli wa mwâmi w’e Mîsiri, ye Bitya, amuburhira Miriyamu, Shamayi na Isheba, îshe wa Eshitemowa. Meredi agwêrhe n’omukazi muyahudi, amuburhira Yeredi, îshe wa Zonowa oderhwa Soko. <verse eid="1CH 4:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CH 4:19"/>Hodiya ayanka mwâli wâbo Nahumu; obûko bw’Abagarmiti, bo babà e Keyila, n’obw’Abamakaati, bo babà e Eshtemowa. <verse eid="1CH 4:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CH 4:20"/>Bagala ba Shimoni, bo: Amunoni, Rina, Beni-Hanani, Tiloni. Bagala ba Yisheyi: Zoheti bo na mugala wa Zoheti.<verse eid="1CH 4:20"/></para>
  <para style="s1">iburha lya Shela</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CH 4:21"/>Bagala ba Shela mwene Yûda, bo: Eri, îshe wa Leka, Lada, îshe wa Maresha, haguma n’amûko g’abalusi b’emyenda y’ecitâni ciniole e Bet-A­sheba. <verse eid="1CH 4:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CH 4:22"/>Shela ye wanali shakulûza wa Yokimu na w’abantu bayûbaka e Kozeba, na wa Yowashi na Sarafi, ye wajag’iyankirira abantu b’e Mowabu e mbêre ashubiyîsh’ibêra aha Lehemu. (Ebyo byageraga mîra bwenêne). <verse eid="1CH 4:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CH 4:23"/>Abà na bâbo bâli babumbi, bayûbakaga e Netayimu n’e Gedera, yo bakâg’ikolera mwâmi.<verse eid="1CH 4:23"/></para>
  <para style="s1">iburha lya Simoni</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CH 4:24"/>Bagala ba Simoni, bo: Nemuweli, Yamini, Yaribu, Zera na Shaulu. <verse eid="1CH 4:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1CH 4:25"/>Bagala ba Shaulu nk’oku banakulikirana, bâli: Shalumu, Mibusamu na Mishema. <verse eid="1CH 4:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1CH 4:26"/>Abâna ba Mishema bo Hamuweli, Zakuru na Shimeyi. <verse eid="1CH 4:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1CH 4:27"/>Shimeyi aburha bagala ikumi na ndarhu na banyere ndarhu, ci abandi barhambo b’emilala barhaburhaga bâna banji. Co canarhumire emilala y’obûko bwa Simeoni ntà mango yabîre minji aka emilala ya Yûda. <verse eid="1CH 4:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1CH 4:28"/>Molada na Hasar-Shuwali bàyûbakaga e Berseba, <verse eid="1CH 4:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1CH 4:29"/>Bilaha, Esemu na Toladi, <verse eid="1CH 4:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1CH 4:30"/>Betuweli, Horma na Siklagi, <verse eid="1CH 4:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1CH 4:31"/>Bet-Markaboti. Hasari-Susimu, Beti­ Bereyi, Shaarayimi, ebyo byoshi byàli bishagla byâbo kuhika amango Daudi arhondêraga okubà mwâmi w’Israheli. <verse eid="1CH 4:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="1CH 4:32"/>Bagwêrhe n’ebindi bishagala, Etamu, Rimoni, Tokeni na Ashani, byoshi bishagla birhanu, <verse eid="1CH 4:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="1CH 4:33"/>n’ebindi bishagala by’eburhambi kuhika e Baali. Eyo yo mirhundu babàgamwo. Olukalaba lw’emilala yâbo lubà omu citabu c’amazîno. <verse eid="1CH 4:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="1CH 4:34"/>Alaga olukalaba lw’amazîno g’abakulu b’emilala ya bene Simeoni; Meshobabu, Yamuleki. Yosha mwene Amasha, <verse eid="1CH 4:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="1CH 4:35"/>Yoweli, Yehu mwene Yoshibiya, mwinjikulu wa Seraya, mwinjikulûza wa Asiyeli. <verse eid="1CH 4:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="1CH 4:36"/>Eliyehoyenayi, Yakôbo, Yeshohaya, Asaya, Adiyeli, Yesimiyeli, Benaya, <verse eid="1CH 4:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="1CH 4:37"/>Ziza, Ben-Shifeyi, Ben-Aloni, Ben-Yedaya, Ben-Shimri, Ben-Shemaya. <verse eid="1CH 4:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="1CH 4:38"/>Emilala yâbo yayûshûka bwenêne. <verse eid="1CH 4:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="1CH 4:39"/>Bajà bagenda kuhika ebwa ntondo ya Gedori omu lubanda lw’ebushoshôka-zûba, bajà balonza olwâbûko lw’ebibuzi byâbo. <verse eid="1CH 4:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="1CH 4:40"/>Babugânayo olwâbûko lw’akahasi kinjinja, càli cihugo cinene bwenêne na ca murhûla, bene Kamu bo baciyûbakagamwo burhanzi.<verse eid="1CH 4:40"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="1CH 4:41"/>Abo bene Simoni rhudesire amazîno gâbo, bàhikaga eyo munda omu nsiku Hezekiyahu mwâmi w’e Yûda. Balwîsa bene eco cihugo, Abanya-Maoni, bajà babakundulira amahêma banabuganyire. Babaherêrekeza lwoshi kuhika ensiku z’ene. Bacîbêrera ahâli hâbo, bulya yali olwâbûko lwinjà lw’ebibuzi. <verse eid="1CH 4:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="1CH 4:42"/>Abandi muli abo bene Simoni, bantu magana arhanu, bahârhûla kuhika ebwa ntondo z’e Seyiri, erhi bashokolîrwe na Pelatiya, Neyariya, Refaya, Uziyeli, bagala ba Yisheyi. <verse eid="1CH 4:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="1CH 4:43"/>Balwîsa amahânga ga kuli Amaleki gacibaga eyo munda, bagahima bacîbêrera mw’eco cihugo kuhika ene.<verse eid="1CH 4:43"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1CH 4"/>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="1CH 5"/>
  <para style="s1">iburha lya Rubeni</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CH 5:1"/>Abâna ba Rubeni, lubere lwa Israheli. Kwo binali yo yali nfula, cikwône erhi acîshûbula omu kuhemula encingo y’îshe, anyagwa ecikono câge c’okubà nfula; cahâbwa bagala ba Yozefu, mwene Israheli. Obûko bwa Rubeni bwaheza ecikono c’obukulu. <verse eid="1CH 5:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CH 5:2"/>Yûda naye, alusha bene wâbo obuhashe, bulya mwinjikulu wayishiribâ mwâmi w’Israheli, ci eco cikono c’okubà nfula emwa Yozefu càjire. <verse eid="1CH 5:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CH 5:3"/>Bagala ba Rubeni, nfula ya Israheli, bo: Hanoki, Palu, Hesroni na Karmi.<verse eid="1CH 5:3"/></para>
  <para style="s1">iburha lya Yoheli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CH 5:4"/>Abâna ba Yoheli nk’oku banakulikiranaga, bo: Shemaya, Gogu, Shimeyi, <verse eid="1CH 5:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CH 5:5"/>Mika, Reaya, Baali na <verse eid="1CH 5:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CH 5:6"/>Beera; oyo muzinda àli murhambo wa bene Rubeni, ye walulizibagwa na Teglati-Falasari, mwâmi w’e Asîriya. <verse eid="1CH 5:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CH 5:7"/>Bazâlà ba Beera, barhambo b’oshi erhi milala, nabo bali bayandike omu citabu c’amazîno: owa burhanzi ye wali Yeiyeli, Zakariya akulikira, <verse eid="1CH 5:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CH 5:8"/>na Bela mugala wa Azazi, mwinjikulu Shema, ye na mwinjikulûza wa Yoheli.</para>
  <para style="s1" vid="1CH 5:8">Ebishagala Rubeni ayûbasiremwo</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1CH 5:8">Bene Rubeni bagend’ibêra e Aroweri, bayûshûka baluga, balumîra kuhika e Nebo n’e Baali-Meoni. <verse eid="1CH 5:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CH 5:9"/>Olunda lw’ebushoshôkero bw’izûba, olubibi lwâbo lwalumîra kuhika ebw’irungu ly’olwîshi lwa Efrata. Bàgwêrhe masô manji g’ebishwêkwa omu cihugo ca Galadi. <verse eid="1CH 5:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CH 5:10"/>Oku ngoma ya Saulu bàlwîsize Abahagiri, Abahagiri babahima, co carhumire Abahagiri bayishicîyûbakira omu cihugo coshi c’ebushoshôkero bwa Galadi.<verse eid="1CH 5:10"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Iburha lya Gadi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CH 5:11"/>Abâna ba Gadi balamaga omu cihugo c’ebulembe bwa bene Rubeni omu kabanda ka Bashani kuhika e Salka. <verse eid="1CH 5:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CH 5:12"/>Yoheli ye murhanzi, Shafani akulikira, buzinda Yanayi na Shafati bajà omu cihugo c’e Bashani. <verse eid="1CH 5:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CH 5:13"/>Bene wâbo nabo, nk’oku emilala yâbo enali: Mikaheli, Meshulamu, ba, Yorayi, Yakani, Ziya, Eberi, boshi haguma bantu nda. <verse eid="1CH 5:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CH 5:14"/>Abà nabo bo bâna ba Abihayili: abâna ba Huri, abâna ba Yaroah abâna ba Galadi, abâna ba Mikaheli, abâna ba Yeshishay, abâna ba Yahdo n’abâna ba Bûz <verse eid="1CH 5:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CH 5:15"/>Ahi, mugala wa Abdiyeli ye na mwinjikulu wa Guni. ye wali mukulu w’eyo milala. <verse eid="1CH 5:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CH 5:16"/>Kwo kuderha oku iburha lya Gadi lyayûbakaga omu cihugo c’e Galadi n’e Bashani, haguma n’ebishagala byàli eburhambi, kuhirakwo n’amalambo g’olwâbuko lw’e Sharoni, kuhika oku buzinda bw’olubibi lwâbyo. <verse eid="1CH 5:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CH 5:17"/>Abantu b’ogwo mulala bàyandikagwa omu citabu c’amazîno amango Yotamu àli mwâmi e Yûda, na Yerobwâmi mwâmi w’omu Israheli.<verse eid="1CH 5:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CH 5:18"/>Bene Rubeni, bene Gadi, n’ecigabi ca bene Menashè, balimwo bantu banji ba birha b’okukolêsa empenzi n’emigushu, banali ntwâli nfôla-miherho na benge ba kulwa amatumu, omubalè gwâbo gwàli nka gwa bihumbi makumi anni na bini, na magana gali nda na makumi gali ndarhu. <verse eid="1CH 5:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CH 5:19"/>Banacirhêra Abahagiri, haguma na bene Yeturu, Nafishi na Nodabu. <verse eid="1CH 5:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CH 5:20"/>Omu mango g’ebyo birha, basengera oburhabâle bwa Nyamuzinda, bulya bâli bamulangâlire. Nyamuzinda ayankirira omusengero gwâbo bwinjinjà anabarhabâla. Bahima ntyo Abahagiri haguma n’abàli babarhabîre kw’eyo ntambala. <verse eid="1CH 5:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CH 5:21"/>Bacirhulira omu bishwêkwa byâbo, banyaga ngamiya bihumbi makumi arhanu, bihumbi magana abirhi na makumi arhanu ga bibuzi n’empene na ndogomi bihumbi bibirhi, na kulushîsa aho, bàshwêka mpira bantu bihumbi igana. <verse eid="1CH 5:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CH 5:22"/>Byabîre ntyo bulya ebyo birha byàli biyêrekîre Nyamuzinda. Bacîyûbakira omwo cihugo c’Abahagiri banabêramwo kuhika omu nsiku balulizibagwa ihanga lya bene.<verse eid="1CH 5:22"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Iburha lya Menashè olunda lw’e Yordaui</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CH 5:23"/>Ecigabi ca bene Menashè cagendiyûbaka omu cihugo ciri ekarhî ka Bashani na Baali-Hermoni, Sheniri n’entondo ya Hermoni. Bâli bantu banji. <verse eid="1CH 5:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CH 5:24"/>Abà bo bakulu b’emilala yâbo: Eferi, Yisheyi, Eliyeli, Azriyeli, Yirmeya, Hodaviya, Yadiyeli. Boshi zàli ntwâli za kuderhwa, bantu bagwêrhe amazîno g’olukengwa, bakulu b’emilala yâbo.<verse eid="1CH 5:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="1CH 5:25"/>Cikwône barhali bikubagirwa kuli Nyamuzinda wa bîshe, bayêmêra barhebwa n’abazimu b’emw’abo bantu, balya Nyamuzinda ahungumulaga embere zâbo. <verse eid="1CH 5:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1CH 5:26"/>Okwo kwarhuma Nyamuzinda asinsimula obukunizi bwa Pulu, mwâmi w’e Asîriya, n’obukunizi bwa Tiglati-Falasari, naye mwâmi w’e Asîriya. Ahêka obûko bwa Rubeni n’obwa Gadi ihanga, na cirya cigabi c’obûko bwa Menashè. Abahêka cingana e Hala hôfi n’enyîshi za Habori na Gozani. Eyo munda yo banacibà kuhika ensiku z’ene.<verse eid="1CH 5:26"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Iburha lya Levi: Abadâhwa bakulu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="1CH 5:27"/>Bagala ba Levi, bo: Gershoni, Kehati na Merari. <verse eid="1CH 5:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1CH 5:28"/>Bagala ba Kehati, bo: Amuramu, Yikari, Hebroni, Uziyeli. <verse eid="1CH 5:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1CH 5:29"/>Amuramu abusire barhabana babirhi, Aroni na Mûsa, ahirakwo mwânanyere muguma, Miriyamu. Bagala ba Aroni: Nadabu, Abihu, Eleyazari na Itamara. <verse eid="1CH 5:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1CH 5:30"/>Eleyazari aburha Pinahasi, Pinahasi aburha Abushuwa, <verse eid="1CH 5:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1CH 5:31"/>Abushuwa anaciburha Buki, Buki aburha Uzi; <verse eid="1CH 5:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="1CH 5:32"/>Uzi anaciburha Zeraya; Zeraya aburha Merayoti; <verse eid="1CH 5:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="1CH 5:33"/>Merayoti anaciburha Amariya; Amariya aburha Ahitubu; <verse eid="1CH 5:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="1CH 5:34"/>Ahitubu naye aburha Sadoki; Sadoki anaciburha Ahimazi; <verse eid="1CH 5:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="1CH 5:35"/>Ahimazi aburha Azariya; Azariya anaciburha Yohanâni; <verse eid="1CH 5:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="1CH 5:36"/>Yohanani naye aburha Azariya. Oyo Azariya ye wajiraga omukolo gw’obudâhwa omu kâ-Nyamuzinda Salomoni ayûbakaga e Yeruzalemu. <verse eid="1CH 5:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="1CH 5:37"/>Azariya aburha Amariya; Amariya anaciburha Ahitubu; <verse eid="1CH 5:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="1CH 5:38"/>Ahitubu naye aburha Sadoki; Sadoki aburha Shalumu; <verse eid="1CH 5:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="1CH 5:39"/>Shalumu naye aburha Hilkiya; Hilkiya aburha Azariya; <verse eid="1CH 5:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="1CH 5:40"/>Azariya anaciburha Seraya; Seraya aburha Yehosadaki; <verse eid="1CH 5:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="1CH 5:41"/>oyo Yehosadaki ye wasêzibagwa okurhenga omu budâhwa galya mango Nabukondonozori ashanashana abantu b’e Yûda n’ab’e Yeruzalemu boshi anabaluliriza ihanga oku irhegeko lya Nyakasane.<verse eid="1CH 5:41"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1CH 5"/>
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="1CH 6"/>
  <para style="s1">Abandi b’oku bûko bwa Levi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CH 6:1"/>Bagala ba Levi, bo: Gershoni, Kehati na Merari. <verse eid="1CH 6:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CH 6:2"/>Bagala ba Gershoni, bo: Libni na Shimeyi. <verse eid="1CH 6:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CH 6:3"/>Bagala ba Kehati, bo: Amuramu, Yishari, Hebroni, Uziyeli. <verse eid="1CH 6:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CH 6:4"/>Bagala ba Merari, bo: Mahali na Mushi. amûko ga Levi ago nk’oku bashakulûza bâbo banakulikirana.<verse eid="1CH 6:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CH 6:5"/>Iburha lya Gershoni nk’oku banaburhîne, bo abà: Libni, Yahati, Zima, <verse eid="1CH 6:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CH 6:6"/>Yowa, Ido, Zera na Yetrayi. <verse eid="1CH 6:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CH 6:7"/>Abâna ba Kehati, bo: Aminadabu, Korè, Asiri, <verse eid="1CH 6:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CH 6:8"/>Elkana, Abiyasafi, Asiri, <verse eid="1CH 6:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CH 6:9"/>Tehati, Uriyeli, Uziyahu na Shaulu. <verse eid="1CH 6:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CH 6:10"/>Elkana ashubiriburha bandi barhabana babirhi: Amasayi na Ahimoti. <verse eid="1CH 6:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CH 6:11"/>Abâna ba Ahimoti, bo: Elkana, Sofayi, Nahati, <verse eid="1CH 6:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CH 6:12"/>Eliyabu, Yerohamu na Elkana. <verse eid="1CH 6:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CH 6:13"/>Bagala ba Samweli, bo: Yoheli lwo lubere, na Ahiya ye wa kabirhi. <verse eid="1CH 6:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CH 6:14"/>Iburha lya Merari nk’oku banaburhîne bo: Mahali, Libni, Shimeyi, Uza, <verse eid="1CH 6:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CH 6:15"/>Shima, Hagwiya na Asaya.<verse eid="1CH 6:15"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Abimbiza</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CH 6:16"/>Bene Levi, mwâmi Daudi abahà omukolo gw’okuyimbiza omu ndâro ya Nyakasane, oku omucîmba gw’amalaganyo gwanahirwamwo ho na halya. <verse eid="1CH 6:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CH 6:17"/>Embere Salomoni ayûsiyûbaka aka-Nyamuzinda k’e Yeruzalemu, abo bantu bakàgijira omukolo gwâbo gw’okuziha ennanga embere ly’ihêma ly’okubugânana nk’oku amarhegeko ganalidesire. <verse eid="1CH 6:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CH 6:18"/>Ntya kwo bakag’ijira ogwo mukolo, haguma n’emirhwe y’abimbiza: Muli bene Kehati, Hemani mwimbiza, bashakulûza bâge omu kuburhana kwâbo, àli Yoheli, Samweli, <verse eid="1CH 6:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CH 6:19"/>Elkana, Yerohamu, Eliyeli, Toahi, <verse eid="1CH 6:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CH 6:20"/>Sufu, Elkana, Yahati, Amasayi, <verse eid="1CH 6:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CH 6:21"/>Elkana, Yoheli, Azariya, Sefaniya, <verse eid="1CH 6:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CH 6:22"/>Tahati, Asiri, Ebiyasafu, Korè, <verse eid="1CH 6:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CH 6:23"/>Yishari, Kehati, Levi na Yakôbo. <verse eid="1CH 6:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CH 6:24"/>Ekulyo kwa Hemani yakàgibà owâbo mwimbiza Azafi, naye ba shakulûza bâge ntya kwo bàburhanaga: Berekuya, Shimeya, <verse eid="1CH 6:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1CH 6:25"/>Mikaeli, Baseya, Malkiya, <verse eid="1CH 6:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1CH 6:26"/>Etni, Zera, Adaya, <verse eid="1CH 6:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1CH 6:27"/>Etani, Zima, Shimeyi, <verse eid="1CH 6:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1CH 6:28"/>Yehati, Gershoni, Levi. <verse eid="1CH 6:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1CH 6:29"/>Olunda lw’ebulembe bakâgiyimangayo bene wâbo bene Merari, nabo bashakulûza bâbo ntya kwo bàburhanaga: Etani, Kishi, Abdi, Maluki, <verse eid="1CH 6:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1CH 6:30"/>Hashabiya, Amasiya, Hilkiya, <verse eid="1CH 6:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1CH 6:31"/>Amsi, Bâni, Shemari, <verse eid="1CH 6:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="1CH 6:32"/>Mahali, Mushi, Merari, Levi.<verse eid="1CH 6:32"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Abandi b’omu mulala gwa Levi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="1CH 6:33"/>Abandi bantu b’omulala gwa Levi bakâgiyûkiriza eyindi mikolo yoshi enayêrekîre endâro ya Nyakasane. <verse eid="1CH 6:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="1CH 6:34"/>Aroni n’iburha lyâge bo bàgwêrhe omukolo gw’okurherekêra enterekêro z’embâgwa n’entûlo z’enshangi oku mpêrero zàli ziyêrekerîne. <verse eid="1CH 6:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="1CH 6:35"/>Aroni n’abâna bâge omukolo gwâbo kwàli kusingônolera ebishwêkwa enyanya z’oluhêrero lw’enshângî. Bakàgijira ntyo ngasi mikolo yoshi enayêrekîre Nyamuzinda. Kandi bo banakâgiyimangira amagashânize g’okubabalira ebyâha by’olubaga lw’Israheli nk’oku byanalirhegesirwe omu marhegeko ga Mûsa, mwambali wa Nyamuzinda. <verse eid="1CH 6:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="1CH 6:36"/>N’aga go mazîno ga bene Aroni nk’oku banakulikiranaga omu kuburhana kwâbo: Elkana, Pinahasi, Abishuwa, Buki, Zeraya, <verse eid="1CH 6:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="1CH 6:37"/>Merayoti, Amariya, Ahitubu, <verse eid="1CH 6:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="1CH 6:38"/>Sadoki, Ahimasi.<verse eid="1CH 6:38"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Ebishagala byagabîrwe bene Levi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="1CH 6:39"/>Amazîno g’enyunda z’omu cihugo bene Aroni b’oku mulala gwa Kehati bayûbasire, bo bâli barhangiriza okuhâbwa ecâbo cihugo omu kuyesha ecigole:, <verse eid="1CH 6:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="1CH 6:40"/>bahâbwa ecishagla ca Hebroni, omu Yûda, haguma n’amalambo g’eburhambi; <verse eid="1CH 6:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="1CH 6:41"/>cikwône amashwa n’emirhundu y’eco cihugo byàli erhi byàhîrwe Kalebu mwene Yefunè; <verse eid="1CH 6:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="1CH 6:42"/>Bene Aroni bayandikirwa n’ebishagla by’okuyâkiramwo, byo: Hebroni, Libna haguma n’olwâbuko lw’ebishwêkwa, Yatiri, Eshtemowa haguma n’amashwa g’akahasi, <verse eid="1CH 6:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="1CH 6:43"/>Hilasi n’olwâbûko lw’ebishwêkwa, Debiri haguma n’amashwa g’akahasi, <verse eid="1CH 6:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="1CH 6:44"/>Ashani n’amashwa gamwo, Beti-Shemeshi n’amashwa gamwo. <verse eid="1CH 6:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="1CH 6:45"/>Ab’obûko bwa Benyamini bahâbwa Geba n’amashwa gâge, Alemeti n’amashwa gâge, Anatoti n’amashwa gâge. Ebishagala by’emilala yâbo boshi haguma byàli bishagala ikumi na bisharhu.<verse eid="1CH 6:45"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="1CH 6:46"/>Bene Kehati, omu kuyesha ecigole bahâbwa bishagala ikumi byakûlagwa omu cihugo c’ecigabi c’obûko bwa Menashè. <verse eid="1CH 6:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="1CH 6:47"/>Bene Gershoni n’emilala yâbo bahâbwa bishagla ikumi na bisharhu by’omu cihugo c’obûko bwa Isakari, obwa Aseri, obwa Nefutali n’obûko bwa Menashè omu cihugo c’e Bashani. <verse eid="1CH 6:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="1CH 6:48"/>Bene Merari n’emilala yâbo omu kuyesha ecigole nabo bàhâbwa bishagala ikumi na bibirhi by’omu cihugo c’obûko bwa Rubeni, obwa Gadi n’obûko bwa Zabuloni. <verse eid="1CH 6:48"/><verse number="49" style="v" sid="1CH 6:49"/>Bene Israheli bagabira bene Levi ebyo bishagala byoshi haguma n’amashwa gâbyo. <verse eid="1CH 6:49"/><verse number="50" style="v" sid="1CH 6:50"/>Omu bûko bwa Yûda, obwa Simoni, n’obwa Benyamini, nabo bayesherwa ecigole, bahâna ebishagala, bône babiyîrika amazîno.<verse eid="1CH 6:50"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="1CH 6:51"/>Omu bûko bwa Efrayimu, barhôlamwo ebishagala n’emirhundu, byahâbwa eyindi milala ya bene Kehati. <verse eid="1CH 6:51"/><verse number="52" style="v" sid="1CH 6:52"/>Bahâbwa ebishagala by’okuyâkiramwo, byo Sikemu n’amashwa gâge omu ntondo za Efrayimu, Gezeri n’amashwa gâge, <verse eid="1CH 6:52"/><verse number="53" style="v" sid="1CH 6:53"/>Yokemeyamu n’amashwa gâge, Beti-Honori n’amashwa gâge, <verse eid="1CH 6:53"/><verse number="54" style="v" sid="1CH 6:54"/>Ayaloni n’amashwa gâge, Gat-Rimoni n’amashwa gâge, <verse eid="1CH 6:54"/><verse number="55" style="v" sid="1CH 6:55"/>Ebyo byoshi babihâbwa omu buzâla bw’eyindi milala ya bene Kehati. <verse eid="1CH 6:55"/><verse number="56" style="v" sid="1CH 6:56"/>Bene Gershoni barhôlerwa ebishagala omu milala y’ecigabi c’obûko bwa Menashè: ecishagala ca Golani omu Bashani haguma n’amashwa gâco, Ashtaroti haguma n’amashwa gâco. <verse eid="1CH 6:56"/><verse number="57" style="v" sid="1CH 6:57"/>Omu cihugo ca Isakari: ecishagala ca Kedeshi n’amashwa gâco, Dobrati n’amashwa gâco, <verse eid="1CH 6:57"/><verse number="58" style="v" sid="1CH 6:58"/>Ramoti n’amashwa gâco, Anemu n’amashwa gâco.<verse eid="1CH 6:58"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="59" style="v" sid="1CH 6:59"/>Omu bûko bwa Aseri: ecishagla ca Mashali n’amashwa gâco, Aboni n’amashwa gâco, <verse eid="1CH 6:59"/><verse number="60" style="v" sid="1CH 6:60"/>Hukoki n’amashwa gâco, Rehobu n’amashwa gâco. <verse eid="1CH 6:60"/><verse number="61" style="v" sid="1CH 6:61"/>Omu bûko bwa Nefutali: ecishagala Kedeshi c’omu Galileya n’amashwa gâco, Hamoni n’amashwa gâco, Kiriyatîmu n’amashwa gâco.<verse eid="1CH 6:61"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="62" style="v" sid="1CH 6:62"/>Abandi bene Merari bahâbwa ebishagala omu cihugo c’obûko bwa Zabuloni: ecishagala Rimani n’amashwa gâco, Tabori n’amashwa gâco. <verse eid="1CH 6:62"/><verse number="63" style="v" sid="1CH 6:63"/>Ishiriza lya Yordani olunda lw’e Yeriko, yo erigi ebushoshôkero bwa Yordani, omu bûko bwa Rubeni: ecishagala Besheri ebw’irungu, haguma n’amashwa gâco. <verse eid="1CH 6:63"/><verse number="64" style="v" sid="1CH 6:64"/>Kedemoti n’amashwa gâco, Meefati n’amashwa gâco. <verse eid="1CH 6:64"/><verse number="65" style="v" sid="1CH 6:65"/>Omu bûko bwa Gadi: ecishagala Ramati c’omu Galadi haguma n’amashwa gâco, Mahanayimu n’amashwa gâco. <verse eid="1CH 6:65"/><verse number="66" style="v" sid="1CH 6:66"/>Hesheboni haguma n’amashwa gâco, Yezeri n’amashwa gâco.<verse eid="1CH 6:66"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1CH 6"/>
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="1CH 7"/>
  <para style="s1">Ab’oku bûko bwa Isakari</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CH 7:1"/>Isakari abusire bâna bâni: Tola, Puwa, Yashubu na Shimuroni. <verse eid="1CH 7:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CH 7:2"/>Abâna ba Tola, bo: Uzi. Refaya, Yeriyeli, Yahmayi, Yibusamu na Shemuweli. Abo bo bâli bakulu b’emilala ya kuli Tola. Bâli bantu ba lukengwa omu milala yâbo. Omu mango ga Daudi omubalè gwabarhengaga kuli Tola gwàli gwa bantu bihumbi makumi abirhi na bibirhi na magana ndarhu.<verse eid="1CH 7:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CH 7:3"/>Uzi aburha omwâna, ye Yiziraya. Yiziraya n’abagala Mikaeli, Obadiya, Yoheri na Yishiya oku banali barhanu babà bakulu b’emilala yâbo. <verse eid="1CH 7:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CH 7:4"/>Omulala gwâbo gwalimwo abakazi banji bwenêne haguma n’abalume kuhika gwakazibonekamwo balume bihumbi makumi asharhu na ndarhu, ntwâli za kulwa bîrha. <verse eid="1CH 7:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CH 7:5"/>Abandi bantu b’obûko bwa Isakari bali omu citabu c’amazîno, omubalè gwâbo guli gwa bantu bihumbi makumi gali munâni na nda.<verse eid="1CH 7:5"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Obûko bwa Benyamini</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CH 7:6"/>Benyamini abusire bâna basharhu, Bela, Bekeri na Yediyeli. <verse eid="1CH 7:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CH 7:7"/>Bela naye abona iburha: Etsiboni, Uzi, Uziyeli, Yerimoti na Iri, bantu ba lukengwa babà bakulu b’emilala yâbo. Omu citabu c’amazîno eyo milala yagwêrhe omubalè gwa bihumbi makumi abirhi na bibirhi na bantu makumi asharhu na bani. <verse eid="1CH 7:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CH 7:8"/>Abâna ba Bekeri: Zemira, Yowashi, Eliyezeri, Eliyehoyenayi, Omri, Yeremoti, Abiya, Anatoti, Alemeti. Abo boshi bûko bwa Bekeri.<verse eid="1CH 7:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CH 7:9"/>Bantu bakengwa bo bali bakulu b’emilala yâbo. Omu citabu c’amazîno, eyo milala yagwêrhe omubalè gwa bantu bihumbi makumi abirhi na magana abirhi. <verse eid="1CH 7:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CH 7:10"/>Mugala wa Yediyeli: Bilahani. Bilahani naye aburha Yeushi, Benyamini, Ehudi, Kenaana, Zetani, Tarsisi, Ahishahari. <verse eid="1CH 7:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CH 7:11"/>Abo bene Yediyeeli boshi bâli bantu bakengwa bakulu b’emilala yâbo, omubalè gwâbo gwàli gwa bantu bihumbi ikumi na nda na magana abirhi, boshi nfôlamiherho. <verse eid="1CH 7:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CH 7:12"/>Shupimu na Hupimu bâli bagala ba Iri. Hushimu naye erhi aburhwa na Aheri.<verse eid="1CH 7:12"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Obûko bwa Nefutali</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CH 7:13"/>Bagala ba Nefutali, bo: Yasiyeli, Guni, Yeseri, Shalumu baligi binjikulu ba Bilaha.<verse eid="1CH 7:13"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Obûko bwa Menashè</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CH 7:14"/>Abâna ba Menashè, bo: Asriyeli na Makiri, Makiri ye waburhagwa na mukâge wa kabirhi w’omu Asîriya. Makiri naye aburha Galadi. <verse eid="1CH 7:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CH 7:15"/>Makiri arhôlera abagala bombi Hupimu na Shupimu abakazi. Agwêrhe mwâli wâbo izîno lyâge ye wali Maaka n’omwa kabiri Selofehadi, yêhe arhaburhaga abarhali bananyere bônene. <verse eid="1CH 7:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CH 7:16"/>Maaka, mukà Makiri, ashubimuburhira omwâna, amuyîrika izîno lya Pereshi, ahiraho owundi, amuyîrika izîno lya Shereshi. Shereshi aburha Ulama na Rekemi, <verse eid="1CH 7:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CH 7:17"/>na Ulama ye wali îshe wa Bedani. Bo bâna ba Galadi abo, mugala wa Makiri mwinjikulu wa Menashè. <verse eid="1CH 7:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CH 7:18"/>Hamoleketi, mwâli wâbo Galadi, naye aburha Ishodi, Abiyezeri na Mahala. <verse eid="1CH 7:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CH 7:19"/>Shemida naye aburha Ahiyani, Shekemi, Liki na Aniyamu.<verse eid="1CH 7:19"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Obûko bwa Efrayimu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CH 7:20"/>Bene Efrayimu omu kukulikira okuburhana kwâbo, bo: Shutela, Beredi, Tahati, <verse eid="1CH 7:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CH 7:21"/>Zabadi, Shutela, Ezeri, na Eleyadi. Ezeri na Eleyadi bagala ba E­frayimu: bombi, bagereza okugendinyaga amasò g’enkafu z’abantu b’ecishagala c’e Gati, ci bênezo babaniga. <verse eid="1CH 7:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CH 7:22"/>Îshe wâbo Efrayimu abalakira nsiku nyinji, na bene wâbo bakaziyîsha balimurhûliriza kw’ogwo mungo gw’abâna bâge. <verse eid="1CH 7:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CH 7:23"/>Cazînda ashubijà omu mwa mukâge, amuburhako mugala. Amuyîrika izîno lya Beriya, bulya omulala gwâge erhi guli omu mishîbo. <verse eid="1CH 7:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CH 7:24"/>Efrayimu àgwêrhe n’omwâna-nyere izîno lyâge ye wali Shera, ye wayûbakaga Bet-Horoni olunda lw’enyanya n’olunda lw’idako, ayûbaka na Uzeni-Shera. <verse eid="1CH 7:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1CH 7:25"/>Abâna ba Beriya oku baburhîne, bo: Refa, Reshefu, Tela, Tahani, <verse eid="1CH 7:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1CH 7:26"/>Ladani, Amihudi, Elishamaʿ, <verse eid="1CH 7:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1CH 7:27"/>Nuni na Yozwè. <verse eid="1CH 7:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1CH 7:28"/>Ecihugo bene Efrayimu bahâbagwa mpu bayûbakemwo, calimwo Beteli haguma n’ebishagala bya hôfi-hôfi, Narani n’ebushoshôkero, Gezeri, n’ebishagala bimuyegîre ebwa buzikiro, haguma n’ecihugo ciri ekarhî ka Sikemu na Aya, n’ebishagla bya hôfi-hôfi. <verse eid="1CH 7:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1CH 7:29"/>Bagala ba Menashè bagwêrhe ebishagala by’e Bet-Sheyani, Tanaki, Megido na Dori, ngasi ciguma n’ebishagala byaciyêgêraga. Ebyo byo bishagala byayûbakagwa mwo n’obûko bwa Yozefu, mugala wa Yakôbo.<verse eid="1CH 7:29"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Obûko bwa Aseri</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="1CH 7:30"/>Bagala ba Aseri, bo: Yimuna, Yishwa, Yishwi na Beriya; mwâli wâbo ye wali Serah. <verse eid="1CH 7:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1CH 7:31"/>Bagala ba Beriya, bo: Heberi na Malkiyeli; Malkiyeli ye cûbaka wa Birzayiti. <verse eid="1CH 7:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="1CH 7:32"/>Heberi aburha Yafleti, Shemeri na Hotamu, na mwâli wâbo ye Shuwa. <verse eid="1CH 7:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="1CH 7:33"/>Bagala ba Yafleti, bo: Pasaki, Bimahâli na Ashvati. <verse eid="1CH 7:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="1CH 7:34"/>Bagala ba Shemeri, bo: Ahi, Roga, Huba na Aramu. <verse eid="1CH 7:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="1CH 7:35"/>Bagala ba Hotamu mwene wâbo, bo: Sofa, Yimna, Sheleshi na Amali. <verse eid="1CH 7:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="1CH 7:36"/>Bagala ba Sofa, bo: Suwahi, Harmeferi, Shuwali, Beri, Yimra, <verse eid="1CH 7:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="1CH 7:37"/>Beseri, Hodi, Shama, Shilsha, Yitrani na Bera. <verse eid="1CH 7:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="1CH 7:38"/>Bagala ba Yitrani, bo: Yefunè, Pispa, Ara. <verse eid="1CH 7:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="1CH 7:39"/>Bagala ba Ula: Arahi, Haniyeli, Risiya. <verse eid="1CH 7:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="1CH 7:40"/>Abo bantu boshi bâli ba bûko bwa Aseri. Bâli bakulu binjà bwenêne b’emilala, bantu bakengwa na ba burhegesi bw’okunali, bakulu ba balwî b’ebîrha. Baganjagwa mirhwernirhwe boshi haguma, nfôla-miherho za bantu bihumbi makumi abirhi na ndarhu.<verse eid="1CH 7:40"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1CH 7"/>
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="1CH 8"/>
  <para style="s1">Agandi mazîno ga bene Benyamini</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CH 8:1"/>Benyamini abusire bagala barhanu: Bela, Ashebeli, Ahra, <verse eid="1CH 8:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CH 8:2"/>Noha na Rafa. <verse eid="1CH 8:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CH 8:3"/>Bela aburha abagala naye, bo: Adari, Gera, îshe wa Ehudi, <verse eid="1CH 8:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CH 8:4"/>Abishuwa, Naamani, Ahowa, <verse eid="1CH 8:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CH 8:5"/>Gera, Shefufanu na Huramu.<verse eid="1CH 8:5"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Abâli e Geba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CH 8:6"/>Bagala ba Ehudi, abàli bakulu b’emilala y’abantu b’e Geba, bo bahêkagwa e Manahati nka bashwêke, <verse eid="1CH 8:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CH 8:7"/>Naamani, ahiya na Gera. Oyo Gera îshe wa Uza na Ahihudi ye balulizagya. <verse eid="1CH 8:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CH 8:8"/>Shaharayimu ahulusa bakâge oku banali babirhi, Hushimu na Ba’ara, <verse eid="1CH 8:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CH 8:9"/>Arhôla owundi mukazi ye Hodeshi, aburha Yobabu, Zibiya, Mesha, Malkamo, <verse eid="1CH 8:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CH 8:10"/>Yeusi, Sakiya na Mirma. Abagala babà bakulu b’emilala.<verse eid="1CH 8:10"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Abayûbakaga e Ono n’e Ludo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CH 8:11"/>Erhi embere Sharayimu arhanziriburha bagala babirhi kuli mukâge Hushimu, bo: Abitubu na Elipali. <verse eid="1CH 8:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CH 8:12"/>Bagala ba Elipali, bo: Eberi, Misheyamu na Shemedi. Shemedi ayûbaka ecishagala ca Ono na Lodi n’emirhundu yabyo yoshi.<verse eid="1CH 8:12"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Abagula b’emilala y’emilala y’e Ayaloni</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CH 8:13"/>Beriya na Shema, abo bâli bagula b’emilala y’abantu b’e Ayaloni; balibirha oku bantu b’e Gati.<verse eid="1CH 8:13"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Abayûbakaga e Yeruzalemu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CH 8:14"/>Bagala ba Beriya, bo: Shashaki, Yeremoti, <verse eid="1CH 8:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CH 8:15"/>Zebadeya, Aradi, Ederi, <verse eid="1CH 8:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CH 8:16"/>Mikaeli, Yishpa na Yoha. <verse eid="1CH 8:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CH 8:17"/>Bagala ba Shimeyi, bo: Zebadeya, Meshulamu, Hizki, Haberi, <verse eid="1CH 8:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CH 8:18"/>Yishemarayi, Yiziliya na Yobabu. <verse eid="1CH 8:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CH 8:19"/>Bagala ba Shimeyi bo: Zikri, Zaboyi, <verse eid="1CH 8:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CH 8:20"/>Eliyenayi, <verse eid="1CH 8:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CH 8:21"/>Adaya, Beraya, Shimrati. <verse eid="1CH 8:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CH 8:22"/>Bagala ba Sheshaki, bo: Yishpani, Eberi, Eliyeli, <verse eid="1CH 8:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CH 8:23"/>Abdoni, Zikri, Hanani, <verse eid="1CH 8:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CH 8:24"/>Hananiya, Elamu, Antotiya, <verse eid="1CH 8:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1CH 8:25"/>Yifideya na Penuweli. <verse eid="1CH 8:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1CH 8:26"/>Bagala ba Yerobwâmi: Shamusherayi, Shehariya, Ataliya, <verse eid="1CH 8:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1CH 8:27"/>Yaareshiya, Eliya na Zikri. <verse eid="1CH 8:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1CH 8:28"/>Abo bo bâli baguma ba mirhwe-mirhwe y’emilala yâbo. Bàyûbakaga e Yeruzalemu, co cishagala câbo.<verse eid="1CH 8:28"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Ab’omu cishagala ca Gabaoni</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="1CH 8:29"/>Abi-Gabaoni ye warhangizagya ecishagala ca Gabaoni, mukâge izîno lyâge ye wali Maaka. <verse eid="1CH 8:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1CH 8:30"/>Omugala murhanzi ye wali Abdoni, ahirakwo Suri, Kishi, Ba’ali, Neri, Nadabu, <verse eid="1CH 8:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1CH 8:31"/>Gedori, Ahiyo, Zekeri, <verse eid="1CH 8:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="1CH 8:32"/>Mikloti, naye Mikloti aburha Shimeya. Aho nabo bàyûbakaga hôfi na bene wâbo haguma n’emilala yâbo omu cihugo c’e Yeruzalemu.<verse eid="1CH 8:32"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Obûko bwa Saulu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="1CH 8:33"/>Neri anaciburha Kishi, Kishi aburha Saulu, Saulu aburha abagala Yônatani, Malkishuwa, Abinadabu na Eshibali. <verse eid="1CH 8:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="1CH 8:34"/>Mugala wa Yônatani ye Merib­ Ba’ali aburha Mika. <verse eid="1CH 8:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="1CH 8:35"/>Bagala ba Mika, bo: Pitoni, Meleki, Tareya, Ahazi. <verse eid="1CH 8:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="1CH 8:36"/>Ahazi aburha Yehoada; Yehoada aburha Alemeti; Azmaveti na Zimri. Zimri aburha Motsa. <verse eid="1CH 8:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="1CH 8:37"/>Motsa aburha Bineya, omugala Rafa, omugala Eleyasa, omugala Aseli, <verse eid="1CH 8:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="1CH 8:38"/>Oyo Aseli aburha bâna ndarhu, amazîno gâbo, bo: Azrikamu, lubere lwâge, ahirakwo Bokru, Yishmaeli, Sheariya, Obadiya na Hanani. <verse eid="1CH 8:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="1CH 8:39"/>Aseli àgwêrhe omulumuna ye Esheki, ye waburhaga Ulam, lubere lwâge, Yeushi, wa kabirhi, na Elifêleti, wa kasharhu. <verse eid="1CH 8:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="1CH 8:40"/>Bagala ba Ulam babà bantu bakengwa na nfôla-miherho. Baburha bâna bâni na binjikulu bâbo banji, boshi haguma bantu igana na makumi arhanu. Abo bashokwîre boshi bâli b’oku bûko bwa Benyamini.<verse eid="1CH 8:40"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1CH 8"/>
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="1CH 9"/>
  <para style="ms1">II. Ecishagala ca Yeruzalemu: cishagala citagatîfu ca Bene-Israheli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CH 9:1"/>Bene Israheli boshi baliyandisirwe ngasi mulala kwâgo omu citabu c’abâmi b’Israheli n’ab’e Yûda; ci kwône balulizibwa e Babiloni erhi kugomera Nyamuzinda kurhuma. <verse eid="1CH 9:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CH 9:2"/>Abàgalusire burhangiriza okushubiyîsh’ibêra omu cihugo ca b’îshe bâli Banya-Isaraeli, abadâhwa, abaleviti n’abakozi b’omu ka­-Nyamuzinda. <verse eid="1CH 9:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CH 9:3"/>Omu cishagla ca Yeruzalemu mwâli bene Yûda, bene Benyamini, bene Efrayimu na bene Menashè. <verse eid="1CH 9:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CH 9:4"/>Ab’omu bûko bwa Yûda bàlimwo Utayi, mugala wa Amihudi, naye yêne ali mugala wa Omri, mwinjikulu wa Imri, mwinjikulûza wa Bâni, muntu w’omu bûko bwa Peresi, mugala wa Yûda. <verse eid="1CH 9:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CH 9:5"/>Omu bûko bwa Shela, àlimwo Asaya, nfula y’omulala gwâbo, ye n’abagala. <verse eid="1CH 9:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CH 9:6"/>Omu bûko bwa Zera, mwâli Yeuweli. Bene Yûda bâli aha Yeruzalemu, bâli bantu magana gali ndarhu na makumi gali mwenda. <verse eid="1CH 9:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CH 9:7"/>Omu bûko bwa Benyamini, alimwo Salu, mugala wa Meshulamu, mwinjikulu wa Hodaviya, mwinjikulûza wa Hasenuwa, <verse eid="1CH 9:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CH 9:8"/>àlimwo Yilineta, mugala wa Yerohamu; àlimwo Ela, mugala wa Uzi, mwinjikulu wa Mikri; àlimwo Meshulamu, mugala wa Shefatiya, mwinjikulu wa Reweli, mwinjikulûza wa Ibiniya. <verse eid="1CH 9:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CH 9:9"/>Abo bantu boshi bâli bagula b’emilala yâbo. Bene Benyamini bàliyûbasire e Yeruzalemu boshi gàli magana mwenda na makumi arhanu na ndarhu.<verse eid="1CH 9:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CH 9:10"/>Omurhwe gw’abadâhwa gwalimwo Yedaya, Yoyaribu, Yakini <verse eid="1CH 9:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CH 9:11"/>na Azariya. Bashakulûza bâge omu kuburhwa, bo: Hilkiya, Meshulamu, Sadoki, Merayoti na Ahitubu, mukulu w’aka-Nyamuzinda; <verse eid="1CH 9:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CH 9:12"/>bàligimwo na Adaya, bashakulûza bâge omu kuburhwa, àli Yerohamu, Pashehuri, Malkiya; hàligi na Masayi, bashakulûza bâge, bo: Adiyeli, Yazera, Meshulamu, Meshilemiti na Imeri. <verse eid="1CH 9:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CH 9:13"/>Kuhiragakwo n’abandi badâhwa. abo bagula b’emilala boshi haguma bâli cihumbi ciguma na magana gali nda na makumi gali ndarhu, boshi bantu bakengwa b’okujira omukolo gw’akà-Nyamuzinda.<verse eid="1CH 9:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CH 9:14"/>Omurhwe gw’abaleviti gwalimwo Shemaya, bashakulûza bâge omu kuburhwa, àli Hashubu, Azrikamu na Hashabiya, b’omu bûko bwa Merari; <verse eid="1CH 9:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CH 9:15"/>hàligi kandi Bakbakari, Hereshi, Galali na Matanya, bashakulûza bâbo omu kuburhwa bo Mika, Zikri na Azafi; <verse eid="1CH 9:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CH 9:16"/>balimwo na Obadiya, naye ba shakulûza bâge bo Shemaya, Galali na Yedutuni na buzinda Berekiya, mugala wa Asa, mwinjikulu wa Elkana, owayûbakaga omu côgo ca bene Netofa. <verse eid="1CH 9:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CH 9:17"/>Omu balanzi b’enyumvi, Shalumu ye wali mukulu wâbo, na bene wâbo Akubu, Talmoni na Ahimani. <verse eid="1CH 9:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CH 9:18"/>Abâna bâbo kuhika ene bo banacibà mw’o­ gwo mukolo aha muhango gw’ebushoshôkero, omuhango gwa mwâmi. Bashakulûza bâbo bo bàbâga balanzi b’emihango y’icumbi ly’abaleviti. <verse eid="1CH 9:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CH 9:19"/>Shalumu, mugala wa Korè, mwinjikulu wa Abiyasafi, mwinjikulûza wa Korè, haguma n’abandi bantu b’omulala gwa Korè, bàgwêrhe omukolo gw’okulanga omuhango gw’ihêma ly’okubugânana, nk’oku bashakulûza bâbo nabo bàgugwêrhe omu icumbi ly’olubaga lwa Nyakasane. <verse eid="1CH 9:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CH 9:20"/>Pinhasi, mugala wa Eleyazari, ye wali murhambo wâbo burhanzi, bulya Nyakasane àli haguma naye. <verse eid="1CH 9:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CH 9:21"/>Zakariya, mugala wa Meshelemiya naye àli mulanzi wa mihango y’ihêma ly’okubugânana.<verse eid="1CH 9:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CH 9:22"/>Abàli bacîshozirwe nka balanzi b’emihango gàli magana abirhi n’ikumi na ba babirhi. Bakâgiyandikirwa omu bishagala byâbo bàburhiragwa. Daudi bo n’omulêbi Samweli bo bàhâga bashakulûza bâbo eco cikono c’okukengwa: <verse eid="1CH 9:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CH 9:23"/>banayôrhanaga ogwo mukolo gw’emihango n’ogw’obulanzi bw’aka-Nyamuzinda ka Nyakasane kurhenga oku iburha kujà oku lindi. <verse eid="1CH 9:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CH 9:24"/>Hàli abalanzi bàkâgihirwa oku ngasi muhango oku yoshi enali ini: ebushoshôkero, ebuzikiro, ebulembe n’ebulyo. <verse eid="1CH 9:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1CH 9:25"/>Abandi balanzi bàlamaga omu bishagala byâbo, bàkâgiyishibarhabâla ngasi baguma omu cihe câbo, bajire ogwo mukolo gw’obulanzi mugobe muguma. <verse eid="1CH 9:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1CH 9:26"/>Ci kwône hàli bakulu bâni b’abalanzi barhàrhegagamwo ciru eriguma. Bo bajiraga omukolo gw’okulanga orhwonga rhw’omu ka-Nyamuzinda n’ogw’obuhirhi bwamwo bwoshi. <verse eid="1CH 9:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1CH 9:27"/>Bàkâgilâla balanga aka-Nyamuzinda obudufu bwoshi na kubà sêzi bazûkirize bakayigula.<verse eid="1CH 9:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="1CH 9:28"/>Abandi muli bo bàgwêrhe omukolo gw’okuganja ebirugu by’obugashânize byahêsirwe n’ebyagalusire. <verse eid="1CH 9:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1CH 9:29"/>Kandi n’abandi bàgwêrhe omukolo gw’okulanga ebirugu bikolesibwamwo, byo bintu bitagatîfu: enshâno, idivayi, amavurha, enshangi n’obukù. <verse eid="1CH 9:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1CH 9:30"/>Ci kwône omukolo gw’okuvanganya emvangè y’okuhumula gwanali mukolo gwa badâhwa bônene.<verse eid="1CH 9:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="1CH 9:31"/>Muleviti muguma, ye Matitiya, lubere lwa Shalumu. w’omu bûko bwa Korè, ye wali w’okujira emigati y’oburherekêre. <verse eid="1CH 9:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="1CH 9:32"/>Abandi baleviti baguma, b’omu bûko bwa Kehati, bàgwêrhe nabo omukolo gw’okujira emigati mitagatîfu yakâgirherekèrwa Nyamuzinda ngasi lwa Sabato.<verse eid="1CH 9:32"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="1CH 9:33"/>Abagula b’emilala y’abaleviti bakulu b’enyimbo, bàbâga omu zâbozâbo nyumpa z’omu ka-Nyamuzinda, bàlihanzîbwe okujira ogundi-gundi mukolo, bulya bakâg’ikola mûshi na budufu. <verse eid="1CH 9:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="1CH 9:34"/>Ntyo kwo abagula b’emilala y’abaleviti bàliyôsire omu kukulikirana omu maburhwa gâbo. Bàyûbakaga e Yeruzalemu.<verse eid="1CH 9:34"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Omolala gwa Saulu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="1CH 9:35"/>Abi-Gabaoni ye warhangizagya ecishagla ca Gabaoni, ye bo n’îshe Yeieli, bona mukâge Maaka, <verse eid="1CH 9:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="1CH 9:36"/>enfula yâge ye Abdoni n’abandi bagala, bo: Suri, Kishi, Ba’ali, Neri, Nadabu, <verse eid="1CH 9:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="1CH 9:37"/>Gedori, Ahiyo, Zakariya na Mikloti. <verse eid="1CH 9:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="1CH 9:38"/>Mikloti naye aburha Shimeyamu. Abo nabo bàyûbakaga hôfi na bene wâbo haguma n’emilala yâbo omu cihugo c’e Yeruzalemu. <verse eid="1CH 9:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="1CH 9:39"/>Neri anaciburha Kishi, Kishi aburha Saulu, na Saulu aburha Yônatani, Malkishuwa, Abinadabu na Îshebali. <verse eid="1CH 9:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="1CH 9:40"/>Mugala wa Yônatani ye Meribaali; Meribaali anaciburha Mika. <verse eid="1CH 9:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="1CH 9:41"/>Bagala ba Mika, bo: Pitoni, Meleki na Tareya. <verse eid="1CH 9:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="1CH 9:42"/>Ahazi aburha Yara, Yara naye aburha Alemeti, Azimaveti na Zimri, Zimri aburha Motsa, <verse eid="1CH 9:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="1CH 9:43"/>Motsa naye aburha Bineya, Bineya aburha Refaya, Refaya aburha Eleasa, na Eleasa aburha Aseli. <verse eid="1CH 9:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="1CH 9:44"/>Aseli àbusire bagala ndarhu, amazîno gâbo, gàgano: Azrikamu, Bokru, Ismaeli, Sheyariya, Obadiya na Hanani.<verse eid="1CH 9:44"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1CH 9"/>
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="1CH 10"/>
  <para style="s1">Okufà kwa Saulu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CH 10:1"/>Lusiku luguma Abafilistini bakoza entambala kuli bene-Israheli oku ntondo ya Gilbowa. Bene Israheli bakûla idârhi bakola bayâka, batumirhwa banayîrhwamwo banji bwenêne. <verse eid="1CH 10:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CH 10:2"/>Abafilistini baharhiriza Saulu bwenêne haguma n’abagala. Banaciyîrha Yônatani, Aminadabu na Malkishuwa, boshi bagala ba mwâmi. <verse eid="1CH 10:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CH 10:3"/>Kurhenga aho, obukali bw’entambala bwoshi bwayêrekera Saulu; erhi abalwî b’emyampi bàmubandâna, bamulashira aha ndâshi.<verse eid="1CH 10:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CH 10:4"/>Okubundi Saulu anacibwîra owalimubarhulîre emirasano, erhi: «Rhôla engôrho yâwe onyîrhemwo, bulya ntalonza ezo ntakembûlwa z’Abafilistini zibè zo zinyîrha zimpemukirekwo». Ci olya mwambali alahira bulya aliyôbohire bwenêne. Lêro Saulu arhôla engôrho yâge ayihamiramwo yênene. <verse eid="1CH 10:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CH 10:5"/>Erhi olya mubarhuzi w’emirasano abona oku nnawâbo amâfà, naye àrhega eyâge ngôrho, ayihamiramwo, boshi bafà ntyo kuguma. <verse eid="1CH 10:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CH 10:6"/>Ntyo kwo Saulu bo n’abagala basharhu bàfîre lusiku luguma; bwanabà bwo buzinda bw’omulala gwa mwâmi.<verse eid="1CH 10:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CH 10:7"/>Bene-Israheli bàyûbakaga ebwa lubanda boshi erhi bayumva oku omurhwe gw’Israheli gwayâsire, n’oku Saulu boshi n’abagala bagûkumusire, baleka ebishagala byâbo bayâka, Abafilistini bàyîsha bàbibêramwo.<verse eid="1CH 10:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CH 10:8"/>Erhi buca Abafilistini bayisha balitungôla emirhumba, babugâna Saulu n’abagala balangamire oku ntondo ya Gilbowa. <verse eid="1CH 10:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CH 10:9"/>Batungôla Saulu, bàmutwa irhwe balihêka, n’emirasano yâge, bazungulusa eyo minyago omu cihugo câbo, mpu lyo bamanyîsa ogwo mwanzi mwinjà omu bazimu bâbo n’omu lubaga lwâbo lwoshi. <verse eid="1CH 10:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CH 10:10"/>Cazînda emirasano yâge bayihira omu mahêro ga muzimu wâbo muguma, n’irhwe lya Saulu balimanika omu luhêro lwa Dagoni. <verse eid="1CH 10:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CH 10:11"/>Abantu b’e Yabeshi, omu Galadi, bayumva okwo kwoshi Abafilistini bahenyire Saulu. <verse eid="1CH 10:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CH 10:12"/>Ngasi ntwâli za balume zàli omu cishagala boshi bahârhûla, bagendilêrha emirhumba ya Saulu bo n’abagala bayihisa aha Yabeshi. Babisha amavuha gâbo ah’idako ly’omurhi, aha mutudu gw’e Yabeshi; okubundi bajira nsiku nda zoshi bali omu mishîbo y’okucîshalisa.<verse eid="1CH 10:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CH 10:13"/>Saulu afà bulya àligomîre Nyakasane: arhashibiriraga amarhegeko gâge, ciru anagendilaguza, iroho lya nyakwîgendera analidôse ihano, <verse eid="1CH 10:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CH 10:14"/>àhâli h’okuhûna ihano emwa Nyakasane. Nyamuzinda amuyîrha obwo; n’obwâmi bwâge abuhà Daudi, mugala wa Yese.<verse eid="1CH 10:14"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1CH 10"/>
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="1CH 11"/>
  <para style="ms1">III. Emyanzi ya Daudi, mwâmi w’Israheli</para>
  <para style="s1">Daudi àyîmikwa mwâmi w’Israheli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CH 11:1"/>Olubaga lwa bene-Israheli boshi banacishûbûlizanya aha Daudi ali e Hebroni, bamubwîra, mpu: «Rhuli ba bûko bwâwe, b’omu mulala gwa we. <verse eid="1CH 11:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CH 11:2"/>“Mîra, galya mango Saulu àciri mwâmi, we wakâgirhabâla n’emirhwe y’abalwî b’Israheli. Na Nyakasane, Nyamuzinda wâwe àli erhi akubwîzire, erhi: We warhegeka olubaga lwâni lw’Israheli, we wabà mukulu walurhambula”». <verse eid="1CH 11:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CH 11:3"/>Okubundi abagula b’Israheli boshi babugânana hali Daudi aha Hebroni. Daudi anywêraho ecihango haguma nabo embere za Nyakasane, nabo bamuyîmika mwâmi w’Israheli, nk’oku Samweli anali erhi àbabwizire Nyakasane àmurhumaga.<verse eid="1CH 11:3"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Daudi àgwârha ecishagala ca Yeruzalemu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CH 11:4"/>Daudi bona bene Israheli boshi bagendigorha Yeruzalemu. Ago mango erhi eco cishagala ciderhwa Yebusi, bulya Abayebusi bo bàbâga mw’eco cihugo, banacîbêreraga aha Yeruzalemu. <verse eid="1CH 11:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CH 11:5"/>Abayebusi babwîra Daudi, mpu: «Orhaje omu cishagala cîrhu.» Kurharhumaga Daudi arhagwârha olugo luzibuzibu lwa Siyoni, buzinda lwo lwayîshirikâderhwa mpu Murhundu gwa Daudi. <verse eid="1CH 11:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CH 11:6"/>Daudi àlidesire, erhi: «Omurhangiriza wankayîrha Muyebusi muguma ye wabà murhambo mukulu w’abalwî.» Yowabu, mugala wa Seruya, abà ye rhangikoza, ye wanabirage murhambo mukulu w’engabo y’abasirika. <verse eid="1CH 11:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CH 11:7"/>Daudi ahanda mw’olwo lugerêro luzibuzibu, kwarhuma baluyîrika «Murhundu gwa Daudi». <verse eid="1CH 11:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CH 11:8"/>Okubundi Daudi ayûbaka n’entambirhambi z’ogwo Murhundu zoshi zàkâgiderhwa burhanzi mpu Milo, erhi na Yowabu adwîrhe ayûbakûlula ezindi nyunda z’ecishagala. <verse eid="1CH 11:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CH 11:9"/>Daudi ajà àbà mudârhi ntyo kulusha, bulya Nyamuzinda w’Israheli àli baguma naye.<verse eid="1CH 11:9"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Abarhabâzi-ntwâli ba Daudi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CH 11:10"/>Aga go mazîno g’abarhabâzi-ntwâli barhangiriza ba Daudi. Bo bàmuyîmikaga mwâmi haguma na bene-Israheli boshi nk’oku Nyakasane analirhegesire omu biyêrekîre olubaga lwâge; banamuyôrhera bikubagirwa omu mango g’obwâmi bwâge goshi.<verse eid="1CH 11:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CH 11:11"/>Abo barhabâzi-ntwâli bàlimwo Yashabami, mugala wa Hakimoni, murhambo wa murhwe gwa basirika makumi asharhu; ye wazunguzagya itumu lyâge lusiku luguma omu ngabo y’abashombanyi magana asharhu, abahungumula omu matabâro ga lusiku luguma. <verse eid="1CH 11:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CH 11:12"/>Akuhira naye Eleyazari mugala wa Dodo mwene Ahowa, ye wali omu «Murhwe gwa Basharhu.» <verse eid="1CH 11:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CH 11:13"/>Ali hôfi na Daudi aha Pasi-Damimu amango Abafilistini bashûbûzanyagya oku matabâro; omurhwe gwa bene-Israheli gwakûla omulindi gwabayâka. Aho hàli ishwa ly’e ngano. <verse eid="1CH 11:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CH 11:14"/>Eleyazari bo n’abantu bâge bayîmanga mulya ishwa, afungira eryo ishwa anahima Abafilistini. Nyakasane aha Israheli ntyo okuhimana kw’e nkwîra.<verse eid="1CH 11:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CH 11:15"/>Lusiku luguma, bantu basharhu b’omu murhwe gw’entwâli «Makumi a sharhu», bajà emunda Daudi àli aha lwâla luli hôfi n’olukunda lw’Adulamu, bulya Abafilistini bâli batwîre icumbi omu kabanda k’Abarefayimi. <verse eid="1CH 11:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CH 11:16"/>Daudi erhi ali omu nyumpa yâge nzibuzibu y’olwâkiro, naye omurhambo w’Abafilistini erhi ahanzire e Betelehemu. <verse eid="1CH 11:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CH 11:17"/>Lusiku luguma enyôrha y’amîshi yagwârha Daudi, aderha, erhi; «Lêro kurhi nankabona owampisa oku mîshi ga lirya îriba libà hôfi n’omuhango gw’e Betelehemu nkaganywa!» <verse eid="1CH 11:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CH 11:18"/>Lêro balya barhabâzi oku banali basharhu bahulukâna omu mirhwe y’Abafilistini, bàdôma amîshi mw’eryo iriba liri hôfi n’omuhango gw’e Betelehemu, bayisha bagadwîrhîre Daudi. Ci kwône Daudi arhalonzagya okuganywa; ci abà Nyakasane ye agarhûla omu kugashandâza oku idaho ànaderha, erhi: <verse eid="1CH 11:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CH 11:19"/>«Nanga, Waliha Nyamuzinda, ntayêmêrîrwi okunywa aga mîshi. Ka kurhali nka kunywa omukò gw’abà bantu bajàgigalonza omu kuhâna obuzîne bwâbo!» Alahira ntyo okuganywa. Ntyo kwo ezo ntwâli zàyêrekîne oburhwâli bwâzo.<verse eid="1CH 11:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CH 11:20"/>Abishayi naye, mulumuna wa Yowabu, àli murhambo wa murhwe gwa «Makumi asharhu». Lusiku luguma ye wazunguzagya itumu lyâge omu ngabo ya bantu magana asharhu anabayîrha boshi. Acîbonera ntyo irenge mw’ogwo murhwe gw’entwâli Makumi asharhu; <verse eid="1CH 11:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CH 11:21"/>ajà irenge kabirhi kubalusha, ciru anahinduka ye murhambo wâbo, ci kwône arhagerezagya okuyumânana na gulya murhwe gwa «Basharhu».<verse eid="1CH 11:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CH 11:22"/>Benaya, w’e Kabseli, mugala wa Yehoyada, mwinjikulu wa muntu muguma wabàga naye ntwâli ya musirika, àlimanyîkîne oku abà kaheza-mbaga. Ye wayîrhaga balya ba Ariyeli babirhi b’e Mowabu; kandi ye wabungulukaga lusiku luguma, erhi n’olubula lwanîre lunji, ajà aha îriba ayîrhaho entale. <verse eid="1CH 11:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CH 11:23"/>Kandi ye wayîrhaga n’omuntu kabutindi w’e Mîsiri, obulî bwâge bwàli bwa makoro arhanu. Alifumbasire itumu ly’olusârhi lunênênè kulusha oburhunu bw’omulonge munene. Benaya yêhe agendimulwîsa erhi afumbasire akarhi kône, acîrhunika kw’oyo kabutindi w’e Mîsiri, àmunyaga eryo itumu lyâge lyo ànamuyîsiremwo. <verse eid="1CH 11:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CH 11:24"/>Kwo àrhwalihire ntyo Benayahu. <verse eid="1CH 11:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1CH 11:25"/>Acîbonera irenge omu murhwe gw’entwâli Makumi asharhu, ci kwône arhagerezagya okuyumânana n’omurhwe gwa Basharhu. Daudi amujira murhambo w’engabo zilanga aha bwâmi.<verse eid="1CH 11:25"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Abandi barhabâzi-ntwâli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="1CH 11:26"/>Abandi bâli barhabâzi ntwâli, bo: Asaheli, mulumuna wa Yowabu, Elehanani, mugala wa Dodo w’e Betelehemu, <verse eid="1CH 11:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1CH 11:27"/>Shamoti w’e Harori. Helesi w’e Peloni. <verse eid="1CH 11:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1CH 11:28"/>Ira, mugala wa Ikeshi w’e Tekowa. Abiyezeri w’e Anatoti. <verse eid="1CH 11:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1CH 11:29"/>Sibekayi, w’e Husha. Ilayi, w’e Aho. <verse eid="1CH 11:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1CH 11:30"/>Maharayi, w’e Netofa. Heledi, mugala wa Bânâ, w’e Netofa. <verse eid="1CH 11:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1CH 11:31"/>Itayi, mugala wa Ribayi, w’e Gibeya, omu cihugo ca Benyamini. Benaya, w’e Pireyatoni. <verse eid="1CH 11:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="1CH 11:32"/>Hurayi, w’ebwa nshalalo z’e Gaashi. Abiyeli, w’e Bet-Araba. <verse eid="1CH 11:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="1CH 11:33"/>Azimaveti, w’e Baharumu. Eliyaba, w’e Shaalboni. <verse eid="1CH 11:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="1CH 11:34"/>Bagala ba Hashemi, w’e Gizoni. Yônatani, mugala wa Shâge w’e Harari. <verse eid="1CH 11:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="1CH 11:35"/>Ahiyamu, mugala wa Sakari, w’e Harari, Elifeleti, mugala wa Uru. <verse eid="1CH 11:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="1CH 11:36"/>Heferi, w’e Mekera. Ahiya, w’e Peloni. <verse eid="1CH 11:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="1CH 11:37"/>Hesro w’e Karmeli. Naarayi, mugala wa Esbayi. <verse eid="1CH 11:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="1CH 11:38"/>Yoheli, mulumuna wa Natani. Mibihari, mugala wa Hagri. <verse eid="1CH 11:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="1CH 11:39"/>Seleki, w’e Amoni. Naharayi, w’e Beroti, ye wali mubarhuzi w’emirasano ya Yowabu, mugala wa Seruya. <verse eid="1CH 11:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="1CH 11:40"/>Ira, w’oku mulala gwa Yatiri, Garebu, naye wa kw’ogwo mulala gwa Yatiri, <verse eid="1CH 11:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="1CH 11:41"/>Uriya, Muhiti, Zabadi, mugala wa Ahalayi, <verse eid="1CH 11:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="1CH 11:42"/>Adina, mugala wa Shiza wa bûko bwa Rubeni, ye mukulu omu bûko bwa Rubeni na murhambo wa ntwâli Makumi asharhu. <verse eid="1CH 11:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="1CH 11:43"/>Hanani, mugala wa Maaka. Yoshafati, w’e Meteni. <verse eid="1CH 11:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="1CH 11:44"/>Uziya, w’e Ashetaroti. Shama, w’e Yeieli, bagala ba Hotamu w’e Aroweri. <verse eid="1CH 11:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="1CH 11:45"/>Yediyaeli, mugala wa Shimri na Yoha, mulumuna wâge w’e Tisi. <verse eid="1CH 11:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="1CH 11:46"/>Eliyeli, w’e Mahava. Yeribayi na Yoshaviya, bagala ba Elnamu. Itima, w’omu cihugo ca Mowabu, <verse eid="1CH 11:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="1CH 11:47"/>kuhirakwo na Eliyeli, Obedi na Yasiyeli, b’e Soba.<verse eid="1CH 11:47"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1CH 11"/>
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="1CH 12"/>
  <para style="s1">Abashimbûlizi barhanzi ba Daudi e Sikalagi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CH 12:1"/>Amango Daudi àlicîfulisire e Siklagi ajà ayâka Saulu, mugala wa Kishi, abantu bayîshimubugâna eyo munda. Bâli basirika ntwâli, ba kuhasha amatabâro; <verse eid="1CH 12:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CH 12:2"/>bâli bacîbambizize emiherho n’amatumu, bâli bamanyire okubanda amabuye erhi kulasha ebisonga n’amaboko gombi, okulembe n’oku lyo. Alaga abàrhengaga omu bûko bwa Benyamini, bwo bwanali bûko bwa Saulu yêne: <verse eid="1CH 12:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CH 12:3"/>Omurhambo Ahiyezeri, n’omulumuna Yowashi, bagala ba Shema, w’e Gibeya, Yezieli na Peleti, bagala ba Azimaveti, Beraka na Yehu, b’e Anatoti. <verse eid="1CH 12:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CH 12:4"/>Yishemaya, w’e Gabaoni, w’omu barhambo b’abarhabâzi ntwâli makumi asharhu. <verse eid="1CH 12:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CH 12:5"/>Yerimot, Yaziyeli, Yohanani na Yazabadi, b’e Gederoti. <verse eid="1CH 12:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CH 12:6"/>Elazayi, Yarimoti, Beyaliya, Shemariya na Shefatiya, b’e Harifu. <verse eid="1CH 12:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CH 12:7"/>Elkana, Isiya, Azareli, Yowezeri na Yerohamu, bene Korè, <verse eid="1CH 12:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CH 12:8"/>kuhirakwo Yowela na Zebadiya, bagala ba Yerohamu w’e Gedori. <verse eid="1CH 12:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CH 12:9"/>Abandi bantu b’e Gadi bagoma, mpu lyo bashimba Daudi emunda àlicîfulisire ebw’irungu. Bâli ntwâli bwenêne, bàyîshigilwa, bâli bamayire okucinga empenzi n’okulwa empenzi n’okulwa amatumu. Kwo bàyôbohagwa nka ntale na babidu nka rhushafu rhw’omu ntondo. <verse eid="1CH 12:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CH 12:10"/>Omukulu wâbo ye wali Ezeri, owa kabirhi Obadiya, owa kasharhu Eliyabu, <verse eid="1CH 12:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CH 12:11"/>owa kani Mishemana, owa karhanu Irimeya, <verse eid="1CH 12:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CH 12:12"/>owa kali ndarhu Atayi, owa kali nda Eliyeli, <verse eid="1CH 12:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CH 12:13"/>owa kali munâni Yohanani, owa kali mwenda Elizabadi, <verse eid="1CH 12:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CH 12:14"/>owa kali ikumi Irmeya, n’owa kali ikumi na muguma Makabani. <verse eid="1CH 12:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CH 12:15"/>Abo bâli b’e Gadi, barhambo b’emirhwe y’abasirika; abanyi muli bo bàbâga basirika igana, n’abinja kulusha abâbo b’abasirika cihumbi. <verse eid="1CH 12:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CH 12:16"/>Bo bàyîkiraga Yordani omu mwêzi murhanzi gw’omwâka, go mango Yordani ayunjulira kuhika oku bikûnguzo, bo bànalibirhaga oku bantu bàyûbakaga omu mmanda z’ebushoshôkero n’ebuzikiro.<verse eid="1CH 12:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CH 12:17"/>Omurhwe gwa bene Benyamini n’ogwa bene Yûda gwajibugâna Daudi emunda àli acîfulisire. <verse eid="1CH 12:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CH 12:18"/>Daudi ajà emunda bali ababwîra, erhi: «Akabà munyîshîre n’omuhigo gw’obuholo mpu muntabâle, mmuyankirîre n’omurhima gwoshi. Ci akabà gwa bulenzi mpu lyo mumpâna emw’abashombanyi bâni, Nyamuzinda wa bashakulûza abè ye muhamîrizi w’okwo, anammuhe obuhane». <verse eid="1CH 12:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CH 12:19"/>Lêro obwo Omûka gwa Nyamuzinda gwanacirhula kuli Amasayi, murhambo w’omurhwe gwa Makumi asharhu, anaciyâkûza, erhi:</para>
  <para style="b" vid="1CH 12:19"/>
  <para style="q1" vid="1CH 12:19">«Rhuli haguma nâwe,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1CH 12:19">rhuli b’olunda lwâwe</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1CH 12:19">wâni Daudi, mugala wa Yese!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1CH 12:19">Omurhûla gubà haguma nâwe,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1CH 12:19">gubè na haguma n’abadwîrhe bakurhabâla,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1CH 12:19">bulya Nyakasane, akulwanyirekwo.»</para>
  <para style="b" vid="1CH 12:19"/>
  <para style="p" vid="1CH 12:19">Daudi abayankirira anabahà ecikono c’okubà barhambo omu murhwe gwâge. <verse eid="1CH 12:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CH 12:20"/>Erhi ashubira e Siklagi, abandi bantu b’obûko bwa Menashè bajà kuli Daudi amango alonzagya okulungana n’Abafilistini erhi balwîsa Saulu. Ci kwône Daudi arhaciyumvanya bya n’Abafilistini, bulya abarhambo bâbo bamàmulahirira; babwirana, mpu: «Hali amango Daudi ankayîshija olunda lwa nnawâbo murhanzi, obone amarhuhâna emunda ali.» <verse eid="1CH 12:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CH 12:21"/>Okubundi acîshubiriraga e Sikalagi, lyo n’abandi bantu b’emwa Menashè bàmushimbirage yo, bo: Adna, Yozabadi, Elihu na Siletayi, barhambo b’omurhwe gw’abasirika ba Menashè. <verse eid="1CH 12:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CH 12:22"/>Boshi bâli barhabâzi ntwâli, bayîshirhabâla omurhwe gwa Daudi. Bahinduka barhambo b’omurhwe gwâge. <verse eid="1CH 12:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CH 12:23"/>Ngasi lusiku abantu bayîshikâcîlunga oku murhwe gwa Daudi, kuhika omurhwe gwâge gwalinda guluga bwenêne.<verse eid="1CH 12:23"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Omubalè gw’abasirika ba Daudi aha Hebroni</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CH 12:24"/>Alaga omubalè gw’abantu bankahashilwa amatumu bàcilungaga kuli Daudi e Hebroni, mpu lyo bamuhà obwâmi bwa Saulu, nk’oku Nyakasane anali arhegesire: <verse eid="1CH 12:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1CH 12:25"/>Bene Yûda, basirika bihumbi ndarhu na magana gali munâni, banacîbambizize empenzi n’amatumu. <verse eid="1CH 12:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1CH 12:26"/>Ab’obûko bwa Simoni, basirika ntwâli bihumbi nda n’igana. <verse eid="1CH 12:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1CH 12:27"/>Ab’obûko bwa Levi, bantu bihumbi bini na magana gali ndarhu, <verse eid="1CH 12:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1CH 12:28"/>na Yehoyada, murhambo w’obûko bwa bene Aroni, àlilusibwe na bantu bihumbi bisharhu na magana gali nda; <verse eid="1CH 12:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1CH 12:29"/>hàligi n’omwâna w’omusole ye Sadoki, ntwâli ya musirika, erhi adwîrhe barhambo makumi abirhi na babirhi b’oku mulala gwâge. <verse eid="1CH 12:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1CH 12:30"/>Ab’obûko bwa Benyamini, gwo gunaligi mulala gwa Saulu, bantu bihumbi bisharhu. Na banji muli bo bàcikâgikolera Saulu kuhika ago mango; <verse eid="1CH 12:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1CH 12:31"/>ab’obûko bwa Efrayimu, basirika ntwâli bihumbi makumi abirhi na magana gali munâni, boshi bantu bakengwa omu milala yâbo. <verse eid="1CH 12:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="1CH 12:32"/>Ecigabi c’oku bûko bwa Menashè, bantu bihumbi ikumi na munâni, bâli bacîshozirwe kwâgo mpu bajiyîmika Daudi abè mwâmi. <verse eid="1CH 12:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="1CH 12:33"/>Ab’oku bûko bwa Isakari, barhambo ba basirika magana abirhi, haguma n’abantu bâbo bàkâgirhegeka, boshi bantu ba bukengêre balya bankahashimanya bici na bici bene-Israheli bakwânîne bajire. <verse eid="1CH 12:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="1CH 12:34"/>Ab’oku bûko bwa Zabuloni, basirika bihumbi makumi arhanu, boshi bayigîrizibwe bwinjà, banacirheganyize okujà oku cigamba c’amatabâro, ba kulerhera abandi omurhima gw’oburhwâli, bànali bacîbambirize emirasano ya ngasi lubero. <verse eid="1CH 12:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="1CH 12:35"/>Ab’oku bûko bwa Nefutali, barhambo cihumbi na basirika bâbo bihumbi makumi asharhu na nda bacîbambirize empenzi n’amatumu. <verse eid="1CH 12:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="1CH 12:36"/>Ab’oku bûko bwa Dani, bihumbi makumi abirhi na munâni bya basirika balingûzize okujà oku cigamba c’amatabâro. <verse eid="1CH 12:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="1CH 12:37"/>Ab’oku bûko bwa Aseri, basirika bihumbi makumi anni byàyigirizîbwe bwinjà okulwa, nabo balingûzize okujà oku cigamba c’amatabâro.<verse eid="1CH 12:37"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="1CH 12:38"/>Abantu b’oku bûko bwa Rubeni, n’ab’oku bûko bwa Gadi n’ecigabi c’oku bûko bwa Menashè, bo baligi balya bàbâga ishiriza lya Yordani. Bayisha basirika bihumbi igana na makumi abirhi bacîbambizize emirasano ya ngasi lubero.<verse eid="1CH 12:38"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="1CH 12:39"/>Abo bantu boshi bâli basirika bacîrheganyize oku matabâro. Banaciyisha na murhima muguma e Hebroni, bàyîmika Daudi mwâmi kuli bene-Israheli boshi. Abandi bene-Israheli nabo bayêmîre okumuhà obwo bwâmi. <verse eid="1CH 12:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="1CH 12:40"/>Babêra eyo munda nsiku isharhu zoshi bo na Daudi, bakazirya bananywa ngasi byoshi bene wâbo bâli babarheganyize. <verse eid="1CH 12:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="1CH 12:41"/>Na kulusha aho, abandi bantu b’ebishagala bya hôfi hôfi, ciru bene Isakari, bene Zabuloni na bene Nefutali, bàkâgilêrha ennundo z’ebiryo oku ndogomi: enshâno, emizêti, ebihadu by’emizâbîbu, idivayi, amavurha, ciru bàkazilêrha n’enkafu n’ebibuzi. Ecihugo coshi calama omu bushagaluke bunene.<verse eid="1CH 12:41"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1CH 12"/>
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="1CH 13"/>
  <para style="s1">Daudi ahiga okulêrha omucîmba gw’amalaganyo e Yeruzalemu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CH 13:1"/>Daudi anacijà omu ihano haguma n’abakulu b’abasirika bâge, àbayimangira ebihumbi n’abayimangira amagana, haguma n’abandi barhambo b’olubaga. <verse eid="1CH 13:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CH 13:2"/>Okubundi anacibwîra bene-Israheli bâli bashûbûzinye haguma, erhi: «Mukabona kuli kwinjà, n’akabà kwo Nyakasane Nyamuzinda wîrhu alonzize, jiri rhurhumize bene wîrhu basigîre omu cihugo c’Israheli coshi, kwâgo kwâgo abadâhwa n’abaleviti emunda banayûbaka yoshi omu bishagala byâbo. Rhubahamagale bacilunge nîrhu. <verse eid="1CH 13:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CH 13:3"/>“Okubundi rhugend’ilêrha omucîmba gwa Nyamuzinda eno mwîrhu, bulya ntà mango rhwacigererize okushîbirira ogwo mucîmba kurhenga omu nsiku za Saulu”».<verse eid="1CH 13:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CH 13:4"/>Abantu bàliho boshi bàbona oku kwo binali, bayêmêra. <verse eid="1CH 13:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CH 13:5"/>Daudi anacirhumizagya bene-Israheli b’omu cihugo coshi, kurhenga elubibi lwa Mîsiri kuhika aha ecihugo ca Hamati cirhangirire mpu bayîshe bagendilonza omucîmba gwa Nyamuzinda e Kiriyati-Yearimu. <verse eid="1CH 13:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CH 13:6"/>Cazînda bene-Israheli boshi bashimba Daudi kuhika e Baala, olunda lwa Kiriyati-Yearimu, omu cihugo ca Yûda, mpu bakûleyo omucîmba gwa Nyamuzinda, ogwo mucîmba gwagwêrhe izîno lya «Nyamubâho obwârhîre enyanya za ba-Kerubi.» <verse eid="1CH 13:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CH 13:7"/>Gwàli omu mwa Abinadabu. Bagudêkereza oku ngâlè mpyâhya, yàyîshaga yagendesibwa na Uza bo na Ahiyo. <verse eid="1CH 13:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CH 13:8"/>Daudi bo na bene-Israheli boshi bàjàga bayêrekana omwîshingo gwâbo n’emisî yâbo yoshi: bajà bàyimba banaziha orhurhêra, ennanga, engoma, enzenze n’ezindi nzihwa za ngasi lubero. <verse eid="1CH 13:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CH 13:9"/>Erhi bahika hôfi n’aha Cibuga ca Kidoni, enkafu zàlinzihirimya gulya mucîmba gwa Nyamubâho bulya zamasârhala. Uza alambûla okuboko mpu agurhange gulekirhibuka. <verse eid="1CH 13:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CH 13:10"/>Lêro oburhè bwa Nyakasane bwanacibirunduka bwenêne erhi ye rhuma, anamuhana bulya amagereza okuhuma kw’ogwo mucîmba gw'Amalaganyo. Uza anacifîra ho n’aho embere za Nyakasane. <verse eid="1CH 13:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CH 13:11"/>Daudi agaya bwenêne kulya kubà Nyakasane amàyîrha Uza; aho hantu Daudi ahayîrika izîno lya Peresi-Uza; yo n’izîno hanaciderhwa kuhika ene.<verse eid="1CH 13:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CH 13:12"/>Olwo lusiku Daudi ayôboha Nyamuzinda bwenêne anaderha, erhi: «Ntà nkahêka ogu mucîmba gwa Nyamuzinda aha mwâni la!» <verse eid="1CH 13:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CH 13:13"/>Arhanaciguhêkaga emwâge obwo, omu murhundu gwa Daudi, ci bagendiguhira omu nyumpa ya Obedi-Edomu, mulume w’e Gati. <verse eid="1CH 13:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CH 13:14"/>Omucîmba gwabêra omu mulala gwa Obedi-Edomu myêzi isharhu, Nyakasane agisha omulala gwâge n’ebintu byâge byoshi.<verse eid="1CH 13:14"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1CH 13"/>
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="1CH 14"/>
  <para style="s1">Daudi aha Yeruzalemu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CH 14:1"/>Huramu, mwâmi w’e Tiri, alikira mwâmi Daudi entumwa, amurhumira empaho z’emirhi y’emiyerezi haguma n’abantu b’okugôya amabuye n’ababinji b’empaho, b’okumuyûbakira enyumpa y’obwâmi. <verse eid="1CH 14:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CH 14:2"/>Daudi amanya bwinjinjà obwo oku Nyakasane yêne wamujizire mwâmi w’Iraheli n’oku obwâmi bwâge bwalangashana irenge linene erhi Israheli lubaga lwa Nyamuzinda lurhuma.<verse eid="1CH 14:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CH 14:3"/>Daudi ashubirhôlera abandi bakazi aha Yeruzalemu ababurhakwo abandi bâna-rhabana n’abâna-nyere. <verse eid="1CH 14:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CH 14:4"/>Alaga amazîno g’abagala bàburhiragwa aha Yeruzalemu: Shamuwa, Shobabu, Natani, Salomoni; <verse eid="1CH 14:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CH 14:5"/>Yibehari, Elishuwa, Elipeleti, <verse eid="1CH 14:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CH 14:6"/>Noga, Nefegi, Yafiya, <verse eid="1CH 14:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CH 14:7"/>Elishamaʿ, Beeliyada na Elifeleti.<verse eid="1CH 14:7"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Daudi àhima Abafilistini</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CH 14:8"/>Abafilistini bamanya oku Daudi ayîmisirwe okubà mwâmi wa bene-Israheli boshi haguma; banacishûbûzanya mpu bajè balonza Daudi bamugwârhe. Daudi amanya ogwo mwanzi analonza okubabugâna. <verse eid="1CH 14:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CH 14:9"/>Abafilistini banaciyisha mwandu, basherêza akabanda k'Abarefayiti. <verse eid="1CH 14:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CH 14:10"/>Daudi agendidôsa Nyamubâho, erhi: «Ka ngendikoza Abafilistini? Ka wabahira omu maboko gâni?» Nyakasane amushuza, erhi: «Genda obakoze. Nabahira omu nfune zâwe.» <verse eid="1CH 14:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CH 14:11"/>Abafilistini banacihârhûla, bahika aha Baali-Perazimu, ho Daudi àbahimîre. Daudi anaciderha, erhi: «Nyakasane, anakundwîre omulongo gw’abashombanyi bâni nka kula enshalalo ekundûla ecikunguzo c’olwîshi.» Okwo kwarhuma aho hantu hayîrikwa izîno lya Baali-Perazimu, kwo kuderha «Mukulu wa Bakunduzi». <verse eid="1CH 14:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CH 14:12"/>Emunda Abafilistini bàyâkiraga bulya bamàhimwa, n’aho bàhimiragwa bajà basigaho enshusho z’abazimu bâbo; Daudi arhegeka mpu bazidûlike muliro. <verse eid="1CH 14:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CH 14:13"/>Abafilistini bashubiyîsha barhabîre omu kabanda k’Abarefayiti. <verse eid="1CH 14:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CH 14:14"/>Daudi ashubidôsa Nyamuzinda, Nyakasane amushuza, erhi: Orhabakolezagya emugongo, ci ogendibazungulukira erhali hôfi ebwa mirhi y’emiforsadi. <verse eid="1CH 14:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CH 14:15"/>Hano oyumva olubî lw’emidindîrî enyanya z’emirhi, onakoze entambala, bulya ago mango erhi namakushokolera njilambika omurhwe gw’Abafilistini. <verse eid="1CH 14:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CH 14:16"/>Daudi anacijira nk’oku arhegekagwa na Nyamuzinda. Bene-Israheli bahima Abafilistini ntyo banabashimba kurhenga e Gabaoni kuhika cingana e Gezeri. <verse eid="1CH 14:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CH 14:17"/>Kurhenga ago mango irenge lya Daudi lyàlumîra omu bihugo byoshi, na Nyakasane amujira wa kuyôbohwa omu mashanja goshi.<verse eid="1CH 14:17"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1CH 14"/>
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="1CH 15"/>
  <para style="s1">Daudi arheganya okugendilêrha omucîmba gw’amalaganyo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CH 15:1"/>Daudi anaciyûbakisa enyumpa zâge omu Murhundu gwa Daudi. arheganya hantu haguma ayîmanzaho ihêma lyayîshijamwo omucîmba gw’Amalaganyo gwa Nyamuzinda. <verse eid="1CH 15:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CH 15:2"/>Okubundi anaciderha, erhi: «Abaleviti bônene bayêmêrîrwe okubarhula omucîmba gwa Nyamuzinda; bulya bo Nyamuzinda àcîshozire kw’ogwo mukolo gw’okukazigubarhula n’okumurhumikira ensiku zoshi.»<verse eid="1CH 15:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CH 15:3"/>Daudi ashûbûliza bene-Israheli boshi e Yeruzalemu mpu bagendilêrha Omucîmba gwa Nyamuzinda, lyo guhirwa ahantu àgurheganyîze. <verse eid="1CH 15:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CH 15:4"/>Ashûbûza abadâhwa, b’obûko bwa Aroni, haguma n'Abaleviti. <verse eid="1CH 15:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CH 15:5"/>Abo baleviti bàlimwo omurhambo Uriyeli, haguma na bandi bantu igana na makumi abirhi b’obûko bwa Kehati. <verse eid="1CH 15:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CH 15:6"/>Omurhambo Asaya na bandi bantu magana abirhi na makumi abirhi b’obûko bwa Merari; <verse eid="1CH 15:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CH 15:7"/>omurhambo Yoheli, haguma na bandi bantu igana na makumi asharhu b’obûko bwa Gershomi; <verse eid="1CH 15:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CH 15:8"/>omurhambo Shemaya, na bandi bantu magana abirhi b’obûko bwa Elisafani; <verse eid="1CH 15:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CH 15:9"/>omurhambo Eliyeli, na bandi bantu makumi gali munâni b’obûko bwa Hebroni; <verse eid="1CH 15:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CH 15:10"/>omurhambo Aminadabu, na bandi igana n’ikumi na babirhi b’obûko bwa Uziyeli.<verse eid="1CH 15:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CH 15:11"/>Daudi ahamagala abadâhwa Sadoki na Abiyatari, n’abaleviti Uriyeli, Asaya, Yoheli, Shemaya, Eliyeli na Aminadabu. <verse eid="1CH 15:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CH 15:12"/>Ababwîra, erhi: «Mwe muli bakulu b’emilala y’Abaleviti, mucîshukûle, mucè, mwe n’abantu b’emilala yinyu, okubundi mugendilonza omucîmba gwa Nyakasane, Nyamuzinda w’Israheli, muguhêke aha nagurheganyîze. <verse eid="1CH 15:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CH 15:13"/>Nyakasane Nyamuzinda wîrhu àrhuhanyire burhanzi bulya mw’oyo murhâliho. Kwo binali rhurhàli rhumudôsize kurhi rhurhegesirwe okujira.» <verse eid="1CH 15:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CH 15:14"/>Abadâhwa n’abaleviti bacîshukûlaga obwo omu kucîrheganya okuyîshibarhula omucîmba gwa Nyakasane Nyamuzinda w’Israheli. <verse eid="1CH 15:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CH 15:15"/>Cazînda abaleviti babarhulaga omucîmba oku mirhamba yagwo aha birhugo byâbo, nk’oku Nyakasane ànalirhegesire Mûsa oku kwo bakzigubarhula.<verse eid="1CH 15:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CH 15:16"/>Daudi anacirhegeka abarhambo b’abaleviti obwo, mpu bakereke bene wâbo bâli bakwânîne bajè bayimba n’okuziha ennanga, enzenze, emishekera, abarhimbi b’engoma n’ezindi nzihwa za ngasi lubero bànagwêrhe, n’okuyêrekana omwîshingo gwâbo munene omu mulya gw’enzihwa zilongîre bwinjinjà. <verse eid="1CH 15:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CH 15:17"/>Abaleviti bagoshôla Hemani, mugala wa Yoheli, n’owâbo Azafi, mugala wa Berekiya, n’owundi Etani, mugala wa Kushayahu, w’obûko bwa Merari. <verse eid="1CH 15:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CH 15:18"/>Omurhwe gwa kabirhi gwa bene wâbo, bàlimwo: Zakariya, Beni, Yaziyeli, Shemiramoti, Yehiyeli, Uni, Eliyabu, Benaya, Maseya, Matitiya, Eliflehu, Mikneyahu, Obedimoti, Yehiyeli, Uni, Eliyabu, Benaya, Maseya, Matitiya, Eliflehu, Mikneyahu, Obedi-Edomu, Yeyieli, Balanzi b’omuhango. <verse eid="1CH 15:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CH 15:19"/>Abimbiza Hemani, Azafi na Etani bakaziziha enzihwa z’omulinga zilongîre bwinjà bwenêne. <verse eid="1CH 15:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CH 15:20"/>Zakariya, Aziyeli, Shemiramoti, Yehiyeli, Uni, Eliyabu Maaseya na Benaya bakaziziha ennanga z’izù liriri. <verse eid="1CH 15:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CH 15:21"/>Matitiya, Eliflehu, Mikneya, Obedi­ Edomu, Yehiyeli na Azaziya bakaziziha enzenze za mirya munâni. <verse eid="1CH 15:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CH 15:22"/>Kenaniya, mukulu w’abaleviti bazihi, ye wakâgihâna izù ly’enyimbo. <verse eid="1CH 15:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CH 15:23"/>Berekiya na Elkana balanzi b’emihango bâli bakwânîne babêre hôfi n’omucîmba gw’Amalaganyo, <verse eid="1CH 15:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CH 15:24"/>haguma n’abandi balanzi Obedi-Edomu na Yehiya. Nabo abadâhwa Shebaniya, Yoshafati, Netaneyeli, Amasayi, Zakariya, Benaya na Eliyezeri bakazibûha emishekera embere ly’omucîmba gwa Nyamubâho.<verse eid="1CH 15:24"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Omucîmba gw’Amalaganyo gwahika aha Yeruzalemu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="1CH 15:25"/>Daudi, bo n’abagula b’Israheli n’abakulu b’abasirika bâli bajirilonza omucîmba gw’Amalaganyo ga Nyakasane emwa Obedi-Edomu, bâli omu bushagaluke bunene. <verse eid="1CH 15:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1CH 15:26"/>Nyamuzinda naye ahira obulanzi bwâge oku baleviti bâli babarhwîre omucîmba; okubundi banacimurherekêra mpanzi nda na biganda-buzi nda. <verse eid="1CH 15:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1CH 15:27"/>Daudi àli ayambîrhe ecishûli c’ecitâni cirembu, kuguma n’abaleviti bâli babarhwîre omucîmba, n’abazihi b’enzihwa na Kenaniya mwimangizi w’olugendo. Na kandi Daudi àli ayambîrhe efodi y’abadâhwa y’ecitâni.<verse eid="1CH 15:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="1CH 15:28"/>Bene-Israheli boshi balêrha omucîmba gw’Amalaganyo e Yeruzalemu omu cihôgêro c’amasîma, banabûha empembe n’emishekera, n’enzihwa n’emijegereza, ennanga n’enzenze. <verse eid="1CH 15:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1CH 15:29"/>Erhi omucîmba guhika omu Murhundu gwa Daudi, Mikala, mwâli wa Saulu, alolera aha kabonezo abona mwâmi Daudi oku ayisha asâma n’omwîshingo. Lêro anacimugayaguza bwenêne omu murhima gwâge.<verse eid="1CH 15:29"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1CH 15"/>
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="1CH 16"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CH 16:1"/>Banaciyîshidêkereza omucîmba omu ihêma Daudi àli agurheganyize. Okubundi barherekêra Nyamuzinda enterekêro z’okusingônolwa n’enterekêro z’omurhûla. <verse eid="1CH 16:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CH 16:2"/>Erhi Daudi àyûsihâna ezo nterekêro, agisha olubaga oku izîno lya Nyakasane. <verse eid="1CH 16:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CH 16:3"/>Cazînda agabira bene-Israheli ebiryo: ngasi mulume na ngasi mukazi bakazihâbwa omugati muburungusè, ecihimbi c’omugati gw’obununîrizi gwa mabo n’ecitumbura c’emizâbîbu myûmu.<verse eid="1CH 16:3"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Abaleviti bàyimba irenge lya Nyakasane</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CH 16:4"/>Daudi ahira abaleviti baguma b’okurhumikira embere z’omucîmba gwa Nyakasane, mpu bagashânize, bakuze banahè Nyakasane Nyamuzinda w’Israheli irenge. <verse eid="1CH 16:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CH 16:5"/>Azafi akazibahabûla na Zakariya ye wakâgimurhabâla. Yeziyeli, Shemiramoti, Yehiyeli. Matitiya, Eliyabu, Benaya, Obedi-Edomu na Yaiyeli bakaziziha ennanga n’enzenze, naye Azafi akazivuza ebyûma by’omulinga bilongîre bwenêne. <verse eid="1CH 16:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CH 16:6"/>Abadâhwa Benaya na Yaziyeli bakazibûha emishekera burhahusa embere z’omucîmba gwa Nyakasane. <verse eid="1CH 16:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CH 16:7"/>Olwo lusiku Daudi yêne ye murhangiriza asinga Olwimbo lw’okukuza Nyakasane, aluhà Azafi mpu aluyimbe haguma na bene wâbo, baderhe, mpu<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">16, 7 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Olwo lwimbo lushushire olulanga lwa 105; 96; 106.</char></note>:<verse eid="1CH 16:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CH 16:8"/>Mukuze Nyakasane, muyâlîze izîno lyâge;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1CH 16:8">muderhere ebijiro byâge by’enkwîra embere z’abantu.<verse eid="1CH 16:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CH 16:9"/>Mumuyimbire, mudumûle oluzihwa embere zâge,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1CH 16:9">murharhamaga n’okuganîra ebirhangâzo byâge.<verse eid="1CH 16:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CH 16:10"/>Izîno lyâge ly’irenge, lyo imerero ly’obukuze bwinyu,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1CH 16:10">bwo burhûlirize bw’emirhima y’abantu balongereza Nyakasane.<verse eid="1CH 16:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CH 16:11"/>Muyêrekere emunda Nyakasane Ogala-byoshi ali,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1CH 16:11">mukaziyôrha mulongereza obusù bwâge.<verse eid="1CH 16:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CH 16:12"/>Mukengêre ebisômerîne ajizire,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1CH 16:12">eby’okurhangâza n’okutwa emmanja kw’ekanwa kâge.<verse eid="1CH 16:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CH 16:13"/>Binjikulu b’Israheli bo bâli barhumisi bâge,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1CH 16:13">bene Yakôbo bo bâli bîshogwa bâge.<verse eid="1CH 16:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CH 16:14"/>Nyakasane yêne Nyamuzinda wîrhu;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1CH 16:14">Yêne ye mutwî w’emmanja w’igulu lyoshi.<verse eid="1CH 16:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CH 16:15"/>Mukazikengera endagâno yâge ensiku zoshi,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1CH 16:15">Akanwa kâge kabà kimâna kuhika oku maburhwa cihumbi.<verse eid="1CH 16:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CH 16:16"/>Kalya kanwa àfundikaga bo na Abrahamu,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1CH 16:16">erya ndahiro àlahiriraga Izaki.<verse eid="1CH 16:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CH 16:17"/>Kalya agwîkaga kashuba irhegeko kuli Yakôbo,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1CH 16:17">kanabà ndagâno y’ensiku n’amango kuli Israheli.<verse eid="1CH 16:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CH 16:18"/>Bulyâla aderha, erhi: Nakugabira ishwa lya Kanâni,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1CH 16:18">bishube byo binyu birugu by’omwîmo.<verse eid="1CH 16:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CH 16:19"/>Amango bàciri banyi,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1CH 16:19">amango barhàli baciluga banabà bigolo eyo mwa bene.<verse eid="1CH 16:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CH 16:20"/>Amango bakazâgijà babunga,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1CH 16:20">batwîka mwâmi bashige wundi.<verse eid="1CH 16:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CH 16:21"/>Ci kwône ntâye Nyamuzinda àzigire abarhindibuza,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1CH 16:21">ciru banarhuma hajira abâmi abâna.<verse eid="1CH 16:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CH 16:22"/>Mpu: Murhahîra mukahuma oku nshâgi zâni,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1CH 16:22">mpu: murhahîra mukashunga abalêbi bâni olûnu!<verse eid="1CH 16:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CH 16:23"/>Mwe bantu b’igulu lyoshi, yimbiri Nyakasane,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1CH 16:23">mukazimanyîsa bwaca bwayira oku kuciza aciza.<verse eid="1CH 16:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CH 16:24"/>Irenge lyâge muliganîre omu karhî k’ab’emahanga,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1CH 16:24">ebi àjizire by’okurhangâza mubimanyîse omu mashanja goshi.<verse eid="1CH 16:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="1CH 16:25"/>Bulya Nyakasane ali mukulu, anakwânîne ajè irenge.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1CH 16:25">Akwânîne ayôbohwe kulusha abandi banyamuzinda boshi.<verse eid="1CH 16:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="1CH 16:26"/>Bulyâla banyamuzinda w’abapagani linali ibumba,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1CH 16:26">Nyakasane yêhe ye wajiraga amalunga.<verse eid="1CH 16:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="1CH 16:27"/>Obwâmi n’obumoleke bimushokolîre,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1CH 16:27">entebe yâge buhashe n’obulangashane buyirikwo.<verse eid="1CH 16:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="1CH 16:28"/>Mwe bantu b’igulu lyoshi,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1CH 16:28">muyâlîze irenge lyâge n’obuhashe bwâge.<verse eid="1CH 16:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="1CH 16:29"/>Yîshi muyâlîze irenge lyâge,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1CH 16:29">mulêrhe entûlo zinyu embere zâge.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1CH 16:29">Muyûnamire oku idaho embere za Nyakasane,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1CH 16:29">amango ayêrekana obwimâna bwâge.<verse eid="1CH 16:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="1CH 16:30"/>Mujugume embere zâge, mwe bihugo mweshi,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1CH 16:30">igulu àlizibuhize mpu lirhagihuligana.<verse eid="1CH 16:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="1CH 16:31"/>Amalunga gacîshinge, n’igulu lishembuke.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1CH 16:31">Baderhe omu mashanja goshi, mpu: Nyakasane ye Mwâmi!<verse eid="1CH 16:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="1CH 16:32"/>Enyanja ekûnguze haguma n’ebimuli byoshi:</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1CH 16:32">Amashwa gashagaluke haguma n’ebimuli byoshi.<verse eid="1CH 16:32"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="1CH 16:33"/>Emirhi y’emuzirhu ebande orhuhababo rhw’omwîshingo</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1CH 16:33">embere za Nyakasane, bulya ayîshitwira igulu olubanja.<verse eid="1CH 16:33"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="1CH 16:34"/>Mukuze Nyakasane bulya ali mwinjà,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1CH 16:34">obuzigire bwâge buli bw’ensiku n’amango.<verse eid="1CH 16:34"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="1CH 16:35"/>Mumuyâkûze, mpu: Nyamuzinda Mucunguzi wîrhu, orhucize,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1CH 16:35">orhulîkûze oku mashanja g’ihanga onarhushûbûze.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1CH 16:35">Hano rhukola rhwakukuza, rhwakaziderha Izîno lyâwe litagatîfu,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1CH 16:35">rhucîshingire okukugashâniza.<verse eid="1CH 16:35"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="1CH 16:36"/>Ayâgirwe Nyakasane, Nyamuzinda w’Israheli,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1CH 16:36">mukazimuvuga omunkwa, ngasi mango.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1CH 16:36">N’endêko yoshi yàyakûza, mpu: Amen! Aleluya!</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1CH 16:36">Mukuze Nyakasane!<verse eid="1CH 16:36"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="1CH 16:37"/>Cazinda Daudi arhegeka Azafi na bene wâbo mpu babêre aha burhambi b’omucîmba gw’endagâno ya Nyakasane, bakazirhumikira embere ly’omucîmba ngasi lusiku nk’oku byanali birhegesirwe. <verse eid="1CH 16:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="1CH 16:38"/>Agoshôla na Obedi-Edomu haguma na bene wâbo makumi gali ndarhu na munâni mpu bakazilanga emihango, haguma na Obedi-Edomu, mugala wa Yedutuni na Hosa. <verse eid="1CH 16:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="1CH 16:39"/>Daudi aha amudâhwa Sadoki n’abandi badâhwa bene wâbo omukolo gw’okurhumikira e mbêre ly’ihêma lya Nyakasane oku ntondo ya Gabaoni, <verse eid="1CH 16:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="1CH 16:40"/>mpu bakaziyôrha barherekêra Nyakasane enterekêro z’okusingônolwa oku luhêrero ngasi sêzi na bijingo, n’okuyûkiriza ngasi mikolo enayandisirwe omu irhegeko Nyakasane àhâga Israheli. <verse eid="1CH 16:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="1CH 16:41"/>Bâli bo na Hemani, Yedutuni n’abandi bantu bâli bacîshozirwe kwâgo kwâgo mpu bakazikuza Nyakasane, bulya obuzigire bwâge buli bw’ensiku n’amango.<verse eid="1CH 16:41"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="1CH 16:42"/>Hemani na Yedutuni bàgwêrhe omukolo gw’okubûha emishekera n’emijegereza n’ezindi nzihwa z’abazihi zanakagikolesibwa oku kununîsa enyimbo z’obugashânize. Bagala ba Yedutuni bâli balanzi ba mihango. <verse eid="1CH 16:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="1CH 16:43"/>Cazînda ngasi muguma ashubira emwâge. Daudi naye ashubira emwâge agendisuhira ab’aha mwâge obwangà.<verse eid="1CH 16:43"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1CH 16"/>
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="1CH 17"/>
  <para style="s1">Amalaganyo ga Nyamuzinda kuli Daudi n’iburha lyâge</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CH 17:1"/>Daudi anacihanda omu nyumpa yâge. Lusiku luguma abwîra omulêbi Natani, erhi: «Lolaga! Niono nkola ndi omu nyumpa nyinjà y’enshebeyi, n’akagala k’aka-Nyamuzinda kaciri omu ihêma! Kurhi obwîne?» <verse eid="1CH 17:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CH 17:2"/>Natani abwîra Daudi, erhi: «Ogererîze bwinjà aho, ogende ojire nk’oku oyumvîrhe omurhima gwâwe gudesire, bulya Nyamuzinda ali haguma nâwe».<verse eid="1CH 17:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CH 17:3"/>Ci kwône obudufu bwakulikiraga, akanwa ka Nyamuzinda kajà emunda Natani ali, erhi: <verse eid="1CH 17:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CH 17:4"/>«Genda ojibwîra mwambali wâni Daudi, erhi: 'Ntya kwo Nyakasane akubwîzire': 'Arhali we wanyûbakira enyumpa nâbêramwo'. <verse eid="1CH 17:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CH 17:5"/>“Ciru ntanasagihanda omu nyumpa, kurhenga olusiku narhenzagya Israheli e Mîsiri kuhika ene. Ci omu ihêma najaga nayêgema, ntenga hantu halebe ncumbike handi halebe”. <verse eid="1CH 17:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CH 17:6"/>“Na kulusha okwo, amango goshi nakâg’ilusa Israheli, bacîranuzi banji nafumbisire obugo bw’okurhambula olubaga lwâni, ci kwône ntâye ntumuzize muli bo nti arhanyûbakiraga enyumpa nyinjinjà y’enshebeyi”. <verse eid="1CH 17:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CH 17:7"/>“co cirhumire, oshubigend’ibwîra Daudi, erhi: Ntya kwo Nyamuzinda w’Israheli akubwîzire: Nie nakurhenzagya ebulambo omu nyuma z’obusò nti obè murhegesi w’olubaga lwâni lw’Israheli”. <verse eid="1CH 17:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CH 17:8"/>“Omu majira gâwe goshi erhi rhwembi rhunali najà nakugwâsa, naholola abashombanyi bâwe boshi embere zâwe. Nie nârhuma wabona irenge liri nk’erya abakulu bakulu ba hano igulu<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">17, 8 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Lolà muli <char style="xt"><ref loc="2SA 7:1-17">2 Sam 7, 1-17</ref></char>.</char></note>”. <verse eid="1CH 17:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CH 17:9"/>“Nâtwira olubaga lwâni lw’Israheli eciriba, nâludêkerezamwo, lwabêra muli eco ciriba buzira kuciyôboha cici. Ntà ishanja lyâcilulibuze nk’okwa mîra”, <verse eid="1CH 17:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CH 17:10"/>“galya mango nayimikaga abacîranuzi b’olubaga lwâni lw’Israheli, nakurhenzakwo abashombanyi bâwe boshi. Nnankubwizire oku niono, Nyakasane nâkuhà iburha linji”. <verse eid="1CH 17:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CH 17:11"/>“Hano amango g’okufà kwâwe gahika, nâkuhà omwîmo gw’obûko bwâwe, mwâna wâwe, nâkomeza obwâmi bwâge”. <verse eid="1CH 17:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CH 17:12"/>“Oyo ye wâyîshinyûbakira enyumpa, nazibuhya ensiku zoshi entebe y’obwâmi bwâge”. <verse eid="1CH 17:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CH 17:13"/>“Nâbà îshe, naye abè mwâna wâni. Ntakamutûhya kwoki nka kulya natûhagya omwâmi wakushokoleraga”. <verse eid="1CH 17:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CH 17:14"/>“Nâmuzibuhya ayôrhe mwâmi w’olubaga lwâni, oku nsiku zoshi. Bulya obuhashe bw’obwâmi bw’omulala gwâge burhakadûndagana.”» <verse eid="1CH 17:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CH 17:15"/>Natani aganîrira Daudi ngasi byoshi Nyamuzinda anali amubwîzire muli okwo kubonekerwa kwâge.<verse eid="1CH 17:15"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Omusengero gwa Dudi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CH 17:16"/>Okubundi mwâmi Daudi agendija omu ihêma embere za Nyamuzinda, anaciderha, erhi: «Nyakasane, Nyamuzinda wâni, mmanyire oku oli nie, oli omulala gwâni, ntâco rhwàli rhukwânîne càrhumire warhujirira oku kwoshi wamarhujirira. <verse eid="1CH 17:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CH 17:17"/>“Ci kwône wêhe, Nyakasane wabona oku arhali hoshi aho. Alaga oku wamalinda ojira n’amalaganyo oku mulala gwâni omu nsiku zayisha, wanjirira nka kuno nâni nankabîre muntu wa kuderhwa”. <verse eid="1CH 17:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CH 17:18"/>“Yâgirwa Nyamuzinda wâni, bici nankaciyûshûla kw’eryo irenge ompire, bulya onyishi, waliha niono mwambali wâwe”. <verse eid="1CH 17:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CH 17:19"/>“Nyakasane kulya kubà onzigira co carhumire wajira ebyo birhangâzo binjà byoshi, mpu lyo oyêrekana obukulu bw’irenge lyâwe”. <verse eid="1CH 17:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CH 17:20"/>“Yâgirwa Nyakasane, ntâye ciru n’omuguma oli akâwe. Kwo kunali ntà wundi Nyamuzinda abà nyuma zâwe, nk’oku rhwanayumvîrhe baderha”. <verse eid="1CH 17:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CH 17:21"/>“Kwo na kwo ntà lundi lubaga bano igulu luli nk’olubaga lw’Israheli. Wayishire walulikûza, lwône lwône, omu bujà bw’e Mîsiri, mpu olujire lubaga lwâwe. Wacîjisize irenge n’ebijiro binene by’okujugumya washandabanyamwo amashanja embere z’olubaga lwâwe”. <verse eid="1CH 17:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CH 17:22"/>“Wàlujizire lubaga lwâwe oku nsiku zoshi, Nyakasane, wanabà we Nyamuzinda walwo”. <verse eid="1CH 17:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CH 17:23"/>“Bunôla, Yâgirwa, ojirage nk’okwo wanaderhaga, n’endagâno wajizire kuli nie n’oku iburha lyâni, eyôrhe ebâho amango goshi”. <verse eid="1CH 17:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CH 17:24"/>“Nêci, eyôrheho, na ntyo irenge lyâwe lyayîmanga oku nsiku zoshi, bakaziderha, mpu: 'Nyamuzinda w’Israheli, ye na Nyamuzinda w’Israheli, ye Nyakasane w’igulu lyoshi'. Enyumpa ya mwambali wâwe eyôrhe ebà omu masù gâwe”. <verse eid="1CH 17:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1CH 17:25"/>“Bulya we Nyamuzinda wâni, we wafululîre mwambali wâwe oku wayûbaka enyumpa yâge. Co cirhumire, nie mwambali wâwe ndi wâwe, ndi hano mbêre zâwe nakusengera”. <verse eid="1CH 17:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1CH 17:26"/>“Kwo binali, Yâgirwa Nyakasane, wênene Nyamuzinda, wamanandaganyagya eryo iragi lyoshi!” <verse eid="1CH 17:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1CH 17:27"/>“Wahizire okugisha omulala gwâni, mpu lyo iburha lyâni likaziyôrha libàho embere zâwe ensiku zoshi. Yâgirwa Nyakasane, kulya kubà wênene ogishire ogwo mulala, gukolaga gwayôrha guli mugishe ensiku zoshi.”»<verse eid="1CH 17:27"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1CH 17"/>
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="1CH 18"/>
  <para style="s1">Okuhimana kwa Daudi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CH 18:1"/>Enyuma z’aho, Daudi ahima Abafilistini, abagombya lwoshi omu kubanyaga ecishagala ca Gati n’ebindi bishagala by’eburhambi. <verse eid="1CH 18:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CH 18:2"/>Ahima n’Abamowabiti, bashuba bambali bâge banakazimuvurhira ihôro. <verse eid="1CH 18:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CH 18:3"/>Na kandi ahima Hadadezeri mwâmi w’e Soba e Hamati, ye walonzagya okulumîza obuhashe bwâge omu cihugo coshi kuhika oku lwîshi lw’Efrata. <verse eid="1CH 18:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CH 18:4"/>Daudi anyagayo ngâlè cihumbi, ànashwêka basirika b’oku biterusi bihumbi nda, n’abasirika kwône bihumbi makumi abirhi by’omu ngabo za Hadadezeri; ebyo biterusi acîshogamwo igana lyône ayôrhana, ebindi byoshi ajà abitwa emisî y’entege. <verse eid="1CH 18:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CH 18:5"/>Abaharamiya b’e Damasko bàyisha mpu barhabâle Hadadezeri mwâmi w’e Soba; nabo mwâmi Daudi abahima anabayîrhamwo bihumbi makumi abirhi. <verse eid="1CH 18:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CH 18:6"/>Abahirakwo abarhambo bakazibarhegeka, Abaharamiya babinduka bambali bâge, ntyo bakazimuvurhira ihôro. Nyakasane aha Daudi okuhimana ntyo omu matabâro gâge goshi. <verse eid="1CH 18:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CH 18:7"/>Daudi anyaga empenzi z’amasholo abalâlizi ba Hadadezeri bâli badwîrhe, anazihêka e Yeruzalemu. <verse eid="1CH 18:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CH 18:8"/>Omu bishagala by’e Tibati n’e Kuni byàli omu burhegesi bwa Hadadezeri, Daudi akulamwo ennundo y’omulinga nyinji bwenêne: buzinda ogwo mulinga gwo Salomoni ayishirikolêsa omu kutulisa omukenzi munene gw’okukalabiramwo, atulisamo n’erya mitungo n’ebindi birugu by’omulinga by’omu ka-Nyamuzinda.<verse eid="1CH 18:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CH 18:9"/>Tou, mwâmi w’e Hamati, anaciyumva omwanzi oku Daudi ahimire omu rhwe gwa Hadadezeri mwâmi w’e Soba gwoshi. <verse eid="1CH 18:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CH 18:10"/>Arhuma omugala Hadoramu mpu agend’imulamukiza mwâmi Daudi anamushamambire kuli ago matabâro gâge g’okuhima Hadadezeri, bulya Hadadezeri àli mushombanyi wa Tou. Amurhumira ebirugu bya ngasi lubero: by’amasholo, by’amarhale n’eby’omulinga. <verse eid="1CH 18:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CH 18:11"/>Mwâmi abirhûla Nyakasane byoshi, baguma n’amarhale n’amasholo anyagaga omu gandi mashanja, omu Edomu, e Mowabu, e Amoni, emw’Abafilistini n’emw’Amaleki.<verse eid="1CH 18:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CH 18:12"/>Abishayi mugala wa Seruya, ahimira bene Edomu omu kabanda ka Nyamunyu, abayîrhamwo bantu bihumbi ikumi na munâni. <verse eid="1CH 18:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CH 18:13"/>Abahirakwo abarhambo bàbarhegeka, abantu b’e Edomu boshi bashuba bambali bâge. Nyakasane ashobôza Daudi okuhimana ntyo omu ngasi matabâro gâge goshi.<verse eid="1CH 18:13"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Amazîno g’abarhumisi bakulu ba Daudi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CH 18:14"/>Daudi ayîma omu cihugo c’Israheli coshi. Akagitwa emmanja buzira kabôlo omu lubaga lwoshi. <verse eid="1CH 18:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CH 18:15"/>Yowabu, mugala wa Seruya, ye wali murhambo mukulu w’omurhwe gw’abalwî; Yehoshafati, mugala wa Ahiludi, ali mujabugo wa mwâmi; <verse eid="1CH 18:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CH 18:16"/>Sadoki mugala wa Ahitudu, na Abimeleki mugala wa Abiyatari, bo bâli badâhwa; Shavesha àli mwandisi. <verse eid="1CH 18:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CH 18:17"/>Benayahu mugala wa Yoyada, ye warhambulaga emirhwe ya Kereti n’eya Peleti, bagala ba Daudi yêne bo bâli ba burhanzi omu barhabâzi bâge.<verse eid="1CH 18:17"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1CH 18"/>
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="1CH 19"/>
  <para style="s1">Abarhurnisi bakulu ba Daudi bàcinaguzibwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CH 19:1"/>Enyuma z’aho, Nahashi mwâmi w’e Amoni anacifà, omugala ayîma ahâli hâge. <verse eid="1CH 19:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CH 19:2"/>Daudi anacigerereza, erhi: «Najirira Hanuni mugala wa Nahashi obwinjà, bulya nâni îshe àli mwinjà kuli nie bwenêne.» Anacimurhumiraga obugo mpu bagendimurhûliriza oku lufù lw’îshe. Ci kwône abo bajà-bugo ba Daudi erhi bahika omu cihugo c’Abamoni, <verse eid="1CH 19:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CH 19:3"/>abaluzi b’abantu b’e Amoni banacibwîra Hanuni, mpu: «K’ocikêbirwe mpu kukenga sho kurhumire Daudi arhuma abajà-bugo kw’eyi mishîbo? K’orhabwîni oku cihugo balija ebulâbi bacigeremwo, lyo lusiku luguma bayisha bacigwarhe?» <verse eid="1CH 19:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CH 19:4"/>Lêro Hanuni anacishweka balya bajà-bugo ha Daudi: babamôma obwânwa banabakungûla, emyamhalo yâbo bajà bayisirhula kuhika oku mahiji, buzinda babalîka mpu bagende banayôsire ntyo. <verse eid="1CH 19:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CH 19:5"/>Daudi ayumva ogwo mwanzi oku abantu bâge bacinaguzibwe, arhuma omuntu wagend’ibabugâna bulya bâli bagwêrhe n’e nshonyi bwenêne, mpu ababwîre, erhi: «Mwâmi adesire mpu mubêre e Yeriko kuhika hano obwânwa bwinyu bukula, mubuligaluka eno kâ.»<verse eid="1CH 19:5"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Entambala n’Abanya-Amoni</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CH 19:6"/>Abantu b’e Amoni banaciyumva bônene oku bagayisize Daudi bwenêne. Lêro Hanuni n’abantu b’e Amoni bahêka nsaranga nyinji, nka binônò makumi asharhu emwa Abaharamiya b’e Mezopotamiya y’ebulyo, n’emwa Soba mpu babayandike nka basirika b’okubarhabâla, mpu lyo babona engâlè n’abasirika bashona oku biterusi. <verse eid="1CH 19:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CH 19:7"/>Bayandika n’omwâmi w’e Maaka haguma n’emirhwe yâge na ngâlè bihumbi makumi asharhu na bibirhi, bayisha batwa icumbi lyâbo omu muhanda gw’ecishagala ca Medeba, nabo Abanya-Amoni bashûbûzanya omu bishagala byâbo byoshi mpu bajè oku matabâro. <verse eid="1CH 19:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CH 19:8"/>Daudi amanya ogwo mwanzi, arhuma Yowabu haguma n’emirhwe y’entwâli. <verse eid="1CH 19:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CH 19:9"/>Abantu ba Amoni bagendicîkereka oku cigamba embere z’omuhango gw’ecishagala câbo. Abâmi bàliyîshirirhabâla nabo bajà olundi lunda ebwa mashwa. <verse eid="1CH 19:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CH 19:10"/>Yowabu abona oku akwânîne okulwîra enyunda zoshi, embere n’enyuma yâge; lêro acîshoga e ntwâli kulusha z’omu Israheli zoshi, azikereka embere z’Abaharamiya. <verse eid="1CH 19:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CH 19:11"/>Aha omulumuna Abishayi okurhegeka abandi basirika boshi, abakereka embere z’Abanya-Amoni. <verse eid="1CH 19:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CH 19:12"/>Yowabu abwîra omulumuna, erhi: «Abaharamiya bakabà bo bazibu kundusha, onayîshe ontabâle. Ci Abanya-Amoni bakayîshibà bo bazibu kukulusha, nnambè nie nyîshikurhabâla. <verse eid="1CH 19:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CH 19:13"/>Rhusêze omurhima, rhukole akirumè bûko bwîrhu burhumire, n’ebishagala bya Nyamuzinda wîrhu. Nyakasane yêne ajire oku akabona kwinjà.» <verse eid="1CH 19:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CH 19:14"/>Yowabu n’omurhwe gwâge bahira mbêre bagendikoza Abaharamiya, Abaharamiya bakûla idârhi bayâka. <verse eid="1CH 19:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CH 19:15"/>Erhi abanya-Amoni babona oku Abaharamiya bayâka, nabo bône bayâka bulibirha embere z’Abishayi, mulumuna wa Yowabu, bashubira omu cishagala câbo. Okubundi Yowabu naye agaluka e Yeruzalemu.<verse eid="1CH 19:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CH 19:16"/>Abaharamiya babona oku bahimirwe na bene-Israheli, barhumiza mpu bagend’ihuluza bene wâbo bayûbaka ishiriza lya Efrata. Bayisha bashokolîrwe na Shofaki, murhambo mukulu w’omurhwe gwa Hadadezeri. <verse eid="1CH 19:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CH 19:17"/>Daudi amanya okwo, Ashûbûza engabo z’Israheli zoshi, ayikira Yordani ahika aho bâli. Ahârhûla embere kuhika ahika hôfi nabo. Cazînda Daudi akereka engabo zâge embere z’Abaharamiya, bakoza entambala. <verse eid="1CH 19:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CH 19:18"/>Ci kandi Abaharamiya bakûla idârhi bamàyôboha bene-Israheli. Daudi ayîrha basirika bihumbi nda b’oku ngiìle, n’abandi bantu bàgendaga n’amagulu abayîrhamwo bihumbi makumi anni. Ciru ayîrha n’omurhambo mukulu Shofaki. <verse eid="1CH 19:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CH 19:19"/>Abâmi bàkâgirhabâla Hadadi-Ezeri erhi bàbona oku bene-Israheli babagombize lwoshi, bahûna okuyumvanya na Daudi omu murhûla, barhacilonzagya okucikârhabâla bene Amoni.<verse eid="1CH 19:19"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1CH 19"/>
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="1CH 20"/>
  <para style="s1">Yowabu àgwârha ecishagala ca Raba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CH 20:1"/>Erhi kugera mwâka muguma, amango abâmi bànakomêreraga okujà oku matabâro, Yowabu ashûbûza abasirika b’omurhwe gwâge. Agend’isherêza ecihugo ca bene Amoni. Cazînda arhêra ecishagala ca Raba. Daudi, yêhe, asigala aha Yeruzalemu. Yowabu adûlika ecishagala ca Raba muliro, ebyôgo byâco abihonda oku idaho. <verse eid="1CH 20:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CH 20:2"/>Daudi arhôla ecimanè càli oku irhwe ly’omuzimu wa bene Amonî, ye Milkomu, acîhira oku lyâge irhwe. Babona oku eco cimanè càgwêrhe obuzirho bwa talenta nguma ya masholo gône gône, càlimwo n’ibuye ly’engulo ndârhi. <verse eid="1CH 20:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CH 20:3"/>Daudi ashanashana abantu b’êyo munda boshi, abahira oku mikolo y’obukûkuru, y’okukonda embale, okugôya amabuye erhi kubeza nshâli. N’ebindi bishagala bya bene Amoni byoshi kwo ànabikolîre ntyo. Cazînda ashubira e Yeruzalemu n’omurhwe gwâge gwoshi.<verse eid="1CH 20:3"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Entambala haguma n’Abafilistini</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CH 20:4"/>Buzinda kandi, bene-Israheli bakoza entambala oku Bafilistini, aha Gezeri, mw’êyo ntambala, Sibekayi w’e Husha àyîrha Sipayi, w’obûko bw’Abarefayimi. Okwo kwagombya Abafilistini. <verse eid="1CH 20:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CH 20:5"/>Kandi omu yindi ntambala haguma n’Abafilistini, Elehanani, mugala wa Yayiro, ayîrha Lahmi, mulumuna wa Golyati w’e Gati, ye olusârhi lw’itumu lyâge lwàli lunene kulusha omulonge munênênè. <verse eid="1CH 20:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CH 20:6"/>Kandi eyindi ntambala yakozibwa e Gati. Yalimwo omusirika muguma w’omu bashombanyi mulî-mulî, àgwêrhe minwe ndarhu oku ngasi kuboko na mano ndarhu oku ngasi kugulu, àli w’oku bûko bwa Harafa ak’abandi. <verse eid="1CH 20:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CH 20:7"/>Ajâcira bene-Israheli. Lêro Yônatani, mugala wa Shimea, mwinjikulu wa Daudi, amuniga. <verse eid="1CH 20:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CH 20:8"/>Abo basirika Bafilistini b’obûko bwa Harafa w’e Gati, boshi bahwêra oku bwôji bw’engôrho ya Daudi n’ey’abasirika bâge.<verse eid="1CH 20:8"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1CH 20"/>
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="1CH 21"/>
  <para style="s1">Daudi àganja olubaga lw’Israheli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CH 21:1"/>Lusiku luguma Shetani ahiga okuhanyagaza Israheli, ashumika Daudi mpu aganje bene-Israheli. <verse eid="1CH 21:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CH 21:2"/>Mwâmi Daudi abwîra Yowabu n’abakulu b’engabo bâli bo naye, erhi: «Mugere omu bûko bw’Israheli bwoshi, kurhenga e Dani kuhika e Bersheba, muganje olubaga, mmanye eeihugo cirimwo bantu banga.» <verse eid="1CH 21:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CH 21:3"/>Yowabu ashuza, erhi: «Yâgirwa, nankasîmire Nyakasane aluze bene-Israheli kal’igana kulusha! Ene boshi kurhumikira bakola bakurhumikira, ci kwône bici birhumirage olonza okumanya omubalè gwâbo n’okusunika ntyo Israheli omu bugoma?» <verse eid="1CH 21:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CH 21:4"/>Ci kwône irhegeko lya mwâmi lyàli lizibu kuli Yowabu. Agenda, agera omu Israheli mwoshi, cazînda ashubigaluka e Yeruzalemu. <verse eid="1CH 21:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CH 21:5"/>Ayîshibwîra Daudi omubalè gwoshi: Israheli àlimwo balume cinônô ciguma na bihumbi igana bakola bafumbarha itumu, na Yûda bihumbi magana anni na makumi gali nda. <verse eid="1CH 21:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CH 21:6"/>Yowabu arhaganjaga obûko bwa Levi n’o bwa Benyamini haguma n’abandi.<verse eid="1CH 21:6"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Nyamuzinda àhana obubî bwa Daudi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CH 21:7"/>Ogwo mukolo gwagayîsa Nyakasane bwenêne, kwarhuma àhana Israheli. <verse eid="1CH 21:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CH 21:8"/>Daudi abwîra Nyakasane, erhi: «Najizire ecâha cinene! Waliha, mâshi, obabalire mwambali wâwe eco câha, bulya najizire nka musirhe!» <verse eid="1CH 21:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CH 21:9"/>Erhi buca sêzi, Daudi azûka, erhi mîra Nyakasane anabwîraga omulêbi Gadi, muhanûzi wa Daudi akanwa abwîra mwâmi Daudi, erhi: <verse eid="1CH 21:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CH 21:10"/>«Genda obwîre Daudi ntya: Nyakasane amâderha: Nkuhîre bintu bisharhu, ocîshoge ciguma muli byo, nâcijira.» <verse eid="1CH 21:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CH 21:11"/>Aho omulêbi Gadi ajà emunda Daudi ali, amubwîra ntya, erhi: <verse eid="1CH 21:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CH 21:12"/>«Myâka isharhu ya cizombo omu cihugo câwe, -erhi myêzi isharhu ya matumu, ojè wayâka n’omushombanyi akukulikîre lumino-mîno, - erhi nsiku isharhu za cihûsi omu cihugo câwe? Ocîjàge emurhima buno, ombwir bici najibwîra owantumaga!» <verse eid="1CH 21:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CH 21:13"/>Daudi abwîra olya mulêbi Gadi, erhi: «Namârhaganwa bwenêne! Nâleka rhufîre omu maboko ga Nyakasane erhimwo, bulya obwonjo bwâge buli bunji, caziga ntakumbaga omu maboko g’abantu.» <verse eid="1CH 21:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CH 21:14"/>Nyakasane anacirhumaga ecihûsi obwo omu Israheli; kwafà bantu bihumbi makumi gali nda b’Israheli. <verse eid="1CH 21:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CH 21:15"/>Nyakasane ayêrekeza Malahika e Yeruzalemu, mpu arhulireyo ecihûsi. Erhi Malahika-Kaheza ayêrekera e Yeruzalemu mpu amulagalize, Nyakasane afà bwonjo, abwîra entumwa yâge, erhi: «Lekaga, shuba okuboko kwâwe. Ago mango erhi nyakurhumwa akola ahika omu ngo Ornani Muyebuzeyi àkâg’ihûlira engano yâge». <verse eid="1CH 21:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CH 21:16"/>Daudi agalamula amasù, abona Malahika amanyanyire ekarhî k’amalunga n’igulu, anayômwire engôrho yâge akola ayiyêrekezize e Yeruzalemu. Daudi bo n’abagula bâge bâli bayambîrhe emyambalo y’emishîbo, bayunama bahwera oku idaho. <verse eid="1CH 21:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CH 21:17"/>Daudi abwîra Nyakasane, erhi: «K’arhali nie narhegekaga nti baganje olubaga. Nie najizire kubî! Abà bôhe bacîberîre busô kwône, kubî kuci bàjizire? Obâge nie ohana n’omulala gwâni!»<verse eid="1CH 21:17"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Daudi àyûbakira Nyakasane oluhêrero</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CH 21:18"/>Malahika wa Nyakasane abwîra Gadi, erhi: «Obwîre Daudi asôkere ebwa cibuga emunda Ornani Muyebusi adwîrhe ahûla engano, ayûbakireyo Nyakasane oluhêrero.» <verse eid="1CH 21:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CH 21:19"/>Daudi anacijà eyo munda nka kulya Gadi ànamubwîraga Nyakasane amurhumire. <verse eid="1CH 21:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CH 21:20"/>Ornani erhi adwîrhe ahûla engano yâge. Mpu ahindamuka, abona Malahika; agendicîfulika bo n’abagala bâni bâli haguma naye. <verse eid="1CH 21:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CH 21:21"/>Daudi asôkera emunda Ornani ali. Naye oku anabona mwâmi ntya, àrhenga aha cibuga ayîshicîrhimba aha magulu gâge. <verse eid="1CH 21:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CH 21:22"/>Daudi amubwîra Ornani, erhi: «Ompè aha ecibuga câwe ciri. Nnonzize nyûbakireho oluhêrero lwa Nyakasane, lyo eci cihûsi ciri oku lubaga cihwa. Ohampè, nâkuguliraho nk’oku ecitwîro caho cina kwânîne.» <verse eid="1CH 21:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CH 21:23"/>Ornani ashuza Daudi, erhi: «Nnâhamwîrhu oharhôle kwône ojire n’oku olonzize. Ciru n’enkafu zâni ezi, n’engano y’okuhânwa ntûlo.» <verse eid="1CH 21:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CH 21:24"/>Ci kwône mwâmi Daudi ashuza Ornani, erhi: «Ntâco wâmpa! Ebyo byoshi nâbigula nk’oku binakwânîne. Ntankalonza nterekêre Nyakasane ebiri byâwe, ntankamurhûla akantu ntarhamire!» <verse eid="1CH 21:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1CH 21:25"/>Daudi anacihà Ornani masholo ga buzirho bwa sikêli magana gali ndarhu.<verse eid="1CH 21:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="1CH 21:26"/>Aho Daudi ayûbakiraho Nyakasane oluhêrero, ahirakwo enterekêro z’okusingônolwa n’enterekêro z’omurhûla. Okubundi ashenga Nyakasane, naye àmushuza omu kumanula omuliro emalunga gwayîshisingônola zirya nterekêro oku luhêrero. <verse eid="1CH 21:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1CH 21:27"/>Lêro Nyakasane arhegeka olya Malahika mpu ashubize engôrho yâge omu lûba. <verse eid="1CH 21:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1CH 21:28"/>Daudi abona obwo oku Nyakasane anayumvîrhize omusengero gwâge aho cibuga ca Ornani Muyebusi, kurhenga olwo lusiku, akaziyôrha arhûliraho Nyakasane enterekêro burhahusa. <verse eid="1CH 21:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1CH 21:29"/>Mw’ago mango, lirya ihêma Mûsa àyûbakiraga omu irungu haguma n’oluhêrero lw’e nterekêro z’okusingônolwa, erhi bicibà oku ntondo ya Gabaoni. <verse eid="1CH 21:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1CH 21:30"/>Ci kwône Daudi arhagerezagya okujà eyo munda mpu ajishenga Nyakasane, bulya engôrho y’oyo Malahika yàlimujugumize bwenêne.<verse eid="1CH 21:30"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1CH 21"/>
  <chapter number="22" style="c" sid="1CH 22"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CH 22:1"/>Co càrhumire Daudi aderha, erhi: «Hano ho hantu h’okuyûbakwa e nyumpa ya Nyakasane Nyamuzinda. Ho hantu h’oluhêrero lw’e nterekêro z’Israheli.»<verse eid="1CH 22:1"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Daudi arheganya okuyûbaka aka-Nyamuzinda</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CH 22:2"/>Daudi arhegeka mpu bashûbûze ebigolo biyûbaka omu cihugo c’Israheli; abahira oku mukolo gw’okugôya amabuye g’okuyûbaka akà-Nyamuzinda ka Nyakasane. <verse eid="1CH 22:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CH 22:3"/>Arhenganya ennundo erhali nyi y’ecûma c’okukûlamwo emisumâri y’okuyîshijira emirirango, n’engondôzo; na mulinga munji bwenêne gurhagwêrhi oku gwankagerwa; <verse eid="1CH 22:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CH 22:4"/>na kandi ennundo y’emirhi y’enshebeyi, abantu b’e Tiri n’ab’e Sidoni erhi bàyidwîrhîre Daudi minji bwenêne.<verse eid="1CH 22:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CH 22:5"/>Bulya Daudi àkagicîdesa yêne, erhi: «Mugala wâni Salomoni aciri murhò na ntâco acimanya. N’obwo aka-Nyamuzinda k’okuyûbakirwa Nyakasane kawanine kajè irenge omu bihugo byoshi oku bunene n’obwinjà bwâko. Nkola ga nâbà narheganya eby’okuyishikayûbaka.» Daudi ajira ntyo marheganyo manji embere ly’okufà kwâge.<verse eid="1CH 22:5"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Daudi àha Salomoni omukolo gw’okuyûbaka aka-Nyamuzinda</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CH 22:6"/>Daudi ahamagala omugala Salomoni amurhegeka mpu ayûbake aka-Nyamuzinda ka Nyakasane, Nyamuzinda w’Israheli. <verse eid="1CH 22:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CH 22:7"/>Amubwîra, erhi: «Mwâna wâni, naligwêrhe omuhigo gw’okuyûbaka niene enyumpa nyinjinjà ya Nyakasane Nyamuzinda wâni. <verse eid="1CH 22:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CH 22:8"/>“Ci kwône Nyakasane ambwîzire, erhi: Wàbulazire mukò munji munji omu matabâro manênênè wajàga wajira; orha nkayûbakira izîno lyâni enyumpa erhi ogwo mukò gwoshi wabulagiraga oku idaho embere zâni gurhuma”. <verse eid="1CH 22:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CH 22:9"/>“Ci wayîshiburha omwâna: àyîshibà muntu wa murhûla<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">22, 9 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Omu cihabraniya, izîno lya Salomoni lirhenga oku luderho «Shalôm», kwo kuderha murhûla.</char></note>, ntanazige abashombanyi bamuzungulusire barhwanza ogwo murhûla gwâge. Akaziderhwa izîno lya Salomoni, -kwo kuderha 'Murhûla'- bulya omu kalamo kâge koshi nâyishihà Israheli omurhûla munji”. <verse eid="1CH 22:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CH 22:10"/>“Oyo ye wâyîshinyûbakira enyumpa. Ayîshibà mwâna wâni nâni mbè Îshe kuli ye. Nakomeza bwenêne entebe yâge y’obwâmi kuli Israheli.”»<verse eid="1CH 22:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CH 22:11"/>Daudi ayûshûla, erhi: «Lêro mwâna wâni, Nyakasane Nyamuzinda wâwe, abè haguma nâwe, akuhè obwangà ly’ohasha okumuyûbakira enyumpa, nk’oku ànalaganyagya kuli we. <verse eid="1CH 22:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CH 22:12"/>Akuhè obukengêre n’obumanye, hano akuhà okurhegeka Israheli lyo ohashishimba amarhegeko gâge. <verse eid="1CH 22:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CH 22:13"/>Okâkenga n’okushimba bwinjinjà amarhegeko àhâga Mûsa kuli Israheli, wâbona oku wâhimana muli byoshi. <verse eid="1CH 22:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CH 22:14"/>Niono n’emisî yâni, nacîhanganyire okubîka muhako oku kuyûbaka enyumpa ya Nyakasane, masholo ga buzirho bwa talenta bihumbi igana, binônò igana bya marhale, omulinga n’ecûma, birhagwêrhi oku byankagerwa. Narheganyize n’emirhi n’amabuye. Nâwe wanaciyûshûla ebindi. <verse eid="1CH 22:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CH 22:15"/>Mw’ogwo mukolo, wâbà n’abakozi, abalenga b’okugôya amabuye n’ab’okubinja emirhi, erhi balenga omu ngasi bushanja. <verse eid="1CH 22:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CH 22:16"/>O gwêrhe nnundo nyinji bwenêne z’amasholo, amarhale, omulinga n’ey’ecûma. Ocîbandage omu mikolo, na Nyakasane abè haguma nâwe.» <verse eid="1CH 22:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CH 22:17"/>Cazînda Daudi arhegeka abarhambo b’Israheli boshi mpu barhabâle omugala Salomoni, ababwîra, erhi: <verse eid="1CH 22:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CH 22:18"/>Ka Nyakasane arhali haguma ninyu? Ammuhîre omurhûla e mpande zoshi kurhenga amango àhiraga abantu bàyûbakaga mw’eci cihugo idako ly’oburhegesi bwâni. Lêro bakola bashiga Nyakasane n’olubaga lwâge. <verse eid="1CH 22:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CH 22:19"/>Lêro mucîsêzagye n’omurhima n’emisî yinyu yoshi okumanya obulonza bwa Nyakasane Nyamuzinda winyu. Mucîbande omu mikolo muyûbake endâro ya Nyakasane Nyamuzinda winyu; lyo muyîshihira Omucîmba gw’Amalaganyo ga Nyakasane n’ebirugu by’obugashânize muli ako kâ-Nyamuzinda mwayûbaka oku izîno lya Nyakasane.<verse eid="1CH 22:19"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1CH 22"/>
  <chapter number="23" style="c" sid="1CH 23"/>
  <para style="s1">Daudi àkerekanya omurhwe gw’Abaleviti</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CH 23:1"/>Erhi Daudi abà akola mushosi bwenêne, ayîmika omugala Salomoni okubà mwâmi w’Israheli. <verse eid="1CH 23:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CH 23:2"/>Okubundi ahamagala abarhambo bakulu b’Israheli boshi, n’abadâhwa n’Abaleviti.<verse eid="1CH 23:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CH 23:3"/>Abaleviti bakulu bakola bagwêrhe myâka makumi asharhu na kulusha, baganjwa muguma muguma, omubalè gwâbo gwahalûka gwa bihumbi makumi asharhu na munâni. <verse eid="1CH 23:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CH 23:4"/>Daudi abagoshôlamwo bihumbi makumi abirhi na bini by’okuyimangira emikolo y’okuyûbaka akà-Nyamuzinda ka Nyakasane, bihumbi ndarhu bya kubà barhindisi na bacîranuzi, <verse eid="1CH 23:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CH 23:5"/>bihumbi bini bya balanzi ba mihango na bindi bihumbi bini bya kukazikuza Nyakasane n’enzihwa Daudi àli erhi atulîsize kw’ogwo mukolo.<verse eid="1CH 23:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CH 23:6"/>Daudi agaba abaleviti omu mirhwe ya ngasi lubero nk’oku amâburhwa gâbo gànashimbanaga, ab’obûko bwa Gershoni, bwa Kehati erhi bwa Merari, bagala ba Levi. <verse eid="1CH 23:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CH 23:7"/>Gershoni àbusire bâna babirhi, Ladani na Shimeyi. <verse eid="1CH 23:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CH 23:8"/>Ladani aburha bâna basharhu: omurhanzi Yehiyeli, kandi Zetamu na Yoweli. <verse eid="1CH 23:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CH 23:9"/>Shimeyi aburha bâna basharhu: Shelomiti, Haziyeli na Harani, bo bâli bakulu b’emilala ya kuli Ladani. <verse eid="1CH 23:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CH 23:10"/>Kandi Shimeyi ashubiburha bagala bâni: Yahati, Ziza, Yehushi na Beriya. <verse eid="1CH 23:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CH 23:11"/>Yahati ye wali mukulu wâbo, Ziza wa kabirhi, hakulikira Yehushi na Beriya. Abo babirhi bazinda barhaburhaga bâna banji, co càrhumire bayandikwa nka mulala muguma gwône.<verse eid="1CH 23:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CH 23:12"/>Kehati aburha bagala bâni: Amurami, Isari, Hebroni na Uziyeli. <verse eid="1CH 23:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CH 23:13"/>Bagala ba Amurami: Aroni na Mûsa. Aroni aberûlwa kwâgo kwâgo lwoshi haguma n’iburha lyâge oku kukazikolera omu hatagatîfu bwenêne; gwo mukolo gw’okurhûla Nyakasane enterekêro z’enshangi, okumurhumikira bwaca bwayira n’okuhâna obwangà oku izîno lyâge ensiku zoshi. <verse eid="1CH 23:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CH 23:14"/>Mûsa yêhe àlicîbêrîre muntu wa Nyamuzinda; ci abâna bâge bàkâgilolwa nka bantu kwône b’obûko bwa Levi. <verse eid="1CH 23:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CH 23:15"/>Bagala ba Mûsa: Gershomi na Eliyezeri. <verse eid="1CH 23:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CH 23:16"/>Bagala ba Gershomi: Shebuweli, ye murhanzi. <verse eid="1CH 23:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CH 23:17"/>Eliyezeri aburha mugala muguma, Rehabiya, arhaciburhaga bandi, ci kwône Rehabiya aburha bâna banji bwenêne. <verse eid="1CH 23:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CH 23:18"/>Bagala ba Isari: Shelomiti, ye murhanzi. <verse eid="1CH 23:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CH 23:19"/>Bagala ba Hebroni: omurhanzi, Yeriya, owa kabirhi, Amariya, owa kasharhu, Yaziyeli na Yokmeyami wa kani. <verse eid="1CH 23:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CH 23:20"/>Bagala ba Uziyeli: Mika, wa burhanzi, na Yisiya, wa kabirhi.<verse eid="1CH 23:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CH 23:21"/>Bagala ba Merari: Mahali na Mushi. Mahali àburha bagala babirhi. Eleyazari na Kishi. <verse eid="1CH 23:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CH 23:22"/>Eleyazari afà buzira kuburha bâna-rhabana. Arhasigaga abarhali bâna-nyere bônene, banayankwa na bazâla bâbo, bagala ba Kishi. <verse eid="1CH 23:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CH 23:23"/>Mushi<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">23, 23 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">MUSHI ye shakulûza w’Abashi bulya bali nkomoka ya bene Levi, osome <char style="xt"><ref loc="EXO 6:19">Lub 6, 19</ref></char>; Les origines bibliques des Bashi, nyabangere.com</char></note> aburha bagala basharhu: Mahali, Ederi na Yeremoti. <verse eid="1CH 23:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CH 23:24"/>Ntyo kwo lyàliyôsire iburha lya Levi, abo bâli bakulu b’emilala yâbo bàyandikagwa muguma muguma omu citabu c’amazîno. Ngasi yêshi wali okola agwêrhe myâka makumi abirhi na kulusha y’okuburhwa, ahâbwa ogwâge mukolo akazijira omu nyumpa ya Nyakasane. <verse eid="1CH 23:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1CH 23:25"/>Bulya Daudi aderha, erhi: «Nyakasane Nyamuzinda w’Israheli akola ahîre olubaga lwâge omurhûla, naye yêne akolaga abêra omu cishagala ca Yeruzalemu ensiku zoshi. <verse eid="1CH 23:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1CH 23:26"/>Ntà bulagîrire abaleviti bacigwêrhe bw’okukâbarhula ihêma ly’okubugânana na ngasi birugu byoshi bikolêsibwa oku bugashânize.» <verse eid="1CH 23:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1CH 23:27"/>Na kandi omu kushimba ebinwa bizinda bya Daudi, ngasi baleviti boshi bàyandisirwe, bàgwêrhe myâka makumi abirhi na kulusha y’okuburhwa. <verse eid="1CH 23:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1CH 23:28"/>Omukolo gwâbo kwàli kulinga amarhegeko bene Aroni bababwizire, okurhumikira omu kâ-Nyamuzinda ka Nyakasane, omu minene yamwo n’omu rhwônga rhwamwo rhwoshi, okushukamwo ebirugu by’okugashâniza. Ebyo byo bakâgikola omu kâ-Nyamuzinda.<verse eid="1CH 23:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="1CH 23:29"/>N’okukereka emigati mulongo oku mêza gwàli mukolo gwâbo; okurheganya enshâno ya ngasi lubero. Bàgwêrhe n’omukolo gw’okulanga engero z’omu ka-Nyamuzinda, ez’obuzirho n’ez-obulî. <verse eid="1CH 23:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1CH 23:30"/>Bâli barhegesirwe okubà omu kâ­ Nyamuzinda ngasi sêzi na ngasi bijingo oku kukuza irenge lya Nyakasane. <verse eid="1CH 23:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1CH 23:31"/>Na ngasi mango barhûla Nyakasane enterekêro z’okusingônola oku lusiku lwa Sabato, olusiku lurhanzi lwa ngasi mwêzi, n’ezindi nsiku nkulu nk’oku byànaliyandisirwe omu irhegeko. Gwo mukolo bàkâgijira ensiku zoshi embere za Nyakasane ogwo. <verse eid="1CH 23:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="1CH 23:32"/>Obugashânize bàkâgijira omu kâ-Nyamuzinda, bwanali bulya bwonênè bwakâgijirwa omu ihêma ly’okubugânana, n’amarhegeko g’omu hatagatîfu bwenêne, na galya marhegeko ga bene wâbo bagala ba Aroni.<verse eid="1CH 23:32"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1CH 23"/>
  <chapter number="24" style="c" sid="1CH 24"/>
  <para style="s1">Omurhwe gw’abadâhwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CH 24:1"/>Ab’oku bûko bwa Aroni nabo bagabwa omu mirhwe<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">24, 1 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Omulongo gwa 1-19 guyêrekîne omurhwe gw’abadâhwa; gushushîne n’omurhwe gudesirwe omu citabu ca Nehemiya <char style="xt" link-href="NEH 7:39-42"><ref loc="NEH 7:39-42">7, 39-42</ref></char>; <char style="xt" link-href="NEH 10:2-8"><ref loc="NEH 10:2-8">10, 2-8</ref></char>; <char style="xt" link-href="NEH 12:1-7.12-21"><ref loc="NEH 12:1-7">12, 1-7</ref>.<ref loc="NEH 12:12-21">12-21</ref></char>. Badesiremwo oku hali mpiriri 24 z’abadâhwa. Ci muli Nehemiya ogwo mubalè gubonekine musungunu (17 na 21). </char></note>. Aroni àlibusire bâna bâni: Nadabu, Abihu, Eleyazari na Itamara. <verse eid="1CH 24:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CH 24:2"/>Nadabu na Abihu bafà, erhi n’îshe acihali; Eleyazari na Itamara bôhe bàhîrwe ecikono c’obudâhwa. <verse eid="1CH 24:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CH 24:3"/>Buzinda bwenêne, mwâmi Daudi omu kurhabâlwa na Sadoki, w’oku bûko bwa Eleyazari, na Ahimeleki, w’oku bûko bwa Itamara, agaba abadâhwa omu mirhwe nk’oku amarhumisi gâbo gànaliyôsire. <verse eid="1CH 24:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CH 24:4"/>Bayîshibona oku obûko bwa Eleyazari bwo bwalimwo abalume banji kulusha obûko bwa Itamara. Co càrhumire obûko bwa Eleyazari bugabwamwo mirhwe ikumi na ndarhu ya cinyamulala n’obwa Itamara mirhwe munâni, na ngasi murhwe n’omurhambo mukulu wagwo. <verse eid="1CH 24:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CH 24:5"/>Okugabwa kwa bombi na bombi kwakazijirwa omu kuyesha ecigole, bulya hàli «abaluzi b’aka-Nyamuzinda» n’abandi «baluzi ba Nyamuzinda» omu bûko bwa Eleyazari n’omu bûko bwa Itamara. <verse eid="1CH 24:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CH 24:6"/>Omwandisi Shemaya, mugala wa Netanaeli w’obûko bwa Levi, ayandika amazîno gâbo embere za mwâmi, embere z’abarhambo, embere z’omudâhwa Sadoki, embere z’Ahimeleki, mugala wa Abiyatari, n’embere z’abarhambo bakulu b’emilala y’abadâhwa n’ey’abaleviti. Oku mulala gwa Eleyazari, bàkâgiyesha ecigole kabirhi kakulikirîne, n’oku gwa Itamara liguma lyône. <verse eid="1CH 24:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CH 24:7"/>Yehoyaribu ye wali wa burhanzi omu kugwârhwa n’ecigole, Yedaya wa kabirhi, <verse eid="1CH 24:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CH 24:8"/>Harimu wa kasharhu, Seorimu wa kani, <verse eid="1CH 24:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CH 24:9"/>Malkiya wa karhanu, Miyamini wa kali ndarhu, <verse eid="1CH 24:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CH 24:10"/>Hakosi wa kali nda, Abiya wa kali munâni, <verse eid="1CH 24:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CH 24:11"/>Yeshuwa<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">24, 11 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">YESHUWA, lyo izîno bakâg’iderha YEZU eryo omu c’emwâbo Cihebraniya. Erhi izîno liderhwa n’ab’emahanga linasôme kundi omu marhwirhi n’omu kanwa. Enyiganyo ziri nyinji; Yeshuwa omu cigereki mpu «Insous», omu cilatini mpu «Iesus», omu nfarasè mpu «Jésus», omu Kiswahili mpu «Yezu», omu mashi mpu «Yezu»; Yaakov naye endimi zamuhindula, Iakobos, Iakobus, Jacques, James, Yakôbo, Yakôbo; Olya mulume MUSHI mwene Merari (<char style="xt"><ref loc="EXO 6:19">Lub 6, 19</ref></char>), mwinjikulu wa Levi, naye endimi zamujira Muschite, Muschi; omugala Mahali endimi w’emahanga zamujira Mali, Maali; Machli; bulya ecihebraniya cibâmwo ba «h» basharhu banalinzirishushana</char></note> wa kali mwenda, Shekaniya wa kali ikumi, <verse eid="1CH 24:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CH 24:12"/>Eliyasibu wa kal’ikumi na liguma, Yakimi wa kal’ikumi na kabirhi. <verse eid="1CH 24:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CH 24:13"/>Hupa wa kal’ikumi na kasharhu, Yeshebab wa kal’ikumi na kani <verse eid="1CH 24:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CH 24:14"/>Bilga wa kal’ikumi na karhanu, Imeri wa kal’ikumi na ndarhu, <verse eid="1CH 24:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CH 24:15"/>Heziri wa kal’ikumi na nda. Hapisesi wa kal’ikumi na munâni, <verse eid="1CH 24:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CH 24:16"/>Petahiya wa kal’ikumi na mwenda, irungu wa kali makumi abirhi, <verse eid="1CH 24:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CH 24:17"/>Yakini wa kali makumi abirhi na muguma, Gamuli wa kali makumi abirhi na babirhi, <verse eid="1CH 24:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CH 24:18"/>Delayahu wa kali makumi abirhi na basharhu, Maaziya wa kali makumi abirhi na bâni <verse eid="1CH 24:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CH 24:19"/>Abo bo bàyandisirwe amazîno gâbo haguma n’omukolo gwâbo gw’okujà omu kâ-Nyamuzinda ka Nyakasane, omu kushimba amarhegeko bàhâbagwa na shakulûza wâbo Aroni, nk’oku naye ànagahâbagwa na Nakasane, Nyamuzinda w’Israheli yêne. Enyûshûlo y’Agandi mazîno g’abaleviti <verse eid="1CH 24:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CH 24:20"/>Abà nabo bo bandi b’oku bûko bwa Levi: Omu bûko bwa Amurami, mwâli Shubaheli, n’omu bûko bwa Shubaheli mwâli Yediya. <verse eid="1CH 24:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CH 24:21"/>Omu bûko bwa Rehabiya mwâli Yishiya, murhanzi omu mulala gwâge. <verse eid="1CH 24:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CH 24:22"/>Omu bûko bwa Isara mwâli Shelomoti, n’omu bwa Shelomoti mwâli Yahati. <verse eid="1CH 24:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CH 24:23"/>Bagala ba Hebroni: omurhanzi Yeriya, owa kabirhi Amariyahu, owa kasharhu Yaziyeli, n’owa kani Yokmeyami. <verse eid="1CH 24:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CH 24:24"/>Mugala wa Uziyeli: Mika. Omu bûko bwa Mika, mwâli Shamiri. <verse eid="1CH 24:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1CH 24:25"/>Omu bûko bwa Yisiya, mulumuna wa Mika, mwâli Zakariya. <verse eid="1CH 24:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1CH 24:26"/>Bagala ba Merari: Mahali, Mushi na Yaziya; <verse eid="1CH 24:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1CH 24:27"/>oku bûko bwa Merari, b’emwa omugala Yaziya: mwâli Shohamu, Zakuru na Ibri. <verse eid="1CH 24:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1CH 24:28"/>Mugala wa Mahali: Eleyazari, ye rhaburhaga mwâna, <verse eid="1CH 24:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1CH 24:29"/>na Kishi, ye wagwêrhe omugala Yarameeli. <verse eid="1CH 24:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1CH 24:30"/>Bagala ba Mushi: Mahali, Ederi na Yerimoti. Ntyo kwo obûko bene Levi bwàli buyôsire, omu kushimbana kw’emilala yâbo. <verse eid="1CH 24:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1CH 24:31"/>Nabo bayesha ecigole oku burhumisi bw’emikolo yâbo aka bene wâbo bene Aroni, embere za mwâmi Daudi, e mbêre za Zadoki na Ahimeleki, n’embere z’abarhambo bakulu b’emilala y’abadâhwa n’ey’abaleviti. Ntyo omulala gw’omwâna w’enfula gwajirirwa kuguma n’ogwa mulumuna wâge.<verse eid="1CH 24:31"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1CH 24"/>
  <chapter number="25" style="c" sid="1CH 25"/>
  <para style="s1">Omurhwe gw’abimbiza</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CH 25:1"/>Oku bugashânize, Daudi bo n’abarhambo bakulu, baberûla abâna ba Azafi n’abà Hemani, n’abà Yedutuni mpu babè bahanûzi b’okukolêsa ennanga, enzenze n’orhurhêra. Abantu bàhizirwe kw’ogwo mukolo nabo bayandikwa.<verse eid="1CH 25:1"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CH 25:2"/>Abâna ba Azafi bayandikwamwo: Zakuru, Yozefu, Netanya, Asarela. Abâna ba Azafi bâli idako ly’oburhegesi bw’îshe wâbo, ye wali erhi akômerîre okuhanûla oku irhegeko lya mwâmi.<verse eid="1CH 25:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CH 25:3"/>Abâna ba Yedutuni: Gedaliya, Seri, Yeshaya, Shimeyi, Hashabiya na Matitiya; oku bali ndarhu bàkâgihanûlwa n’îshe, owakâgiyimba n’izù ly’okuhêra oku kukuza n’okuhà Nyakasane irenge.<verse eid="1CH 25:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CH 25:4"/>Abâna ba Hemani: Bukiya, Mataniya, Uziyeli, Shebuweli, Yerimoti, Hananiya, Hanani, Eliyata, Gidalati, Romamti-Ezeri, Yoshebekasha, Maloti, Hotiri na Mahaziyoti. <verse eid="1CH 25:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CH 25:5"/>Abo boshi bâli bagala ba Hemani, mulêbi wa mwâmi. Erhi ebinwa bya Nyamuzinda byàderhagwa, anabûhe omushekera. Nyamuzinda àli ahîre Hemani barhabana ikumi na bâni na banyere basharhu. <verse eid="1CH 25:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CH 25:6"/>Abo bantu boshi bâli bîmbiza omu kâ-Nyamuzinda ka Nyakasane, hàkazihalûlwa n’îshe wâbo n’omu kuhirakwo izù ly’ennanga, enzenze n’orhurhêra, omu kukazirhumikira omu nyumpa ya Nyakasane nk’oku mwâmi anali arhegesire. <verse eid="1CH 25:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CH 25:7"/>Aho bîmbiza balenga, haguma n’abantu b’omurhwe gwâbo, bâli bayigîrizibwe okukuza Nyakasane n’enyimbo, boshi haguma bâli magana abirhi na makumi gali munâni na munâni. <verse eid="1CH 25:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CH 25:8"/>Banaciyêsha ecigole mpu lyo bamanya kurhi bakazikulikirana omu mikolo buzira kulondôla emisole n’abashosi, erhi nîsi abimbiza bakola bayish’iyimba n’abaciyiga okuyimba. <verse eid="1CH 25:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CH 25:9"/>Owacîshozirwe wa burhanzi ye Yozefu, mugala wa Azafi. Owa kabirhi Gedaliya, ye haguma n’abagala na bene wâbo, bantu ikumi na babirhi. <verse eid="1CH 25:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CH 25:10"/>Owa kasharhu àli Zakuru, haguma n’abagala na bene wâbo, bantu ikumi na babirhi. <verse eid="1CH 25:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CH 25:11"/>Owa kani Isri, haguma n’abagala na bene wâbo, bantu ikumi na bahirhi. <verse eid="1CH 25:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CH 25:12"/>Owa karhanu Netanyahu, haguma n’abagala na bene wâbo, bantu ikumi na babirhi. <verse eid="1CH 25:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CH 25:13"/>Owa kali ndarhu àli Bukiya, haguma n’abagala na bene wâbo, bantu ikumi na babirhi. <verse eid="1CH 25:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CH 25:14"/>Owa kali nda àli Yesarela; ye baguma n’abagala na bene wâbo, bantu ikumi na babirhi. <verse eid="1CH 25:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CH 25:15"/>Owa kali munâni. Yeshaya, ye haguma n’abagala na bene wâbo, bantu ikumi na babirhi. <verse eid="1CH 25:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CH 25:16"/>Owa kali mwenda, Mataniya, haguma n’abagala na bene wâbo, bantu ikumi na babirhi. <verse eid="1CH 25:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CH 25:17"/>Owa kal’ikumi, Shimeyi; ye haguma n’abagala na bene wâbo, bantu ikumi na babirhi. <verse eid="1CH 25:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CH 25:18"/>Owa kal’ikumi na muguma Azareli; ye haguma n’abagala na bene wâbo, bantu ikumi na babirhi. <verse eid="1CH 25:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CH 25:19"/>Owa kal’iku mi na kabirhi: Hashabiya; ye haguma n’abagala na bene wâbo, bantu ikumi na babirhi. <verse eid="1CH 25:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CH 25:20"/>Owa kal’ikumi na basharhu àli Shubaheli; ye n’abagala na bene wâbo, bantu ikumi na babirhi. <verse eid="1CH 25:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CH 25:21"/>Owa kal’ikumi na bâni Matitiya; ye haguma n’abagala na bene wâbo, bantu ikumi na babirhi. <verse eid="1CH 25:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CH 25:22"/>Owa kal’ikumi na barhanu Yeremoti; ye haguma n’abagala na bene wâbo, bantu ikumi na babirhi. <verse eid="1CH 25:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CH 25:23"/>Owa kal’ikumi na ndarhu Hananiya; ye haguma n’abagala na bene wâbo, bantu ikumi na babirhi. <verse eid="1CH 25:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CH 25:24"/>Owa kal’ikumi na nda Yoshebekasha; ye haguma n’abagala na bene wâbo, bantu ikumi na babirhi. <verse eid="1CH 25:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1CH 25:25"/>Owa kal’ikumi na munâni Hanani; ye haguma n’abagala na bene wâbo, bantu ikumi na babirhi. <verse eid="1CH 25:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1CH 25:26"/>Owa kal’ikumi na mwenda Maloti; ye haguma n’abagala na bene wâbo bantu ikumi na babirhi. <verse eid="1CH 25:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1CH 25:27"/>Owa kali makumi abirhi Eliyata; ye haguma n’abagala na bene wâbo, bantu ikumi na babirhi. <verse eid="1CH 25:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1CH 25:28"/>Owa kali makumi abirhi na muguma Hotiri; ye haguma n’abagala na bene wâbo, bantu ikumi na babirhi. <verse eid="1CH 25:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1CH 25:29"/>Owa kali makumi abirhi na babirhi Gidalati; ye haguma n’abagala na bene wâbo, bantu ikumi na babirhi. <verse eid="1CH 25:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1CH 25:30"/>Omuntu wa kali makumi abirhi na basharhu àli Mahaziyoti; ye haguma n’abagala na bene wâbo, bantu ikumi na babirhi. <verse eid="1CH 25:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1CH 25:31"/>Omuntu wa kali makumi abirhi na bâni àli Romamti-Ezeri; ye haguma n’abagala na bene wâbo, bantu ikumi na babirhi.<verse eid="1CH 25:31"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1CH 25"/>
  <chapter number="26" style="c" sid="1CH 26"/>
  <para style="s1">Abalanzi b’emihango</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CH 26:1"/>Abalanzi b’emihango nabo bàgwêrhe eyâbo mirhwe. Meshelemiya, mugala wa Korè, mwinjikulu wa Abiyasafi, w’obûko bwa Korè, <verse eid="1CH 26:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CH 26:2"/>aburha bagala nda: kwo bakulikirîne ntya, Zakariya, Yediyaeli, Zebadiya, Yatiniyeli, <verse eid="1CH 26:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CH 26:3"/>Elamu, Yohanani na Eliyehoyenayi. <verse eid="1CH 26:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CH 26:4"/>Obedi-Edomu aburha bagala munâni: bakulikirana ntya, Shemaya, Yozabadi, Yowa, Sakari, Netanaeli, <verse eid="1CH 26:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CH 26:5"/>Amiyeli, Yisakari na Peultayi. Nêci Nyamuzinda àligishire Obedi-Edomu. <verse eid="1CH 26:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CH 26:6"/>Enfula yâge Shemaya yàburha abâna bàgwêrhe ecikono cikulu omu mulala gwâbo, bulya bâli bantu ntwâli. <verse eid="1CH 26:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CH 26:7"/>Bagala ba Shemaya bo bâli Otni, Refaheli, Obedi, Elzabadi, kuhirakwo na bene wâbo Elihu na Semakiya, bombi bantu bakengwa bwenêne. <verse eid="1CH 26:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CH 26:8"/>Abo bene Obedi-Edomu, haguma na bagala bâbo nabo n’abandi babusi bâbo, boshi bâli bantu ba lukengwa bayunjulirîne misî omu mukolo gwâbo. Boshi haguma bâli bantu makumi gali ndarhu na babirhi.<verse eid="1CH 26:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CH 26:9"/>Omurhwe gwa Shelemiya gwalimwo abagala na bene wâbo, boshi haguma bâli bantu bakengwa ikumi na munâni. <verse eid="1CH 26:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CH 26:10"/>Hosa, w’oku bûko bwa Merari, aburha bagala bâni: Shimri, ye wa burhanzi omu mulala, n’obwo arhali ye wali nfula, îshe amuhà eco cikono ca burhanzi, <verse eid="1CH 26:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CH 26:11"/>Hilkiya wa kabirhi, Tebaliya wa kasharhu, na Zakariya wa kani; omurhwe gwa Hosa, gulimwo abagala na bene wâbo, gwàli gwa balume ikumi na basharhu. <verse eid="1CH 26:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CH 26:12"/>Abarhambo n’abantu b’eyo mi rhwe y’abalanzi b’emihango boshi haguma bakâg’iyûkiriza omukolo gwâbo omu kâ-Nyamuzinda ka Nyakasane. <verse eid="1CH 26:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CH 26:13"/>Bagahâna emihango y’okukazilanga omu kuyesha ccigole nk’oku emilala yâbo yanali, emisole n’abashosi boshi haguma. <verse eid="1CH 26:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CH 26:14"/>Shelemiya ecigole camuhà omuhango gw’ebushoshôkero. Omugala Zakariya waliyunjulirine makengu manji, ecigole camuhà omuhango gw’ebule mbè. <verse eid="1CH 26:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CH 26:15"/>Obedi-Edomu ahâbwa obulanzi bw’omuhango gw’ebulyo, n’abagala okukazilanga enguli z’embîko. <verse eid="1CH 26:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CH 26:16"/>Shupimu na Hosa bagabâna obulanzi bw’omuhango gw’ebuzikiro n’obw’omuhango gwakâgiderhwa muhango gwa mugongo mutwe, hôfi n’enjira yàsôkeraga enyanya. Eyo mirhwe yàlihîrwe obulanzi kwo yàligabirwe ntya: <verse eid="1CH 26:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CH 26:17"/>aha muhango gw’ebushoshôkero, baleviti ndarhu ngasi lusiku; aha muhango gw’ebulembe, bâni ngasi lusiku; ebwa nguli z’embîko, mirhwe ibirhi ya babirhi-babirhi; <verse eid="1CH 26:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CH 26:18"/>oku myûbako yàliyûshwîrwe ebuzikiro, bantu bâni oku njira na babirhi omu myûbako mwo na nênè. <verse eid="1CH 26:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CH 26:19"/>Ntyo kwo emirhwe y’abalanzi bàrhôlagwa omu bûko bwa Korè n’obwa Merari yali eyôsire.<verse eid="1CH 26:19"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Emikolo yago-yago yàlihîrwe baguma-baguma</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CH 26:20"/>Abandi baleviti<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">26, 20 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Baleviti, ciri cinwa ca nfarasè «Lévites» kwo kuderha «BENE-LEVI», ba bûko bwa Levi.</char></note> bàgwêrhe omukolo gw’okulanga obuhirhi bw’omu kâ­-Nyamuzinda n’ebirugu bitagatîfu birherekîrwe Nyakasane. <verse eid="1CH 26:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CH 26:21"/>Abâna ba Ladani, w’omu bûko bwa Gershoni, bakulu b’emilala yâbo, ye wali Yehiyeli. <verse eid="1CH 26:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CH 26:22"/>na kandi bagala ba Yehiyeli, Zetamu bo n’omulumuna Yoheli, bàgwêrhe omukolo gw’okulanga obuhirhi bw’omu kâ-Nyamuzinda ka Nyakasane. <verse eid="1CH 26:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CH 26:23"/>Omu bûko bwa Amuramu, obûko bwa Isari, obwa Hebroni n’obwa Aziyeli, <verse eid="1CH 26:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CH 26:24"/>Shebuweli, wa kuli bene Gershomi, ye mugala wa Mûsa yenêne, ye wali mulanzi mukulu w’embîko. <verse eid="1CH 26:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1CH 26:25"/>Oku nkomôka yâbo kwàli ecinyamulala ca bene Eliyezeri, mulumuna wa Gershoni bo: Rehabiya, mugala wa Eliyezeri, kandi Yeshaya, Yoramu, Zikri na Shelomiti. <verse eid="1CH 26:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1CH 26:26"/>Shelomiti haguma na bene wâbo bahâbwa omukolo gw’okulanga ebirugu byàlirherekîrwe Nyamuzinda byajiragwa na mwâmi Daudi, n’abakulu b’emilala, n’abarhambo b’abasirika bayîmangira emirhwe y’ebihumbi, erhi magana erhi makumi. <verse eid="1CH 26:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1CH 26:27"/>Bâli bababerwiremwo ecigabi c’okukâshîbirira enyumpa ya Nyakasane, <verse eid="1CH 26:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1CH 26:28"/>haguma n’ebirugu bitagatîfu omulêbi Samweli àhiragamwo, n’ebya Saulu, mugala wa Kishi, Abneri, mugala wa Neri, n’ebya Yowabu mugala wa Seruya. Ebyo birugu bitagatîfu byàlirherekirwe Nyakasane byoshi byàkâgilangwa na Shelomiti haguma na bene waho.<verse eid="1CH 26:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="1CH 26:29"/>Kenaniya bo n’abagala. b’oku bûko bwa Isari, bàgwêrhe emikolo y’embuga omu cihugo c’Israheli, bo bâli bandisi na bacîranuzi. <verse eid="1CH 26:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1CH 26:30"/>Hashabiya bo na bandi bantu cihumbi ciguma na magana gali nda ba ntwâli b’obûko bwa Hebroni, bàkâgilanga ecihugo c’Israheli c’ebuzikiro bwa Yordani; hàgwêrhe emikolo eyêrekîre olubaga oku by’idini n’eby’ecihugo. <verse eid="1CH 26:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1CH 26:31"/>Yeriya ye wali murhambo mukulu w’obûko bwa Hebroni. Omu mwâka gwa makumi anni gw’obwâmi bwa Daudi, balongereza amâburhwa gayêrekîre obwo bûko, babugâna abalume b’entwâli e Yazeri omu Galadi ba kw’obwo bûko. <verse eid="1CH 26:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="1CH 26:32"/>Mwâmi Daudi abarhôlamwo bantu bihumbi bibirhi na magana gali nda ga kw’obwo bûko, abafumbika Yeriya mpu boshi haguma bakazirhabalana oku mikolo eyêrekîre eby’idini n’eby’ecihugo, omu cishagala càyûbakagwamwo n’abantu b’oku bûko bwa Rubeni na Gadi, n’ecigabi c’ebushoshôkero c’obûko bwa Menashè.<verse eid="1CH 26:32"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1CH 26"/>
  <chapter number="27" style="c" sid="1CH 27"/>
  <para style="s1">Entondekanyè y’abasirika oku bwâmi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CH 27:1"/>Bene-Israheli nk’oku omuganjo gwâbo gwanali, abakulu b’emilala, abarhambo b’abasirika bihumbi, ab’amagana, abandisi bâbo, boshi bàjiraga omukolo gw’okurhumikira olubaga lwâbo. Eyo mirhwe yoshi yàkâg’ilola ngasi kantu kanayêrekîre mwâmi. Ngasi mwêzi omu mwâka hàkâgibà omu rhwe gw’okulola mukolo mulebe mw’ogwo mwêzi. Ngasi murhwe gwàli gwa balume bihumbi makumi abirhi na bini.<verse eid="1CH 27:1"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CH 27:2"/>Omwimangizi w’omurhwe murhanzi gwagwêrhe omukolo omu mwêzi gwa burhanzi ye wali Yashobamu, mugala wa Zabdiyeli, ayîmangiraga murhwe gwa balume bihumbi makumi abirhi na bini, <verse eid="1CH 27:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CH 27:3"/>w’oku bûko bwa Peresi, ye wali murhambo mukulu w’emirhwe yoshi y’ogwo mwêzi gwa burhanzi. <verse eid="1CH 27:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CH 27:4"/>Omwimangizi w’omurhwe gwa kabirhi ye wali Dodayi w’e Ahowa; ayîmangiraga murhwe gwa balume bihumbi makumi abirhi na bini. <verse eid="1CH 27:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CH 27:5"/>Omwimangizi w’omurhwe gwa kasharhu gw’okukola omu mwêzi gwa kasharhu, àli Benayahu mugala wa Yoyada, mudâhwa mukulu. Ayîmangiraga bantu bihumbi makumi abirhi na bini. <verse eid="1CH 27:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CH 27:6"/>Benayahu ye olya wali omu murhwe gwa ntwâli «Makumi-Asharhu»<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">27, 6 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Okumanya kulusha, olole <char style="xt"><ref loc="1CH 11:22-25">11, 22-25</ref></char>.</char></note>, erhi bamujira murhambo w’ebyo bihumbi, omugala Amizabadi ajà ahâli hâge. <verse eid="1CH 27:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CH 27:7"/>Omwimangizi wa kani w’omwêzi gwa kani àli Asaeli, mulumuna wa Yowabu, n’enyuma zâge abà omugala Zebadiya. Ayîmangiraga balume bihumbi maku mi abirhi na bini. <verse eid="1CH 27:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CH 27:8"/>Owa karhanu oku mwêzi gwa karhanu àli Shamhuti, w’obûko bwa Yizra. Ayîmangiraga bantu bihumbi makumi abirhi na bini. <verse eid="1CH 27:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CH 27:9"/>Owa kali ndarhu omu mwêzi gwa ndarhu, àli Ira, mugala wa Ikeshi w’e Tekowa. Ayîmangiraga murhwe gwa bantu bihumbi makumi abirhi na bini. <verse eid="1CH 27:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CH 27:10"/>Owa kali nda, ow’omwêzi gwa nda àli Helesi, w’e Peloni, w’omu bûko bwa Efrayimu, ayîmangiraga murhwe gwa balume bihumbi makumi abirhi na bini. <verse eid="1CH 27:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CH 27:11"/>Owa kali munâni omu mwêzi gwa kali munâni ye wali Sibkayi, w’e Husha, w’omu bûko bwa Zera. Ayîmangiraga bantu bihumbi makumi abirhi na bini. <verse eid="1CH 27:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CH 27:12"/>Owa kali mwenda, ow’okukola omu mwêzi gwa mwenda àli Abiyezeri, w’e Anatoti, w’oku bûko bwa Benyamini. Ayîmangiraga murhwe gwa bantu bihumbi makumi abirhi na bini. <verse eid="1CH 27:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CH 27:13"/>Owa kal’ikumi, ow’okukola mw’ogwo mwêzi gwa kal’ikumi ali Maharayi, w’e Toda, w’oku bûko bwa Zera. Ayîmangiraga murhwe gwa bantu bihumbi makumi abirhi na bini. <verse eid="1CH 27:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CH 27:14"/>Owa kal’ikumi na muguma, ow’okukola omu mwêzi gw’ikumi na muguma, àli Benaya w’e Piratoni, w’oku bûko bwa Efrayimu. Ali murhambo wa murhwe gwa balume bihumbi makumi abirhi na bini. <verse eid="1CH 27:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CH 27:15"/>Omuntu wa kal’ikumi na bahirhi, ow’okukola omu mwêzi gw’ikumi na kabirhi, àli Heldayi, w’e Netofa, wa bûko bwa Otiniyeli. Ali murhambo wa murhwe gwa bantu bihumbi makumi abirhi na bini.<verse eid="1CH 27:15"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Abimangizi b’amûko g’Israheli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CH 27:16"/>Abimangizi b’amûko g’Israheli: Obûko bwa Rubeni, Eliyezeri, mugala wa Zikri. Obûko bwa Simoni: Shefatiya, mugala wa Maaka. <verse eid="1CH 27:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CH 27:17"/>Obûko bwa Levi: Hashabiya, mugala wa Kemuweli. Abà kuli Aroni: Sadoki. <verse eid="1CH 27:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CH 27:18"/>Obûko bwa Yûda: Elihu, mwene wâbo mwâmi Daudi. Obûko bwa Isakari: Omri, mugala wa Mikaeli.<verse eid="1CH 27:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CH 27:19"/>Obûko bwa Zabuloni: Yishemayahu, mugala wa Obadiya. Obûko bwa Nefutali: Yerimoti, mugala wa Azriyeli. <verse eid="1CH 27:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CH 27:20"/>Obûko bwa Efrayimu: Hozeya, mugala wa Azaziya. Ecigabi c’obûko bwa Menashè c’ebuzikiro: Yoheli, mugala wa Pedaya. <verse eid="1CH 27:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CH 27:21"/>Ecigabi c’obûko bwa Manasi c’ebushoshôkero, cibà omu Galadi: Ido, mugala wa Zakariya. Obûko bwa Benyamini: Yasiyeli, mugala wa Abneri, <verse eid="1CH 27:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CH 27:22"/>Obûko bwa Dani: Azareli, mugala wa Yerohamu. Abo bo bâli barha mbo bakulu b’emilala ya bene-Israheli.<verse eid="1CH 27:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CH 27:23"/>Daudi àrhalonzagya mpu baganje emisole y’emyâka makumi abirhi na kuhêka idako, bulya Nyakasane àli erhi adesire oku aluza bene-Israheli babè banji nka nyenyêzi z’oku nkuba. <verse eid="1CH 27:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CH 27:24"/>Yowabu, mugala wa Seruya, àli erhi amarhondêra okuganja, ci kwône arhaciyusagya, bulya Nyamuzinda ayirukira akunirira Israheli erhi ogwo mukolo gurhuma. Co cirhumire omubalè gw’olubaga lwoshi gurhabà omu citabu ciderhwa «Ebijiro bya mwâmi Daudi».<verse eid="1CH 27:24"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Abalanzi b’ebirugu by’ebwâmi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="1CH 27:25"/>Azmaveti, mugala wa Adiyeli, àli mulanzi w’omuhako gw’oku bwâmi. Yehonatani, mugala wa Uziya, àli mulanzi w’enguli zàli omu cihugo, omu bishagala n’emirhundu n’ebwa ngo z’abalanzi. <verse eid="1CH 27:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1CH 27:26"/>Ezri, mugala wa Kelubu, àli mwimangizi w’abahinzi bakola omu cihugo. <verse eid="1CH 27:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1CH 27:27"/>Shimeyi, w’e Rama, àli mulanzi w’abahinzi b’emizâbîbu. Zabdi, w’e Shefamu, àli mulanzi wa kuhika irivayi lirhenga mw’ezo nkoma z’emizâbîbu. <verse eid="1CH 27:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1CH 27:28"/>Baali-Hanani, w’e Beti-Gederi, àli mwimangizi w’amashwa g’emizêti n’emihumbahumba y’omu lubanda. Yowashi àli mulanzi w’embîko z’amavurha. <verse eid="1CH 27:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1CH 27:29"/>Shitrayi, w’e Sharoni, àli Lungere mukulu w’amasò g’enkafu ziyâbukira e Sharoni. Shafati, mugala wa Adlayi, àli Lungere-mwimangizi w’agandi masô g’enkafu ziyâbukira omu mmanda na handi-handi. <verse eid="1CH 27:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1CH 27:30"/>Obili, muismaeliti, àli mwimangizi w’engamiya. Yediya, w’e Meremoti, àli mwimangizi w’endogomi-kazi. <verse eid="1CH 27:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1CH 27:31"/>Yazizi, Muhagiri, àli mwimangizi w’ebibuzi n’empene. Olwo lwo lukalaba lw’amazîno g’abantu balanzi b’ebirugu bya mwâmi Daudi.<verse eid="1CH 27:31"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Abarhonyi b'oku bwâmi bwa Daudi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="1CH 27:32"/>Yehonatani, mwishè wa Daudi, muntu wa bukengêre na mwenge, ye wali muhanûzi wa mwâmi: Yehiyeli, mugala wa Hakmoni, ye wali mulezi w’okuyigîriza abâna ba mwâmi. <verse eid="1CH 27:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="1CH 27:33"/>Ahitofeli, naye àli muhanûzi wa mwâmi. Hushayi w’e Arkiti, àli murhonyi wa mwâmi. <verse eid="1CH 27:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="1CH 27:34"/>Yehoyada, mugala wa Benaya, na Abiyatari, bo bàjîre ahâli ha Ahitofeli okubà bahanûzi ba mwâmi. Naye Yowabu ye wali murhambo mukulu w’emirhwe yoshi y’abasirika ba mwâmi.<verse eid="1CH 27:34"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1CH 27"/>
  <chapter number="28" style="c" sid="1CH 28"/>
  <para style="s1">Daudi ayêrekana Salomoni oku ye wâyîme omu byâge</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CH 28:1"/>Mwâmi Daudi ashûbûliza abarhambo b’Israheli boshi aha Yeruzalemu: abarhambo bakulu b’emilala, abarhambo b’emirhwe y’abasirika bakolera oku bwâmi, abarhambo b’emirhwe y’engabo z’abasirika b’ecihugo coshi, abimangizi b’ebirugu n’ab’amasò ga mwâmi n’aga bagala ba mwâmi, n’abantu barhonyi b’oku bwâmi, abasirika b’entwâli kulusha na ngasi bantu b’entwâli boshi. <verse eid="1CH 28:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CH 28:2"/>Mwâmi Daudi anacibabwîra, erhi: «Mwe bantu b’olubaga lwâni, bîra bâni, munyumvîrhize. Nali ngwêrhe omuhigo gw’okuyûbaka akà-Nyamuzinda nti mpiremwo omucîmba gw’Amalaganyo ga Nyakasane, kabè citumbi c’okudêkerezakwo amagulu ga Nyamuzinda wîrhu. Nali erhi narheganyize byoshi kuli ogwo mukolo. <verse eid="1CH 28:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CH 28:3"/>“Ci kwône Nyamuzinda àmbwîra, erhi: Arhali we wanyûbakira akà­ Nyamuzinda abantu bayishikamparamizamwo, bulya oli muntu wa birha, wa bulazire mukò munji”. <verse eid="1CH 28:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CH 28:4"/>“N’obwo nie Nyakasane Nyamuzinda w’Israheli acîshozire omu mulala gwa larha gwoshi, mpu lyo nie rhwe n’iburha lyâni rhukaziyôrha rhuyîma omu Israheli emyâka n’emyâka. Mîra mîra àcîshozire Yûda nka muluzi w’omulala, buzinda, omu mulala gwa Yûda, acîshogamwo omulala gwa larha, na kandi, muli bagala ba larha, asîma okujiramwo mwâmi wa bene-Israheli boshi”. <verse eid="1CH 28:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CH 28:5"/>“Buno, omu bâna banji banji ànshobôzize, àcîshoziremwo Salomoni mpu ayîshija oku ntebe y’obwâmi arhegeke Israheli yêshi oku buhabûzi bwa Nyakasane”. <verse eid="1CH 28:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CH 28:6"/>“Ambwîzire, erhi: Mugala wâwe Salomoni ye wanyûbakira aka-Nyamuzinda n’embaraza zako zoshi, bulya ye nacîshozire; àyîshibà mugala wâni, nâni mbè îshe”. <verse eid="1CH 28:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CH 28:7"/>“Mmurheganyize obwâmi bwâyorhaho ensiku zoshi erhi akabîkirira n’okushimba bwinjinjà amarhegeko gâni n’amahano gâni”. <verse eid="1CH 28:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CH 28:8"/>“Lêro bunôla, bîra bâni, embere z’Israheli yêshi lubaga lwa Nyakasane, n’embere za Nyamuzinda wîrhu odwîrhe arhuyumva, mucîrheganyagye okushimba amarhegeko ga Nyamuzinda wîrhu goshi. Ntyo lyo mwayôrha mubêzire mw’eci cihugo cinjinja munayîshicisigira abâna binyu kashambala oku nsiku zoshi”. <verse eid="1CH 28:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CH 28:9"/>“Nâwe wêne, mwâna wâni Salomoni, ocîyigirize okumanya bwinjà Nyamuzinda nakoleraga, omuharâmye n’omurhima muguma n’obukengêre budêkerîre. Bulya nêci Nyakasane anabone kuhika omu ndubi y’omurhima anayîshi enkengêro z’abantu zoshi. Okamulongereza, acikwîyêreka, ci kwône okamuleka, akujahika lwoshi lwoshi”. <verse eid="1CH 28:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CH 28:10"/>“Wanabonaga buno oku Nyakasane àcikwîshozire mpu omuyûbakire akà-Nyamuzinda kâbà Cirhinyiro câge. Ozibubâge kirumè onacibande omu mikolo”».<verse eid="1CH 28:10"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Daudi àhà Salomoni olugero lw’aka-Nyamuzinda</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CH 28:11"/>Daudi anacihêreza Salomoni olugero lw’Ecirhînyiro n’embaraza zâco zoshi, eminene y’okujàmwo embîko, eminene y’emuhanda n’ey’omu côgo, n’olugero lw’enyumpa y’okujamwo Omucîmba gw’Amalaganyo. <verse eid="1CH 28:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CH 28:12"/>Amuhà kandi n’olugero lwa ngasi byoshi àli alonzize okuyûbaka: ebyôgo by’akà-Nyamuzinda, ebyumpa by’eburhambi bw’ecôgo, ebyumpa bijirirwe okuhiramwo obuhirhi bw’aka-Nyamuzinda n’ebirugu bitagatîfu birherekîrwe Nyamuzinda. <verse eid="1CH 28:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CH 28:13"/>Anacimubà ecitabu c’olukalaba lw’amazîno g’abadâhwa n’ag’abaleviti, ecitabu c’emikolo yakazijirwa omu nyumpa ya Nyakasane, ecitabu c’ebirugu by’obugashânize bw’omu ka-Nyamuzinda. <verse eid="1CH 28:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CH 28:14"/>Amuyêreka ebidanga hy’amasholo, ago masholo gàli garheganyîbwe oku birugu bya mikolo minji. Kandi anamuyêreka ebidanga by’olunyerere, nabyo byàli birheganyîbwe oku kushîga ngasi kalugu ka lunyerere kàli kahizirwe omu mikolo minji. <verse eid="1CH 28:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CH 28:15"/>Amulangûla ebidanga byàli birheganyîbwe oku kushîga orhumole rhw’amasholo, n’amatara gârhwo, agôla masholo gàli gamàshanwa bunya-bidanga gàli garheganyizîbwe ngasi kamole na ngasi itara kwabyo kwabyo. Ebidanga by’olunyerere nabyo kwo byàli birheganyîbwe ntyo, kuli ngasi kamole na ngasi itara. <verse eid="1CH 28:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CH 28:16"/>Amuyêreka ebidanga by’amasholo byàli birheganyîbwe oku masholo g’amêza gàyîshikâja aha bâli barheganyize amêza g’emigati. Kwo na kwo oku mêza gàli g’olunyerere, bagarheganyiza nago ebyâgo bidanga by’olunyerere. <verse eid="1CH 28:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CH 28:17"/>Amuyêreka emishurhi, orhubêhè rhw’okujàmwo amîshi g’okukangûla olubaga, amuyêreka ebidanga by’oku rhulaha rhw’amasholo gône gône, eby’embale z’amasholo n’ez’amarhale nk’oku byànakazâg’ikolesibwa. <verse eid="1CH 28:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CH 28:18"/>Amuyêreka ebidanga by’amasholo gônene, biri bya kukola oku luhêrero lw’obukù. Anacimuhà olwiganyo lw’oku bâtula engâlè ya Nyamuzinda, oku bâtula enshusho za bamalahika n’amasholo, ebyûbi byâbo byàli bikwânîne bishanjûkire ebwa mucîmba gw’Amalaganyo ga Nyamubâho, <verse eid="1CH 28:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CH 28:19"/>byoshi nka kulya Nyamubâho yênene ànabigerengeranyagya mpu lyo bahash’iyumva omukolo abahûnyire omu kubahà olwo lugero.<verse eid="1CH 28:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CH 28:20"/>Cazînda ayûshûla, erhi: «Mwâna wâni, obè ntwâli onazibuhe; ocîbande omu mikolo buzira bwôba, orhajugumaga! Nyakasane Nyamuzinda wâni arhakulekêrere; ali haguma nâwe anakugwâsa kuhika oyûkirize emikolo yoshi y’okumuyûbakira akà-Nyamuzinda. <verse eid="1CH 28:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CH 28:21"/>“Abadâhwa n’abaleviti bàkeresirwe omu mirhwe oku kujira obugashânize bw’akà-Nyamuzinda, nabo bali eburhambi bwâwe oku kukugwâsa; na kandi kuli ogwo mukolo gwâjirwa, wanacîkubagira abantu b’obulonza bwinjà na ba buhashe omu barhambo n’omu lubaga lwâwe lwoshi”».<verse eid="1CH 28:21"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1CH 28"/>
  <chapter number="29" style="c" sid="1CH 29"/>
  <para style="s1">Entûlo y’okuyûbaka akà-Nyamuzinda</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CH 29:1"/>Mwâmi Daudi anacibwîra eyo ndêko y’abantu boshi bàliho, erhi: «Mugala wâni Salomoni, oyu Nyakasane àcîshozire, aciri murhò, na ntà bwenge acîbona. N’obwo omukolo gwâjirwa gurhali munyi, bulya arhali nyumpa ya muntu yàyûbakwa, ci nyumpa ya Nyakasane, Nyamuzinda». <verse eid="1CH 29:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CH 29:2"/>Nakolesize emisî yâni yoshi oku marhegayo g’eby’eyo nyumpa ya Nyamuzinda: nalundisire amasholo, amarhale, omulinga, ecûma, empaho, oku ngasi byoshi byâtulwa n’ebyo bintu bya ngasi lubero; narheganyize ennundo zirhali nyi z’amabuye ga Kornalini n’agandi mabuye g’okubambira, amabuye mîru-mîru n’ag’amabara ga ngasi lubero, ngasi lubero lwa mabuye g’ecitwîro cihamu, n’enundo y’ebirâbuye byêru. <verse eid="1CH 29:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CH 29:3"/>N’oku buhirhi bwâni niene, obw’amasholo n’amarhale, mbuhânyire kw’eyo nyumpa ya Nyamuzinda wâni, mbuyushwîre kw’ebi nali barheganyize kw’eco cirhînyiro nzigîre bwenêne. <verse eid="1CH 29:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CH 29:4"/>Mpûnyire talenta igana za masholo g’e Ofiri, na talenta magana abirhi na makumi anni za marhale gacîre ga kushîga oku bisîka by’akà-Nyamuzinda. <verse eid="1CH 29:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CH 29:5"/>Lêro buno, ndi muli mwe ninyu ocihânyire buzira kusêzibwa oku kurhûla Nyakasane amasholo erhi marhale, lyo abakozi bàyishihasha okutula ngasi rhulugurhwoshi rhunakwânîne rhw’amasholo n’orhw’amarhale?<verse eid="1CH 29:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CH 29:6"/>Okubundi abakulu b’emilala, abakulu b’amûko g’Israheli, abarhambo b’amagana erhi ba makumi g’emirhwe y’abasirika, n’abimangizi b’emirhwe y’abakolera mwâmi boshi bayêmêra buzira kusêzibwa okusholôlera omukolo gw’enyumpa ya Nyamuzinda, <verse eid="1CH 29:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CH 29:7"/>talenta bihumbi birhanu bya masholo, mikabulè bihumbi igana bya masholo, talenta magana asharhu na kulusha za marhale, talenta magana gali ndarhu za mulinga na talenta bihumbi bisharhu na kulusha bya cûma. <verse eid="1CH 29:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CH 29:8"/>Abàli bagwêrhe amabuye g’engulo ndârhi bagahêreza Yehiyeli, w’oku bûko bwa Gershoni, by’okujà omu mbîko y’akà-Nyamuzinda ka Nyakasane. <verse eid="1CH 29:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CH 29:9"/>Abo bantu boshi barhûla Nyakasane obuhirhi bwâbo buzira kusêzibwa erhi banasîmire bwenêne, Mwâmi Daudi naye okwo kwamuyunjuza mwishingo.<verse eid="1CH 29:9"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Omusengero gwa Daudi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CH 29:10"/>Daudi anacikuza Nyakasane embere z’endêko y’abantu boshi bàhali, aderha, erhi: «Oyagirwe Nyakasane, Larha Nyamuzinda w’Israheli, kurhenga emyâka n’emyâka. <verse eid="1CH 29:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CH 29:11"/>Yâgirwa, wêne we nn’obukulu n’obuhashe, irenge, okurhwâliha n’obwâmi w’e nnabyo, byoshi omu mpingu na bano igulu bibà byâwe. Muhànyi, we mwâmi, we Nnahano orhegeka igulu, obuhirhi n’irenge kuli we birhenga. <verse eid="1CH 29:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CH 29:12"/>We mwâmi wa byoshi, obuhashe n’irenge omu nfune zâwe bibà, okusêra n’okuyushûka omu maboko gâwe bibà, ogwêrhe obuhashe bw’okulengereza n’okuzibuhya oyu onalonzize wêne. <verse eid="1CH 29:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CH 29:13"/>Co cirhumire, Nyamuzinda wîrhu, rhukukuzize n’okugashâniza Izîno lyâwe likulu bwenêne. <verse eid="1CH 29:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CH 29:14"/>Niono ndi ntâye, n’olubaga lwâni lurhali luci, oku bwîrhu rhwenêne rhurhankahasha okukurhûla zino ntûlo. Byoshi emwâwe rhwabishobôlaga, na ntâco rhwankahashikurhûla cirhanarhenziri emwâwe. <verse eid="1CH 29:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CH 29:15"/>Embere zâwe rhunacîbêrîre bigolo byayankirîrwe n’olukogo lwâwe aka ba shakulûza bîrhu boshi; ensiku zîrhu za bano igulu kwo zigera nka cîhôho, ntà bulangâlire bwa kuyôrhaho rhujira. <verse eid="1CH 29:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CH 29:16"/>Yâgirwa Nyamuzinda wîrhu, ebi birugu binji ntya rhwalundisire nti rhukuyûbakiremwo enyumpa y’okukâharamiza mwo Izîno lyâwe litagatîfu, ebyo byoshi omu maboko gâwe birhenga byoshi bibà birugu byâwe. <verse eid="1CH 29:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CH 29:17"/>Yâgirwa, Nyamuzinda wâni, mmanyire oku onalole e nkengêro zîrhu nfulike, n’oku orhahimwa kurhonya obushinganyanya; obwîne oku murhima gw’okunali narhûziremwo buzira kusêzibwa na ndi obuhirhi bwâni, nanabwîne ene oku olu lubaga lwâwe lucîgushire hano nalwo lwajira ntyo n’obushagaluke bunene. <verse eid="1CH 29:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CH 29:18"/>Yâgirwa Nyakasane, Nyamuzinda wa ba shakulûza bîrhu Abrahamu, Izaki na Yakôbo, oyêmêre olubaga lwâwe lukaziyôrha lugwêrhe obwo bwôrhere bwinjà omu murhima, enkengêro zâlwo zikaziyôrha zikuyêrekîre wêne ensiku zoshi. <verse eid="1CH 29:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CH 29:19"/>Naye mugala wâni Salomoni, omushobòze omurhima mwîrhôhye oku kushimba amarhegeko gâwe, amalaganyo gâwe n’amahano gâwe, n’okubikirira bwinjà, anakuyûbakire eci rhînyiro càrhumaga narheganya ebi byoshi.» <verse eid="1CH 29:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CH 29:20"/>Cazînda Daudi abwîra eyo ndêko y’abantu yoshi, erhi: «Muvuge Nyakasane Nyamuzinda winyu omunkwa.» Boshi banacivuga Nyakasane Nyamuzinda wa bashakulûza bâbo omu nkwa; bafukama bahwera oku idaho bahà Nyakasane bo na mwâmi irenge.<verse eid="1CH 29:20"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Salomoni àyimikwa mwâmi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CH 29:21"/>Erhi buca, bene-Israheli barhûla Nyakasane enterekêro z’okusingônolwa n’enterekêro z’omurhûla: barhûla mpanzi cihumbi, bihebe cihumbi, bâna-buzi cihumbi, haguma n’enterekêro bayôrha bajira z’ebinyôbwa, na zindi nterekêro nyinji bwenêne kuli bene-Israheli boshi. <verse eid="1CH 29:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CH 29:22"/>Olwo lusiku balya bananywêra e mbêre za Nyakasane omu bushagaluke bunene. Okubundi, Salomoni mugala wa Daudi erhi. bayûsimujira mwâmi wa kabirhi, bamushîga amavurha oku Izîno lya Nyakasane, na Sadoki mpu naye abè mudâhwa. <verse eid="1CH 29:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CH 29:23"/>Salomoni atamala oku ntebe y’obwâmi bwa Nyakasane, àrhondêra okurhegeka Israheli ahâli ha Daudi. Ayôloloka bwenêne na bene-Israheli boshi bakazimuyumva. <verse eid="1CH 29:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CH 29:24"/>Abakulu b’abasirika n’entwâli zoshi, ciru na bagala ba mwâmi Daudi bacîhira idako ly’oburhegesi bwa mwâmi Salomoni. <verse eid="1CH 29:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1CH 29:25"/>Nyakasane aha Salomoni olukengwa lunene emwa bene-Israheli boshi, n’obwâmi bwâge bwajà irenge bwenêne kulusha ngasi wundi yêshi warhanzirirhegeka Israheli embere zâge.<verse eid="1CH 29:25"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Okufà kwa Daudi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="1CH 29:26"/>Daudi, mugala wa Yese, àli àyîmire omu Israheli mwoshi. <verse eid="1CH 29:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1CH 29:27"/>Obwâmi bwâge kuli bene-Israheli bwashinzire myâka makumi anni yoshi: àyîmire myâka nda omu cishagala c’e Hebroni, na myâka makumi asharhu n’isharhu omu cishagala c’e Yeruzalemu. <verse eid="1CH 29:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1CH 29:28"/>Afà omu bushosi bwinjà erhi amàyusa nsiku nyinji ayunjulirîne bugale n’olukengwa. Omugala Salomoni ayîma omu byâge.<verse eid="1CH 29:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="1CH 29:29"/>Ebijiro bya mwâmi Daudi, kurhenga aha murhondêro kuhika ebuzinda bwâge, biyandisirwe omu citabu c’omulêbi Samweli, n’omu citabu c’omulêbi Natani, n’omu citabu c’omulêbi Gadi. <verse eid="1CH 29:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1CH 29:30"/>Emyanzi y’obwâmi bwâge bwoshi, oku àrhwalihaga kwoshi, n’emyanzi y’iragi àbwîne n’obuhanya àbwîne, emyanzi y’Israheli yêshi n’ey’agandi mâmi g’igulu lyoshi, byoshi mwo binali omwo.<verse eid="1CH 29:30"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1CH 29"/>
</usx>
